window.ACP_Q=[{"id":"120.1.1-e01","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A contractor was added to the Developers project role but reports that they can't log in to Jira at all. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"一位外包人員被加進 Developers project role，卻回報完全無法登入 Jira。最可能的原因？","zo":["外包人員沒有 Jira 的 product access","外包人員不在 jira-administrators group","Permission scheme 沒有把 Browse Projects 給 Developers","外包人員需要 Browse users and groups 全域權限"],"fig":"","opts":["The contractor lacks Jira product access","The contractor isn't in the jira-administrators group","The permission scheme lacks Browse Projects for Developers","The contractor needs the Browse users and groups global permission"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。沒有 Jira 的 product access（app 存取），project role 與 permission 都無法讓人進入 Jira。","B":"錯。一般使用者不需要 admin group。","C":"錯。缺 Browse 會看不到 project，但仍能登入 Jira。","D":"錯。這個權限只影響能看到哪些使用者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-e02","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An employee is going on a three-month leave and should regain the exact same groups and roles when they return, without being billed in between. What should the admin do?","zh":"一位員工要請三個月假，回來時要恢復完全相同的 group 與角色，期間不要計費。Admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["移除使用者，之後再邀請","暫停（suspend）使用者存取，之後再還原","刪除使用者的 Atlassian 帳號","把使用者從所有 group 移除"],"fig":"","opts":["Remove the user and re-invite later","Suspend the user's access and restore it later","Delete the user's Atlassian account","Remove the user from all groups"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Remove 後要重新邀請，角色與 group 都要重設。","B":"對。官方：suspend 不計費；restore 後角色與 group 自動恢復。","C":"錯。刪除帳號是永久的。","D":"錯。手動移除 group 之後還要手動加回，而且仍可能計費（若仍有 app 存取）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-e03","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"An admin deletes the 'contractors' group. What is the impact? (Choose two.)","zh":"Admin 刪除了「contractors」group。影響為何？（選兩個）","zo":["Permission scheme 中透過這個 group 給的權限不再生效","使用者仍留在 organization","所有用到這個 group 的 project 被刪除","下次登入時 group 會自動重建","Group 裡的使用者被從 organization 刪除"],"fig":"","opts":["Permissions granted through the group in permission schemes stop applying","The users remain in the organization","All projects using the group are deleted","The group is automatically recreated at next login","The users in the group are deleted from the organization"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。用該 group 設定的權限（permission scheme、global permission 等）都會失效。","B":"對。使用者仍在 organization。","C":"錯。不會刪除 project。","D":"錯。不會自動重建。","E":"錯。官方：刪 group 不會把使用者移出 organization。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/delete-a-group/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-e04","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Acme verified the domain acme.com. Jane uses jane@acme.com but her account hasn't been claimed. What is Jane's account type, and what can Acme do?","zh":"Acme 已驗證 acme.com 網域。Jane 使用 jane@acme.com，但帳號尚未被 claim。Jane 的帳號是什麼類型？Acme 能做什麼？","zo":["External user；Acme 不能修改她的帳號資料，也不能刪除她的帳號","Managed account；Acme 可以改她的 email","Guest；Acme 只能看她的活動","Managed account；Acme 可以刪除它"],"fig":"","opts":["External user; Acme can't update her account details or delete her account","Managed account; Acme can change her email","Guest; Acme can only view her activity","Managed account; Acme can delete it"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：要驗證 domain 並 claim 帳號才是 managed；Jane 是 external user，admin 可以邀請、移除，但不能改帳號資料或刪帳號。","B":"錯。不是 managed，不能改 email。","C":"錯。不是 guest 的概念。","D":"錯。沒有 claim 就不是 managed。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-managed-accounts/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-e05","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company-managed project must allow people who aren't logged in to browse its issues. What is required?","zh":"某個 company-managed project 必須讓未登入的人也能瀏覽 issue。需要什麼？","zo":["把匿名 group 加到 Users role","在 permission scheme 把 Browse Projects 給 Public（Anyone on the web）","把 Browse users and groups 給所有人","改成 team-managed 並用 Open access"],"fig":"","opts":["Add the anonymous group to the Users role","Grant Browse Projects to Public (Anyone on the web) in the permission scheme","Grant Browse users and groups to anyone","Convert the project to team-managed with Open access"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。沒有「anonymous group」可以加。","B":"對。匿名存取是在 permission scheme 把 Browse Projects 給 Public。","C":"錯。這個全域權限只影響看得到哪些使用者。","D":"錯。TMP 的 Open 只對站上使用者，TMP 不支援匿名存取。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/prevent-or-remove-public-access/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-e06","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"How is a user typically given access to Jira Software?","zh":"通常如何讓使用者取得 Jira 的存取？","zo":["給他 Browse Projects 權限","讓他擔任 project lead","把他加進 project role","給他 Jira 的 app user 角色，也就是把他加進該 app 的 default access group"],"fig":"","opts":["By giving them the Browse Projects permission","By making them a project lead","By adding them to a project role","By granting the Jira app user role, which adds them to the app's default access group"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Browse Projects 是 project 權限，前提是已有 product access。","B":"錯。Project lead 是 project 欄位，不給授權。","C":"錯。Project role 不給產品存取。","D":"對。給 app 角色＝加進該角色的 default group；也可直接把人加進那個 group。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-e07","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Employees using the company email domain should be able to join Jira on their own without an admin inviting each person. What should be configured?","zh":"使用公司 email 網域的員工，應能自行加入 Jira，不必 admin 逐一邀請。應設定什麼？","zo":["公開的 permission scheme","把 Browse users and groups 給所有人","新的 project role","Approved domains，並自動給 product access"],"fig":"","opts":["A public permission scheme","Browse users and groups for everyone","A new project role","Approved domains with automatic product access"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。公開 permission scheme 是匿名瀏覽，不是讓員工加入。","B":"錯。這是看使用者名單的權限。","C":"錯。Role 不處理加入站台。","D":"對。Approved domains 讓同一 domain 的人自助加入並取得指定的 app 存取。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/control-how-users-get-access-to-products/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-e08","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Before deleting an unused group, what should an admin check?","zh":"刪除一個看似沒用的 group 之前，admin 應檢查什麼？","zo":["這個 group 是否用於 permission scheme、global permission 或其他設定","Group 名稱是否超過 20 字","是否有 dashboard 被加星號","什麼都不用，刪除 group 沒有影響"],"fig":"","opts":["Whether the group is used in permission schemes, global permissions, or other configurations","Whether the group name is longer than 20 characters","Whether any dashboards are starred","Nothing; deleting groups has no impact"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：刪除前先確認 group 是否用於權限設定；若成員仍需權限就不要刪，否則先移除權限。","B":"錯。名稱長度無關。","C":"錯。Star 是個人偏好。","D":"錯。會影響所有用到該 group 的設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/delete-a-group/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-e09","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about removing a user from an organization are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於把使用者移出 organization，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["要恢復存取，必須重新邀請並重新指定 group 與角色","其 Atlassian 帳號在所有地方被永久刪除","30 天內保留所有 group 成員資格","只有 project admin 能移除使用者","該使用者不再計費"],"fig":"","opts":["To reinstate access, the user must be invited again and their groups and roles reassigned","Their Atlassian account is permanently deleted everywhere","They keep all group memberships for 30 days","Only project admins can remove users","The user is no longer billed"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。官方：要重新邀請並重新指定角色與 group。","B":"錯。不會永久刪除 Atlassian 帳號，也不影響其他 organization。","C":"錯。沒有這種保留期。","D":"錯。是 org admin（或 user access admin）的工作。","E":"對。移除後不再計費。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-e10","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin (with Administer Jira) is asked to invite five new users to the site. What is true?","zh":"有 Administer Jira 的 Jira admin 被要求邀請五位新使用者到站台。何者正確？","zo":["Administer Jira 不能管理使用者；要由 organization admin（或 user access admin）處理","只有 project admin 能邀請使用者","Jira admin 要先建立 project","Jira admin 可以從 Jira settings 完成"],"fig":"","opts":["Administer Jira doesn't allow managing users; an organization admin (or user access admin) must do it","Only project admins can invite users","The Jira admin must first create a project","The Jira admin can do it from Jira settings"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。管理使用者是 org admin 或 user access admin 的工作。","B":"錯。邀請權由 organization 的 User invites 設定決定，與 project admin 身分無關。","C":"錯。與建立 project 無關。","D":"錯。官方：Administer Jira 不能管理現有使用者或新增使用者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-e11","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can make another user an organization admin?","zh":"誰能把另一位使用者設為 organization admin？","zo":["Jira admin","Organization admin","Project admin","Site admin"],"fig":"","opts":["A Jira admin","An organization admin","A project admin","A site admin"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Jira admin 無權指派任何 Atlassian Administration 角色。","B":"對。只有 org admin 能新增或管理其他 org admin。","C":"錯。Project admin 只管自己的 project。","D":"錯。Site admin 不能指派 org admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-e12","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An organization admin opens Jira settings but can't edit workflows. What is the most likely reason?","zh":"Organization admin 打開 Jira settings，卻不能編輯 workflow。最可能的原因？","zo":["他需要 Browse users and groups 權限","Org admin 永遠不能存取 Jira","他沒有把自己加進 jira-administrators（Jira admin）group","Workflow 只能由 project admin 編輯"],"fig":"","opts":["They need the Browse users and groups permission","Org admins never have access to Jira","They haven't added themselves to the jira-administrators (Jira admin) group","Workflows can only be edited by project admins"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。與 workflow 無關。","B":"錯。Org admin 可以取得 Jira 存取。","C":"對。官方：org admin 或 site admin 要把自己加進 jira-administrators group 才有 Administer Jira。（集中式介面下 org admin 預設有各 app 的 app admin 角色；若被移除或在原始介面就要自己加入。）","D":"錯。CMP workflow 要 Jira admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-e13","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which actions can a project admin of a company-managed project perform? (Choose two.)","zh":"Company-managed project 的 project admin 能做哪些事？（選兩個）","zo":["建立新的 custom field","把使用者加進 project 的 role","建立並發布 version","編輯 project 的 permission scheme","修改 project key"],"fig":"","opts":["Create a new custom field","Add users to the project's roles","Create and release versions","Edit the project's permission scheme","Change the project key"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Custom field 是全站物件，要 Jira admin。","B":"對。Project admin 管 People（role 成員）。","C":"對。Administer Projects 包含管理 versions 與 components。","D":"錯。Scheme 要 Jira admin。","E":"錯。改 key 要 org／site／Jira admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-e14","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"How is someone typically made a project admin in a company-managed project?","zh":"在 company-managed project，通常怎麼讓某人成為 project admin？","zo":["讓他成為 site admin","給他 Make bulk changes 全域權限","把他設為 default assignee","把他加進 permission scheme 中擁有 Administer Projects 的 role（例如 Administrators）"],"fig":"","opts":["Make them a site admin","Give them the Make bulk changes global permission","Set them as default assignee","Add them to the role (e.g., Administrators) that holds Administer Projects in the permission scheme"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Site admin 不會自動成為 project admin，也遠超需求。","B":"錯。Bulk change 與 project admin 無關。","C":"錯。Default assignee 只影響指派。","D":"對。Permission scheme 把 Administer Projects 給 Administrators role，再把人加進該 role。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-e15","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about admin roles in Atlassian cloud are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 Atlassian cloud 的 admin 角色，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Jira admin 可以進入 Atlassian Administration","Project admin 可以刪除 group","Admin 角色不一定自動給 app 存取","User access admin 管理某個 app 的存取，但不會自動取得該 app 的存取","Site admin 可以指派 organization admin 角色"],"fig":"","opts":["Jira admins can access Atlassian Administration","Project admins can delete groups","Admin roles don't always give access to apps automatically","A user access admin manages access to a specific app but doesn't automatically get access to it","Site admins can assign the organization admin role"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。App admin 不能存取 Atlassian Administration。","B":"錯。刪 group 是 org admin 的工作。","C":"對。官方：admin 角色不一定自動給 app 存取。","D":"對。User access admin 管某 app 的使用者存取，自己不一定能用該 app。","E":"錯。只有 org admin 能指派 org admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-e16","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin (with Administer Jira only) created a site backup and now needs to import a backup file to restore the site. What is true?","zh":"一位只有 Administer Jira 的 Jira admin 建立了站台 backup，現在需要匯入 backup 檔來還原站台。何者正確？","zo":["只有 project admin 能匯入 backup","Jira Cloud 不能匯入 backup","Jira admin 可以匯入，因為 backup 是他建立的","匯入 backup 檔需要 organization admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Only project admins can import backups","Backups can't be imported in Jira Cloud","The Jira admin can import it, because they created the backup","Importing a backup file requires an organization admin"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Project admin 不能做站台層級的 backup 與匯入。","B":"錯。Backup manager 可以匯入 backup。","C":"錯。官方 Learning 課程：Jira admin 只能建立 backup 檔，不能匯入。","D":"對。官方 Learning 課程：org admin 可以建立與匯入 backup 檔；匯入會覆蓋整站資料。"},"note":"<b>官方說法不一：</b>Global permissions 頁寫 Administer Jira 不能匯入匯出資料；官方 Learning 課程則寫 Jira admin 可以建立 backup、匯入要 org admin。本題依 Learning 課程。","src":["https://community.atlassian.com/learning/lesson/jira-cloud-backup-and-restore","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-e17","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Only an organization admin can grant which role for Jira apps?","zh":"Jira apps 的哪一種角色只有 organization admin 能授予？","zo":["Jira Administration 的 app admin","Project admin","Team-managed project 的 Viewer role","Default assignee"],"fig":"","opts":["App admin for Jira Administration","Project admin","Viewer role in team-managed projects","Default assignee"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：只有 org admin 能讓其他使用者成為 Jira apps 的 app admin（Jira Administration）。","B":"錯。Project admin 由 role 成員決定。","C":"錯。TMP 的 role 由 project admin 管。","D":"錯。Default assignee 是 project 設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-e18","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin wants to give only Mia the ability to share dashboards. What must be done?","zh":"Jira admin 只想讓 Mia 能分享 dashboard。必須怎麼做？","zo":["把 Mia 加到 Administrators project role","給 Mia Make bulk changes 權限","直接把 Share dashboards and filters 給 Mia","把 Mia 放進一個 group，再把 Share dashboards and filters 給該 group"],"fig":"","opts":["Add Mia to the Administrators project role","Give Mia the Make bulk changes permission","Grant Share dashboards and filters directly to Mia","Put Mia in a group and grant Share dashboards and filters to that group"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Project role 不能拿到 global permission。","B":"錯。與分享無關。","C":"錯。Global permission 不能直接給個人。","D":"對。Global permission 只能給 group。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-e19","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Users can type a comment but @mention only shows people who can browse the current project, not everyone on the site. Which global permission are they missing?","zh":"使用者能打留言，但 @mention 只列出能瀏覽目前 project 的人，看不到全站使用者。他們缺哪個 global permission？","zo":["Share dashboards and filters","Manage group filter subscriptions","Administer Jira","Browse users and groups"],"fig":"","opts":["Share dashboards and filters","Manage group filter subscriptions","Administer Jira","Browse users and groups"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。分享權限。","B":"錯。訂閱權限。","C":"錯。與 @mention 範圍無關。","D":"對。沒有 Browse users and groups 的人只看得到在該 project 有 Browse 權限的使用者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-e20","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team lead has Make bulk changes but can't bulk-transition issues in the Payroll project. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"某 team lead 有 Make bulk changes，卻不能在 Payroll project 批次轉換 issue。最可能的原因？","zo":["他需要 Administer Jira","他不是 project lead","Jira Cloud 停用了 bulk change","他在 Payroll 缺少所需的 project 權限（例如 Transition Issues）"],"fig":"","opts":["They need Administer Jira","They aren't the project lead","Bulk changes are disabled in Jira Cloud","They lack the project permission needed (e.g., Transition Issues) in Payroll"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不需要 Jira admin。","B":"錯。Project lead 與權限無關。","C":"錯。功能存在。","D":"對。官方：bulk change 還需要必要的 project 權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-e21","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The company wants to stop employees from creating their own projects, while Jira admins can still create any project. What should be changed?","zh":"公司想禁止一般員工自行建立 project，而 Jira admin 仍可建立任何 project。應修改什麼？","zo":["把 Create team-managed projects 從擁有它的 group 收回","把所有使用者的 Browse Projects 收回","收回 Jira admin 的 Administer Jira","停用 issue linking"],"fig":"","opts":["Remove Create team-managed projects from the groups that have it","Remove Browse Projects from all users","Remove Administer Jira from Jira admins","Disable issue linking"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。預設所有 Jira 使用者能建 TMP；收回這個 global permission 即可，CMP 本來就要 Administer Jira。","B":"錯。會讓大家看不到 project。","C":"錯。Jira admin 需要保留。","D":"錯。與建立 project 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-e22","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which global permissions exist in Jira Cloud? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些是 Jira Cloud 的 global permission？（選兩個）","zo":["Edit Issues","Manage group filter subscriptions","Make bulk changes","Browse Projects","Assign Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Edit Issues","Manage group filter subscriptions","Make bulk changes","Browse Projects","Assign Issues"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Project permission。","B":"對。Global permission。","C":"對。Global permission。","D":"錯。Project permission。","E":"錯。Project permission。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-e23","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user wants to create a filter subscription that emails the 'support' group every Monday. What does the user need?","zh":"使用者想建立每週一寄給「support」group 的 filter subscription。他需要什麼？","zo":["Administer Jira","Browse users and groups","Create team-managed projects","Manage group filter subscriptions"],"fig":"","opts":["Administer Jira","Browse users and groups","Create team-managed projects","Manage group filter subscriptions"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不需要 Jira admin。","B":"錯。與訂閱無關。","C":"錯。與訂閱無關。","D":"對。訂閱給 group 需要這個 global permission。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-e24","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which actions does the Administer Jira global permission allow? (Choose two.)","zh":"Administer Jira 全域權限允許哪些動作？（選兩個）","zo":["匯入與匯出站台資料","建立 company-managed project","編輯 workflow 與 scheme","管理使用者與 group","編輯系統 email 設定"],"fig":"","opts":["Importing and exporting site data","Creating company-managed projects","Editing workflows and schemes","Managing users and groups","Editing system email settings"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Global permissions 頁明列不能匯入匯出（Learning 課程另寫 Jira admin 可建立 backup，但匯入 backup 仍要 org admin）。","B":"對。建 CMP 與 TMP。","C":"對。改 issue type、欄位、workflow 與各種 scheme。","D":"錯。官方明列不能。","E":"錯。官方明列不能。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-e25","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In which order does access need to be satisfied for a user to see and transition an issue in a company-managed project?","zh":"在 company-managed project，使用者要看到並轉換一張 issue，存取關卡的順序是？","zo":["只看 global permissions","Product access → project 權限（Browse、Transition）→ issue security level → workflow condition","Issue security → product access → global permissions","Workflow condition → 只要 product access"],"fig":"","opts":["Global permissions only","Product access → project permissions (Browse, Transition) → issue security level → workflow condition","Issue security → product access → global permissions","Workflow condition → product access only"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Global permissions 不決定 project 內的動作。","B":"對。先要能進 Jira，再看 project 權限；issue security 決定看不看得到這張 issue，看得到之後 transition 按鈕才受 workflow condition 影響。（官方未明定順序，此為依邏輯排列。）","C":"錯。順序不對，也漏了 project 權限。","D":"錯。漏了 project 權限與 issue security。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/types-of-permissions-in-jira/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"120.1.4-e26","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mia is a developer in the project, but she doesn't appear in the Assignee dropdown. Other developers do. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Mia 是 project 的開發者，但她沒有出現在 Assignee 下拉選單中，其他開發者都有。最可能的原因？","zo":["Mia 缺少 Assign Issues 權限","Mia 不是 project lead","Mia 缺少 Browse users and groups","Mia 缺少 Assignable User 權限"],"fig":"","opts":["Mia lacks the Assign Issues permission","Mia isn't the project lead","Mia lacks Browse users and groups","Mia lacks the Assignable User permission"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Assign Issues 是「指派別人」的權限，不決定她能不能被指派。","B":"錯。Project lead 與能否被指派無關。","C":"錯。這影響她看得到誰，不影響別人能否指派她。","D":"對。被指派的人要有 Assignable User。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-e27","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user has Move Issues in project A but can't move an issue to project B. What else is needed?","zh":"使用者在 project A 有 Move Issues，卻無法把 issue 移到 project B。還需要什麼？","zo":["Project B 的 Link Issues","Project B 的 Create Issues","Administer Jira","Project A 的 Delete Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Link Issues in project B","Create Issues in project B","Administer Jira","Delete Issues in project A"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。與連結無關。","B":"對。移動等於在目標 project 建立，要有目標 project 的 Create Issues。","C":"錯。不需要 Jira admin。","D":"錯。移動不需要刪除權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-e28","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Users have the Link Issues permission, but the 'Link' option doesn't appear on any issue. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"使用者有 Link Issues 權限，但所有 issue 都沒有「Link」選項。最可能的原因？","zo":["Link Issues 需要 Make bulk changes","在 Jira settings 全站停用了 issue linking","使用者缺少 Browse users and groups","使用者不是 project admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Link Issues requires Make bulk changes","Issue linking is disabled globally in Jira settings","The users lack Browse users and groups","The users aren't project admins"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不需要 bulk change。","B":"對。全站關閉 issue linking 時，即使有 Link Issues 也看不到選項。","C":"錯。與連結無關。","D":"錯。一般使用者也能連結。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-linking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-e29","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Twenty projects use the same permission scheme, but each project has different developers. What is the best way to grant Edit Issues?","zh":"20 個 project 使用同一個 permission scheme，但每個 project 的開發者不同。授予 Edit Issues 的最佳方式？","zo":["以 single user 逐一給每位開發者","給 Application access：Any logged in user","給 Developers project role，讓各 project admin 自行加入開發者","每個 project 建一個 group 與一個 scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Grant it to each developer as a single user","Grant it to Application access: Any logged in user","Grant it to a Developers project role and let each project admin add their developers","Create a group per project and a scheme per project"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。難以維護，而且所有 project 都會給同一批人。","B":"錯。會讓所有登入者都能編輯。","C":"對。Role 讓同一個 scheme 用在多個 project，各 project 自己填成員。","D":"錯。可行但要維護 20 個 group 與 20 個 scheme。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-project-roles/","https://community.atlassian.com/t5/Jira-questions/Should-I-use-Project-Roles-or-Groups/qaq-p/1908851"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-e30","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a change approval project, only the person in the 'Approver' user picker field should be able to transition the issue. Which grant achieves this?","zh":"在 change 核准的 project 中，只有「Approver」user picker 欄位中的人能轉換該 issue。哪個授權方式能達成？","zo":["Transition Issues 給 Group：approvers","Transition Issues 給 Project lead","Transition Issues 給 User custom field value：Approver","Transition Issues 給 Reporter"],"fig":"","opts":["Group: approvers for Transition Issues","Project lead for Transition Issues","User custom field value: Approver for Transition Issues","Reporter for Transition Issues"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Group 是固定名單，不是「這張 issue 的 approver」。","B":"錯。Project lead 是固定一人。","C":"對。User custom field value 讓權限跟著欄位裡的人走。","D":"錯。Reporter 是提出的人。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-project-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-e31","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements describe team-managed project access? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些敘述符合 team-managed project 的存取？（選兩個）","zo":["用 Open、Limited、Private 加上 role 設定存取","Project admin 不需要 Jira admin 就能管理存取","由共用的 permission scheme 控制","Team-managed project 支援匿名存取","Role 會覆蓋（取代）access level"],"fig":"","opts":["Access is set with Open, Limited, or Private plus roles","Project admins manage access without a Jira admin","Access is controlled by a shared permission scheme","Team-managed projects support anonymous access","Roles override (replace) the access level"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。TMP 用 access level＋role。","B":"對。TMP 的 project admin 自己管。","C":"錯。TMP 沒有 permission scheme。","D":"錯。TMP 不支援匿名。","E":"錯。Role 是疊加的，不覆蓋 access level。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-e32","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can change the permission scheme associated with a company-managed project, and who can add users to that project's roles?","zh":"誰能更換 company-managed project 使用的 permission scheme？誰能把使用者加進該 project 的 role？","zo":["任何使用者；project lead","Jira admin；project admin","Project admin；Jira admin","只有 org admin；只有 org admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Any user; project lead","Jira admin; project admin","Project admin; Jira admin","Org admin only; org admin only"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。一般使用者不能。","B":"對。換或改 scheme 要 Jira admin；role 成員由 project admin 管理。","C":"錯。顛倒了。","D":"錯。不限 org admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-project-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-e33","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which permission lets a user change an issue's due date and rank?","zh":"哪個權限讓使用者能改 issue 的 due date 與排序？","zo":["Assign Issues","Resolve Issues","Schedule Issues","Edit Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Assign Issues","Resolve Issues","Schedule Issues","Edit Issues"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。指派。","B":"錯。Resolution 與 fix version。","C":"對。Schedule Issues 管 due date 與排序。","D":"錯。官方：日期欄位可由更具體的 Schedule Issues 控制；due date 與 rank 屬於 Schedule Issues。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-e34","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"All licensed Jira users should be able to view issues in an internal project, without adding them to roles. Which grant is appropriate for Browse Projects?","zh":"所有有 Jira 授權的使用者都應能瀏覽某內部 project 的 issue，而不必加進 role。Browse Projects 給誰最合適？","zo":["Public","Project lead","Reporter","Application access：Jira"],"fig":"","opts":["Public","Project lead","Reporter","Application access: Jira"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Public 會開放給匿名使用者。","B":"錯。只有一人。","C":"錯。只有提出者。","D":"對。Application access 指定 Jira，就涵蓋所有有 Jira 存取的使用者；（Any logged in user 則是所有登入站台的人，可能包含沒有 Jira 授權者。）"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-project-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-e35","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Customer-reported bugs should be visible only to the Developers role and the person who reported each bug. What should the security level contain?","zh":"客戶回報的 bug 只能讓 Developers role 與該 bug 的回報者看到。Security level 應包含什麼？","zo":["Project role：Developers 與 Reporter","Group：jira-users","只有 Project role：Developers","Public"],"fig":"","opts":["Project role: Developers and Reporter","Group: jira-users","Project role: Developers only","Public"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Role 加 Reporter，兩種人都看得到。","B":"錯。等於所有使用者。","C":"錯。漏了 reporter，回報者建立後就看不到。","D":"錯。等於公開。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-users-access-to-security-levels-in-a-work-item-security-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-e36","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which steps are required to enable issue-level security in a company-managed project? (Choose two.)","zh":"在 company-managed project 啟用 issue security 需要哪些步驟？（選兩個）","zo":["把 issue security scheme 套到 project","在 permission scheme 把 Set Issue Security 給要設定 level 的人","啟用 issue linking","建立 project category","給 Browse users and groups"],"fig":"","opts":["Associate an issue security scheme with the project","Grant Set Issue Security in the permission scheme to users who will set levels","Enable issue linking","Create a project category","Grant Browse users and groups"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。要把 scheme 套到 project。","B":"對。要有人有 Set Issue Security 才能設定 level。","C":"錯。與 issue security 無關。","D":"錯。分類無關。","E":"錯。與 issue security 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-security-schemes/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-work-item-security-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-e37","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A parent issue has the security level 'Confidential'. What is the security level of its sub-tasks?","zh":"Parent issue 的 security level 是「Confidential」。其 sub-task 的 security level 是什麼？","zo":["沒有 level","只能是 project 的 default level","繼承 parent 的「Confidential」","可以是任何 level"],"fig":"","opts":["They have no level","They use the project's default level only","They inherit 'Confidential' from the parent","They can have any level"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。會繼承。","B":"錯。是跟著 parent，不是 default。","C":"對。Sub-task 繼承 parent 的 security level。","D":"錯。不能單獨設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/allow-specific-users-to-view-tasks-and-subtasks-with-security-levels-in-jira/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-e38","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team-managed project wants certain 'HR case' issues visible only to the HR role. What can the project admin do?","zh":"Team-managed project 想讓某些「HR case」issue 只給 HR role 看。Project admin 能怎麼做？","zo":["把 HR case 這個 issue type 限制為只有 HR role 能存取","建立 issue security scheme","加一個含 Reporter 的 security level","修改 permission scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Restrict access to the HR case issue type to the HR role","Create an issue security scheme","Add a security level with Reporter","Change the permission scheme"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。TMP 可以限制某個 issue type 只給特定 role 看。","B":"錯。TMP 沒有 issue security scheme。","C":"錯。TMP 沒有 security level。","D":"錯。TMP 沒有 permission scheme。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-issue-types-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-e39","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user with Set Issue Security can only choose some of the security levels in the dropdown. Why?","zh":"有 Set Issue Security 的使用者，在下拉選單中只能選部分 security level。為什麼？","zo":["使用者只能設定自己是成員的 level","Scheme 的 level 太多","只有 Jira admin 能設定 level","Sub-task 限制了選項"],"fig":"","opts":["Users can only set levels they are members of","The scheme has too many levels","Only Jira admins can set levels","Sub-tasks limit the choices"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。只能選自己是成員的 level。","B":"錯。數量與此無關。","C":"錯。有 Set Issue Security 的人就能設。","D":"錯。題目不是 sub-task。"},"note":"<b>來源說明：</b>此規則明載於 Jira Server 文件 Setting Security on an Issue（「A person can only set an issue to a Security Level of which they are a member.」）；Cloud 文件未寫。","src":["https://confluence.atlassian.com/jira062/setting-security-on-an-issue-588581729.html"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-e40","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue is moved from a project with an issue security scheme to a project without one. What happens to its visibility?","zh":"Issue 從有 issue security scheme 的 project 移到沒有 scheme 的 project。可見性會怎樣？","zo":["移動被阻擋","新 project 中有 Browse Projects 的人都看得到","保留原本的 security level","所有人都看不到"],"fig":"","opts":["The move is blocked","It becomes visible to anyone with Browse Projects in the new project","It keeps the old security level","It becomes invisible to everyone"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不會被擋。","B":"對。官方：新 project 沒有 scheme 時，issue 對能存取該 project 的人都可見。","C":"錯。會套用新 project 的設定。","D":"錯。不會變成誰都看不到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-work-item-security-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-e41","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A support lead wants a single comment on an issue to be visible only to the Developers role, while the rest of the issue stays visible to everyone with access. What should be used?","zh":"Support lead 想讓 issue 上的某一則留言只給 Developers role 看，issue 其他內容仍對有權限的人可見。該用什麼？","zo":["把 issue 設為私人","把留言可見性限制為 Developers role","Issue security level","新的 permission scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Make the issue private","Comment visibility restricted to the Developers role","An issue security level","A new permission scheme"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。會影響整張 issue。","B":"對。留言可以設定只有某個 role 或 group 看得到。","C":"錯。Security level 限制整張 issue。","D":"錯。不需要改 scheme。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/add-restricted-comments-on-jira/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-e42","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which can be added as members of a security level? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些可以加為 security level 的成員？（選兩個）","zo":["User custom field value","Current assignee","Issue type","Priority","Resolution"],"fig":"","opts":["User custom field value","Current assignee","Issue type","Priority","Resolution"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。欄位中的使用者可以是成員。","B":"對。目前的 assignee 可以是成員。","C":"錯。不是使用者類型。","D":"錯。不是使用者類型。","E":"錯。不是使用者類型。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-users-access-to-security-levels-in-a-work-item-security-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.1-e01","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The PMO wants 15 new engineering projects to use identical workflows, screens, and permissions, maintained centrally. What should the Jira admin do?","zh":"PMO 希望 15 個新的工程 project 使用相同的 workflow、screen 與權限，並集中維護。Jira admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["建立 team-managed project 並手動複製設定","所有團隊共用一個 team-managed project","所有 project 都用 Kanban template","以「Share settings with an existing project」建立 company-managed project"],"fig":"","opts":["Create team-managed projects and copy settings manually","Create one team-managed project for all teams","Use Kanban templates for all projects","Create company-managed projects using 'Share settings with an existing project'"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 不能共用設定，手動複製難以維持一致。","B":"錯。不符合多個 project 的需求，而且 TMP 只能一個 board。","C":"錯。Template 決定工作方式，不決定設定共用。","D":"對。共用設定讓新 project 直接使用相同的 scheme，維護一份即可。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-new-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.1-e02","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Projects A and B share the same configuration. The Jira admin edits the workflow scheme for project B. What happens?","zh":"Project A 與 B 共用設定。Jira admin 修改了 project B 的 workflow scheme。結果？","zo":["A 與 B 都改變，因為它們共用 scheme","A 改變、B 不變","要重新索引之後才會變","只有 B 改變"],"fig":"","opts":["Both A and B change, because they share the scheme","A changes, B doesn't","Neither changes until re-indexing","Only B changes"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。共用設定的代價：改一次影響所有使用該 scheme 的 project。","B":"錯。不會只改 A。","C":"錯。不需要 re-index。","D":"錯。Scheme 是共用的。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-new-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.1-e03","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A small marketing team wants to start quickly, change its own workflow each week, and doesn't need components or issue security. Which project type fits?","zh":"小型行銷團隊想快速開始、每週自己調整 workflow，也不需要 components 或 issue security。適合哪種 project？","zo":["Service project","Team-managed","共用設定的 company-managed","搭配新 permission scheme 的 company-managed"],"fig":"","opts":["Service project","Team-managed","Company-managed with shared configuration","Company-managed with a new permission scheme"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不符合需求。","B":"對。TMP 讓團隊自己改設定、快速開始。","C":"錯。共用設定意味著不能自行調整。","D":"錯。CMP 的 workflow 要 Jira admin 改。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.1-e04","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which features are available only in company-managed projects? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些功能只有 company-managed project 有？（選兩個）","zo":["Issue security schemes","自訂 issue type","Fix versions","Board","Components"],"fig":"","opts":["Issue security schemes","Custom issue types","Fix versions","A board","Components"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Issue security scheme 只在 CMP。","B":"錯。TMP 也能建自訂 issue type。","C":"錯。TMP 開 Releases 後有 Fix versions。","D":"錯。TMP 也有 board。","E":"對。Components 只在 CMP。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.1-e05","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team works in fixed two-week iterations and wants velocity reporting. Which template should they choose?","zh":"團隊以固定兩週為一個 iteration，並需要 velocity 報表。應選哪個 template？","zo":["Kanban","Bug tracking","Top-level planning","Scrum"],"fig":"","opts":["Kanban","Bug tracking","Top-level planning","Scrum"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Kanban 是連續流，沒有 sprint 與 velocity。","B":"錯。Bug tracking 沒有 sprint 設計。","C":"錯。不是 Jira Software 的一般 project template。","D":"對。Scrum 有 sprint、backlog、velocity。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-the-project-templates/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.2-e06","sec":"120.2.2","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin of a company-managed project wants to change the project key from MOB to APP. What is true?","zh":"Company-managed project 的 project admin 想把 project key 從 MOB 改成 APP。何者正確？","zo":["Project admin 可以在 Details 頁修改","只有 org、site 或 Jira admin 能改 key","Key 建立後不能改","改 key 需要重建 project"],"fig":"","opts":["The project admin can change it on the Details page","Only an org, site, or Jira admin can change the key","Keys can't be changed after creation","Changing the key requires recreating the project"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Project admin 看到的 key 欄位是停用的。","B":"對。官方：只有 org、site、Jira admin 能改 key。","C":"錯。Key 可以改。","D":"錯。不需要重建。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.2-e07","sec":"120.2.2","dom":"120.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"After a project key changes from EXAMPLE to DEMO, which statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Project key 從 EXAMPLE 改成 DEMO 之後，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["新的 project 可以馬上使用 EXAMPLE 這個 key","所有 Confluence 巨集永久失效","指向 EXAMPLE-1 的連結仍會導向 DEMO-1","Description 裡寫的文字「EXAMPLE-1」不會被更新","使用舊 key 的 filter 失效"],"fig":"","opts":["A new project can immediately use the key EXAMPLE","All Confluence macros break permanently","Links to EXAMPLE-1 still direct to DEMO-1","The text 'EXAMPLE-1' written in descriptions isn't updated","Filters using the old key stop working"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。Previous key 不能被新 project 使用。","B":"錯。巨集繼續運作，可能要等快取更新。","C":"對。舊 key 被保留，舊連結仍會導向。","D":"對。官方：description 中的文字別名不會更新（連結仍可導向）。","E":"錯。舊 key 仍可在 filter 與 JQL 中運作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.2-e08","sec":"120.2.2","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The project lead is Sara. The project admin wants new issues to be assigned to Tom by default when there are no components. What can they do?","zh":"Project lead 是 Sara。Project admin 希望沒有 component 時，新 issue 預設指派給 Tom。可以怎麼做？","zo":["給 Tom Browse users and groups","在 Details 頁把 default assignee 設成 Tom","把 project lead 改成 Tom，default assignee 設為 Project lead","把 Tom 加進 Administrators role"],"fig":"","opts":["Give Tom Browse users and groups","Set the default assignee to Tom on the Details page","Change the project lead to Tom and set default assignee to Project lead","Add Tom to the Administrators role"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。與指派無關。","B":"錯。Default assignee 只能 Unassigned 或 project lead。","C":"對。把 project lead 換成 Tom，default assignee 設 Project lead。","D":"錯。Role 不影響指派。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.2-e09","sec":"120.2.2","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin renames the project 'Mobile' to 'Mobile Apps'. What happens to existing filters that reference the project?","zh":"Project admin 把 project「Mobile」改名為「Mobile Apps」。既有引用這個 project 的 filter 會怎樣？","zo":["被刪除","永遠顯示舊名稱","失效，必須手動修改","自動更新為新名稱"],"fig":"","opts":["They are deleted","They keep showing the old name forever","They break and must be edited","They are updated automatically with the new name"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不會刪除。","B":"錯。會更新。","C":"錯。不會失效。","D":"對。官方：改名後所有 filter 會自動更新。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.3-e10","sec":"120.2.3","dom":"120.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A release manager releases version 3.0, but four issues are still unresolved. What options does Jira offer? (Choose two.)","zh":"Release manager 發布 3.0 版時還有四個未解決的 issue。Jira 提供哪些選項？（選兩個）","zo":["Jira 刪除未解決的 issue","把未解決的 issue 移到另一個 version","忽略並照樣發布","Jira 阻擋發布直到全部解決","Jira 自動把它們設為已解決"],"fig":"","opts":["Jira deletes the unresolved issues","Move the unresolved issues to another version","Ignore them and release anyway","Jira blocks the release until all are resolved","Jira automatically resolves them"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。不會刪除 issue。","B":"對。可以把未解決的 issue 移到另一個 version。","C":"對。也可以忽略並照樣發布。","D":"錯。不會被擋。","E":"錯。不會自動解決。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/release-your-teams-work-in-versions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.3-e11","sec":"120.2.3","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Versions 2.1 and 2.2 are merged into 2.3. What happens?","zh":"把 2.1 與 2.2 合併到 2.3。會發生什麼？","zo":["2.3 被改名為 2.1-2.3","2.1 與 2.2 的 issue 改為 2.3，且 2.1、2.2 被刪除","2.1、2.2 保留並指向 2.3","Issue 失去 fix version"],"fig":"","opts":["2.3 is renamed to 2.1-2.3","Issues from 2.1 and 2.2 now have 2.3, and versions 2.1 and 2.2 are deleted","2.1 and 2.2 remain and point to 2.3","Issues lose their fix version"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不會改名。","B":"對。合併後 issue 改指到目標 version，來源 version 被刪除。","C":"錯。來源 version 不會保留。","D":"錯。Issue 會改指到 2.3。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/release-your-teams-work-in-versions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.3-e12","sec":"120.2.3","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin tries to create a second version named '1.0' in the same project. What happens?","zh":"Project admin 想在同一 project 建立第二個名為「1.0」的 version。結果？","zo":["被拒絕，因為 version 名稱在 project 內必須唯一","取代舊的 1.0","在別的 project 建立","加上後綴後建立"],"fig":"","opts":["It's rejected because version names must be unique in the project","It replaces the old 1.0","It's created in a different project","It's created with a suffix"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Version 名稱在 project 內唯一。","B":"錯。不會取代。","C":"錯。不會跑到別的 project。","D":"錯。不會自動加後綴。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-a-version/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.3-e13","sec":"120.2.3","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin deletes version 1.5, which is set as the Fix version on 20 issues. What must they decide?","zh":"Admin 刪除 version 1.5，有 20 張 issue 的 Fix version 是它。必須決定什麼？","zo":["把這些 issue 的 fix version 改到另一個 version，或直接移除","不用決定，issue 會一起被刪除","是否封存 project","這些 issue 要進哪個 sprint"],"fig":"","opts":["Whether to move those issues' fix version to another version or remove it","Nothing; the issues are deleted too","Whether to archive the project","Which sprint the issues go to"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。刪除 version 時要決定 Fix／Affects version 改指到哪個 version，或直接移除。","B":"錯。Issue 不會被刪除。","C":"錯。與 project 封存無關。","D":"錯。Sprint 與 version 是不同概念。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/release-your-teams-work-in-versions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.4-e14","sec":"120.2.4","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue has components Hardware (default assignee: Component lead, Lee) and Software (default assignee: Project default). Assignee is set to Automatic. Who is assigned?","zh":"Issue 有 Hardware（default assignee：Component lead，Lee）與 Software（default assignee：Project default）兩個 component，Assignee 選 Automatic。指派給誰？","zo":["Lee","Project lead","Unassigned","Reporter"],"fig":"","opts":["Lee","The project lead","Unassigned","The reporter"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Component lead 類型最高，指派給 Lee（Lee 要有 Assignable User）。","B":"錯。Project default 類型最低。","C":"錯。不會因衝突變 Unassigned。","D":"錯。Reporter 不在規則中。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.4-e15","sec":"120.2.4","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue has components Blockchain (Unassigned) and Analytics (Project default, where the project default is the project lead Amanda). Who is assigned?","zh":"Issue 有 Blockchain（Unassigned）與 Analytics（Project default，而 project default 是 project lead Amanda）兩個 component。指派給誰？","zo":["Analytics 的 component lead","Reporter","Amanda","Unassigned"],"fig":"","opts":["The Analytics component lead","The reporter","Amanda","Unassigned"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Analytics 設的是 Project default，不是 component lead。","B":"錯。Reporter 不在規則中。","C":"錯。Project default 在類型中最低，不會先被展開成 Amanda 再比。","D":"對。Unassigned 高於 Project default，所以結果是 Unassigned。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.4-e16","sec":"120.2.4","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A component lead is set as the default assignee, but new issues with that component are never assigned to them. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Component 的 default assignee 設為 component lead，但帶此 component 的新 issue 從未指派給他。最可能的原因？","zo":["Component lead 缺少 Assignable User 權限","Components 只能用在 team-managed project","要 project lead 核准","Component 名稱太長"],"fig":"","opts":["The component lead lacks the Assignable User permission","Components only work in team-managed projects","The project lead must approve it","The component name is too long"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。沒有 Assignable User 的人會被跳過。","B":"錯。Components 只在 CMP。","C":"錯。沒有核准機制。","D":"錯。名稱與指派無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.4-e17","sec":"120.2.4","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue has no components and Assignee is set to Automatic. Who is assigned?","zh":"Issue 沒有 component，Assignee 選 Automatic。指派給誰？","zo":["字母序第一個 component lead","一律 Unassigned","最後編輯 project 的人","Project 的 default assignee"],"fig":"","opts":["The first component lead alphabetically","Always Unassigned","The last person who edited the project","The project's default assignee"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。沒有 component。","B":"錯。看 project default 設定。","C":"錯。不在規則中。","D":"對。沒有帶 default assignee 的 component 時，用 project 的 default assignee。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/who-does-the-automatic-assignee-option-assign-an-issue-to/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-e01","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin renames the issue type 'Defect' to 'Bug'. Which projects are affected?","zh":"Jira admin 把 issue type「Defect」改名為「Bug」。哪些 project 受影響？","zo":["只有 admin 當下在操作的 project","所有 issue type scheme 含有這個 issue type 的 project","只有 team-managed project","要等 scheme 重新發布才會受影響"],"fig":"","opts":["Only the project where the admin was working","All projects whose issue type schemes include that issue type","Only team-managed projects","None until the scheme is republished"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Issue type 是全站物件，不屬於單一 project。","B":"對。改名會出現在所有使用這個 issue type 的 project。","C":"錯。TMP 的 issue type 各自獨立，這裡改的是全站 issue type。","D":"錯。不需要重新發布。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-edit-and-delete-an-issue-type/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-e02","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A new issue type 'Change Request' was created, but it doesn't appear in the Operations project. What should the admin do?","zh":"新建了 issue type「Change Request」，但它沒有出現在 Operations project。Admin 應該怎麼做？","zo":["重新索引站台","把它加進 Operations project 使用的 issue type scheme","把它加進 workflow scheme","把它加進 permission scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Re-index the site","Add it to the issue type scheme used by the Operations project","Add it to the workflow scheme","Add it to the permission scheme"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不是索引問題。","B":"對。Project 能用哪些 issue type 由 issue type scheme 決定。","C":"錯。Workflow scheme 決定 workflow，不決定有哪些 type。","D":"錯。權限無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-type-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-e03","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"In a company-managed project, which schemes map issue types to configuration? (Choose two.)","zh":"在 company-managed project，哪些 scheme 會依 issue type 對應設定？（選兩個）","zo":["Notification scheme 把 issue type 對應到 screen","Issue security scheme 把 issue type 對應到 workflow","Workflow scheme 把 issue type 對應到 workflow","Field configuration scheme 把 issue type 對應到 field configuration","Permission scheme 把 issue type 對應到權限"],"fig":"","opts":["Notification scheme maps issue types to screens","Issue security scheme maps issue types to workflows","Workflow scheme maps issue types to workflows","Field configuration scheme maps issue types to field configurations","Permission scheme maps issue types to permissions"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。Notification scheme 對應事件與收件人。","B":"錯。Issue security 與 workflow 無關。","C":"對。Workflow scheme 依 issue type 指定 workflow。","D":"對。Field configuration scheme 依 issue type 指定欄位行為。","E":"錯。Permission scheme 不依 issue type。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-e04","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A parent task has an original estimate of 4h and two sub-tasks with 2h each. With 'Include sub-tasks' selected, what does the parent's time tracking show as original estimate?","zh":"Parent task 的 original estimate 是 4h，兩個 sub-task 各 2h。勾選「Include sub-tasks」時，parent 的 time tracking 顯示的 original estimate 是？","zo":["2h","6h","4h","8h"],"fig":"","opts":["2h","6h","4h","8h"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。只是一個 sub-task。","B":"錯。少算了一個 sub-task。","C":"錯。那是 parent 自己的估計。","D":"對。勾 Include sub-tasks 時，parent 顯示自己＋所有 sub-task 的總和：4＋2＋2＝8h。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-e05","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin wants to disable sub-tasks site-wide, but existing sub-tasks exist. What must be done first?","zh":"Jira admin 想全站停用 sub-task，但目前已有 sub-task。必須先做什麼？","zo":["把既有 sub-task 轉成 standard issue type","刪除所有 parent issue","從 permission scheme 移除 sub-task","什麼都不用，停用會自動刪除它們"],"fig":"","opts":["Convert existing sub-tasks to standard issue types","Delete all parent issues","Remove sub-tasks from the permission scheme","Nothing; disabling deletes them automatically"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。有 sub-task 存在時，要先轉成 standard issue type 才能停用。","B":"錯。不需要刪除 parent。","C":"錯。與權限無關。","D":"錯。不會自動刪除。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-sub-tasks/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-e06","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company-managed epic in the PLATFORM project needs child stories from the WEB and MOBILE projects. What is true?","zh":"PLATFORM project 中的 company-managed epic 需要 WEB 與 MOBILE project 的 story 當 child。何者正確？","zo":["跨 project 的 child 需要 team-managed project","Child 必須是 sub-task","Company-managed epic 可以有其他 project 的 child issue","Epic 只能包含同 project 的 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["Cross-project children require team-managed projects","Children must be sub-tasks","Company-managed epics can have child issues from other projects","Epics can only contain issues from the same project"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。是 CMP 的能力。","B":"錯。Epic 的 child 是 standard issue。","C":"對。CMP 支援 cross-project epic。","D":"錯。CMP 的 epic 可跨 project。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-e07","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The 'Bug' issue type must be removed from a project's issue type scheme, but the project already has 120 bugs. What happens?","zh":"要把「Bug」issue type 從某 project 的 issue type scheme 移除，但該 project 已有 120 張 bug。會怎樣？","zo":["這些 bug 保留被移除的 type","無法移除","這些 bug 被刪除","Admin 必須把這些 issue migrate 到其他 issue type"],"fig":"","opts":["The bugs keep the removed type","Removal is impossible","The bugs are deleted","The admin must migrate those issues to another issue type"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不會保留不在 scheme 中的 type。","B":"錯。可以，只是要先 migrate。","C":"錯。不會刪除 issue。","D":"對。移除使用中的 issue type 前要把既有 issue migrate 到其他 type。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-edit-and-delete-an-issue-type-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-e08","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can create a new issue type in a team-managed project?","zh":"誰能在 team-managed project 建立新的 issue type？","zo":["任何 member","該 project 的 project admin","只有 Jira admin","只有 org admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Any member","A project admin of that project","Only a Jira admin","Only an org admin"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Member 不能改設定。","B":"對。TMP 的 project admin 在 Project settings → Issue types 直接建立。","C":"錯。TMP 不需要 Jira admin。","D":"錯。不需要 org admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-issue-types-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-e09","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about issue type schemes are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 issue type scheme，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["控制誰看得到每種 issue type","每個 project 可同時使用多個 issue type scheme","定義 project 可以使用哪些 issue type","可以設定預設 issue type","定義每個 issue type 的 workflow"],"fig":"","opts":["They control who can see each issue type","Each project can use several issue type schemes at once","They define which issue types a project can use","They can set a default issue type","They define workflows for each issue type"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。不控制可見性。","B":"錯。一個 project 只用一個 issue type scheme。","C":"對。決定 project 可用的 issue type。","D":"對。可設預設 issue type 與排序。","E":"錯。那是 workflow scheme。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-type-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-e10","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The 'Severity' select field needs options S1–S4 in project A and Low/High in project B. What is the best approach?","zh":"「Severity」下拉欄位在 project A 要 S1–S4、在 project B 要 Low／High。最好的做法？","zo":["用兩個 screen","替這個欄位建兩個 context，各自設定 project 與選項","建兩個都叫 Severity 的欄位","用兩個 field configuration"],"fig":"","opts":["Use two screens","Create two contexts for the field, each with its own options and projects","Create two separate fields named Severity","Use two field configurations"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Screen 只決定顯示與否。","B":"對。每個 context 可設自己的 project 範圍與選項。","C":"錯。兩個同名欄位會造成 JQL 與報表混亂。","D":"錯。Field configuration 管 required／hide，不管選項。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-context-to-a-custom-field/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-e11","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A custom field is on the screen, but users can't see it on Bug issues in project X. Which could be the cause? (Choose two.)","zh":"某 custom field 已在 screen 上，但使用者在 project X 的 Bug issue 看不到它。可能原因？（選兩個）","zo":["欄位的 renderer 是 wiki style","欄位的 context 不包含 Bug 或 project X","Bug 的 field configuration 隱藏了這個欄位","使用者缺少 Browse users and groups","停用了 issue linking"],"fig":"","opts":["The field's renderer is wiki style","The field's context doesn't include Bug or project X","The field configuration for Bug hides the field","The users lack Browse users and groups","Issue linking is disabled"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Renderer 只影響格式。","B":"對。Context 不含該 project 或 issue type，欄位就不存在。","C":"對。Field configuration 設 Hide 時，即使在 screen 上也看不到。","D":"錯。與欄位顯示無關。","E":"錯。無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-context-to-a-custom-field/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-a-field-configuration/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-e12","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Story Points must be required on Stories and hidden on Bugs in the same project. How should this be configured?","zh":"同一個 project 中，Story Points 在 Story 必填、在 Bug 隱藏。該怎麼設定？","zo":["在 Bug 加 workflow validator","兩個 field configuration，透過 field configuration scheme 依 issue type 對應","Story Points 建兩個 context","兩個 permission scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["A workflow validator on Bugs","Two field configurations associated with issue types through a field configuration scheme","Two contexts for Story Points","Two permission schemes"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Validator 只在 transition 時檢查，無法隱藏欄位。","B":"對。Field configuration 管 required／hide，field configuration scheme 依 issue type 套用。","C":"錯。Context 決定欄位存在與預設值、選項，不控制 required。","D":"錯。權限無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/associate-field-behavior-with-an-issue-type/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-e13","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Users want to use bold, lists, and tables in a custom paragraph field, but it shows plain text. What should be changed?","zh":"使用者想在自訂段落欄位使用粗體、清單與表格，但只能顯示純文字。應該修改什麼？","zo":["給 Edit Issues 權限","在 field configuration 把欄位的 renderer 改成 Wiki style renderer","修改欄位的 context","把欄位加到 View screen"],"fig":"","opts":["Grant Edit Issues","Set the field's renderer to Wiki style renderer in the field configuration","Change the field's context","Add the field to the View screen"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不是權限問題。","B":"對。Renderer 決定是否可格式化。","C":"錯。Context 不影響格式。","D":"錯。已經看得到，只是不能格式化。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-a-field-configuration/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-e14","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin deletes a custom field by mistake. What can be done?","zh":"Jira admin 誤刪了一個 custom field。能怎麼做？","zo":["從 project trash 還原","在 60 天內從 Deleted fields 分頁還原","沒辦法，刪除是立即且永久的","重建同名欄位，資料會自動回來"],"fig":"","opts":["Restore it from the project trash","Restore it from the Deleted fields tab within 60 days","Nothing; deletion is immediate and permanent","Recreate it and the data returns automatically"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不是 project trash。","B":"對。官方：欄位會被標記 60 天後刪除，期間可在 Deleted fields 還原，資料一起回來。","C":"錯。不是立即永久刪除。","D":"錯。重建的是新欄位，舊資料不會自動回來。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/specify-field-behavior/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-e15","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project, a project admin creates a 'Vendor' field. Which is true?","zh":"Team-managed project 的 project admin 建立了「Vendor」欄位。何者正確？","zo":["需要 field configuration scheme","這個欄位只存在於該 project","這個欄位變成全站可用","需要 Jira admin 核准"],"fig":"","opts":["It requires a field configuration scheme","The field exists only in that project","The field becomes available site-wide","A Jira admin must approve it"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 沒有 field configuration scheme。","B":"對。TMP 建立的欄位只屬於這個 project。","C":"錯。不會變全站欄位。","D":"錯。不需要核准。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-custom-fields-for-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-e16","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What happens if the same project is added to two different contexts of one custom field?","zh":"如果把同一個 project 加到同一個 custom field 的兩個 context，會怎樣？","zo":["不允許；一個 project 只能屬於某欄位的一個 context","兩個 context 都生效、選項合併","最新的 context 勝出","Global context 勝出"],"fig":"","opts":["It isn't allowed; a project can belong to only one context of a field","Both contexts apply and options are merged","The newest context wins","The global context wins"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。同一個欄位，一個 project 只能屬於一個 context。","B":"錯。不會合併。","C":"錯。根本不能這樣設定。","D":"錯。不能重複指定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-context-to-a-custom-field/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-e17","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which are configured in a field configuration? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些在 field configuration 中設定？（選兩個）","zo":["欄位是否隱藏","欄位適用哪些 project","欄位的下拉選項","每個 project 的欄位預設值","欄位是否必填"],"fig":"","opts":["Whether a field is hidden","Which projects the field applies to","The field's select options","The field's default value per project","Whether a field is required"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Hide。","B":"錯。那是 context。","C":"錯。選項在 context。","D":"錯。預設值在 context。","E":"對。Required。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-a-field-configuration/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-e18","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Bugs should show an 'Environment' field when created, but not on other issue types' create screens. What should the Jira admin configure?","zh":"Bug 建立時要顯示「Environment」欄位，其他 issue type 的建立畫面不顯示。Jira admin 應設定什麼？","zo":["給 Bug 一個 screen scheme，其 Create 操作使用含 Environment 的 screen，並在 issue type screen scheme 中對應","對 Bug 用隱藏 Environment 的 field configuration","新的 permission scheme","只改 issue layout"],"fig":"","opts":["A screen scheme for Bug whose Create operation uses a screen with Environment, mapped in the issue type screen scheme","A field configuration hiding Environment for Bug","A new permission scheme","The issue layout only"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。依 issue type 給 Bug 專屬的 screen scheme，Create 操作用含 Environment 的 screen。","B":"錯。這會隱藏，與需求相反。","C":"錯。權限無關。","D":"錯。Layout 只排列 view，不決定 create 畫面。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-issue-screens/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-e19","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which operations can a screen scheme map to different screens? (Choose two.)","zh":"Screen scheme 可以把哪些操作對應到不同 screen？（選兩個）","zo":["Assign issue","Delete issue","Link issue","Create issue","Edit issue"],"fig":"","opts":["Assign issue","Delete issue","Link issue","Create issue","Edit issue"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。不是 screen scheme 操作。","B":"錯。不是。","C":"錯。不是。","D":"對。Create 是 screen scheme 的操作之一。","E":"對。Edit 也是。（另一個是 View。）"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-issue-screens/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-e20","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants to move the Priority field to the top of the issue's details panel. Where is this done?","zh":"Project admin 想把 Priority 欄位移到 issue 詳細資料區的最上方。在哪裡做？","zo":["Settings > Screens","Field configuration","Permission scheme","Project settings > Issue layout"],"fig":"","opts":["Settings > Screens","Field configuration","Permission scheme","Project settings > Issue layout"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Screen 要 Jira admin，且決定有哪些欄位，不是位置。","B":"錯。Field configuration 管行為。","C":"錯。權限無關。","D":"對。Project admin 用 issue layout 排列欄位位置。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-e21","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In the issue layout, a field is placed below the 'Hide when empty' line. What happens?","zh":"在 issue layout 中，某欄位被放在「Hide when empty」線以下。會怎樣？","zo":["永遠不顯示","永遠顯示在 Details","從 screen 移除","沒值時在 More fields，有值時移到 Details"],"fig":"","opts":["It's never shown","It's always shown in Details","It's removed from the screen","It appears under More fields when empty and moves to Details when it has a value"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。有值就會顯示。","B":"錯。沒值時不在 Details。","C":"錯。不會從 screen 移除。","D":"對。沒值時收在 More fields，有值時移到 Details。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-e22","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A Jira admin copies project A's issue layout to project B, which uses the same screen. Which statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Jira admin 把 project A 的 issue layout 複製到使用相同 screen 的 project B。哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["不論 screen 為何都能複製","Project B 原本的 layout 被覆蓋","之後修改 A 不會影響 B","兩個 layout 保持連動","欄位的值也會被複製"],"fig":"","opts":["Any project can receive it regardless of screen","Project B's existing layout is overridden","Later changes to A don't affect B","The two layouts stay linked","Field values are copied too"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。只能複製到使用相同 screen 的 project。","B":"對。官方：複製會覆蓋目標 project 的 layout。","C":"對。不建立連結，之後各自獨立。","D":"錯。不會連動。","E":"錯。只複製版面，不複製欄位內容。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-issue-layout-to-other-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-e23","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants to add a brand-new field to the issue view, but it isn't in the list of available fields in the layout. Why?","zh":"Project admin 想把一個新欄位加到 issue view，但 layout 的可用欄位清單中沒有它。為什麼？","zo":["必須先把欄位隱藏","Layout 只顯示系統欄位","該欄位不在 view screen 上；要由 Jira admin 加到 screen","Project admin 不能使用 layout"],"fig":"","opts":["The field must be hidden first","Layouts only show system fields","The field isn't on the view screen; a Jira admin must add it to the screen","Project admins can't use layouts"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不需要先隱藏。","B":"錯。也包含 custom field。","C":"對。Layout 只能排列 view screen 上已有的欄位；加欄位要 Jira admin 改 screen。","D":"錯。Project admin 可以用 layout。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-e24","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"How are a project's screens associated with its issue types in a company-managed project?","zh":"在 company-managed project，screen 如何與 issue type 關聯？","zo":["Workflow scheme → screen scheme","Issue type screen scheme → screen scheme → screen","Screen → issue type → project","Permission scheme → screen"],"fig":"","opts":["Workflow scheme → screen scheme","Issue type screen scheme → screen scheme → screen","Screen → issue type → project","Permission scheme → screen"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Workflow scheme 指定 workflow；transition screen 是另外掛在 workflow 上。","B":"對。Issue type screen scheme 依 issue type 指定 screen scheme，screen scheme 依操作指定 screen。","C":"錯。方向與層級不對。","D":"錯。權限無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-issue-screens/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-e25","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project, how are fields configured for each issue type?","zh":"在 team-managed project，每個 issue type 的欄位怎麼設定？","zo":["Jira admin 編輯 screen scheme","透過 field configuration scheme","透過 permission scheme","Project admin 在 Project settings 把欄位拖拉到 issue type"],"fig":"","opts":["Jira admin edits screen schemes","Through field configuration schemes","Through the permission scheme","Project admin drags fields into the issue type in Project settings"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 沒有 screen scheme。","B":"錯。TMP 沒有 field configuration scheme。","C":"錯。權限無關。","D":"對。TMP 在 Project settings → Issue types 拖拉欄位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-an-issues-fields-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-e26","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A transition 'Resolve' should prompt users to choose a resolution. What should be configured?","zh":"「Resolve」transition 執行時要讓使用者選 resolution。應設定什麼？","zo":["Field context","Issue type scheme","在 Resolve transition 掛一個含 Resolution 欄位的 transition screen","Issue layout"],"fig":"","opts":["A field context","The issue type scheme","A transition screen containing the Resolution field on the Resolve transition","The issue layout"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Context 不會讓欄位在轉換時跳出。","B":"錯。無關。","C":"對。在 transition 掛 screen，轉換時就會跳出填寫。","D":"錯。Layout 只排列 view。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-issue-screens/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-e27","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A new custom field 'Customer tier' was created with the default global context and added to screens. Where will it be available?","zh":"新建的 custom field「Customer tier」使用預設的 global context，並已加到 screen。它會在哪裡可用？","zo":["只在建立它的 project","只在 team-managed project","要先建 field configuration scheme 才能用","所有 project、所有 issue type 中 screen 有包含它的地方"],"fig":"","opts":["Only in the project where it was created","Only in team-managed projects","Nowhere until a field configuration scheme is created","In all projects and all issue types whose screens include it"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Custom field 是全站物件，不屬於某個 project。","B":"錯。TMP 自建的欄位才只在單一 project；這是全站 custom field。","C":"錯。不需要新的 field configuration scheme 就能使用。","D":"對。預設 global context 套用到所有 project 與 issue type；再由 screen 決定是否顯示。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-context-to-a-custom-field/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-e01","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Only members of the QA project role should see the 'Close' transition button. What should be added to the transition?","zh":"只有 QA project role 的成員能看到「Close」transition 按鈕。Transition 應加什麼？","zo":["Validator：Field Required","Post function：Assign to reporter","Done status 上的 workflow property","Condition：User Is In Project Role（QA）"],"fig":"","opts":["A validator: Field Required","A post function: Assign to reporter","A workflow property on the Done status","A condition: User Is In Project Role (QA)"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Validator 在提交時檢查，不會藏按鈕。","B":"錯。Post function 在轉換後執行。","C":"錯。Property 不是用來限制 role 的標準做法。","D":"對。Condition 決定按鈕是否出現。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-e02","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Issues reopened from Done to In Progress don't appear in filters using 'resolution = Unresolved'. What should be fixed?","zh":"從 Done 重新打開到 In Progress 的 issue，沒有出現在「resolution = Unresolved」的 filter 中。該修正什麼？","zo":["把 In Progress status 改名","把 Resolution 欄位加到 create screen","修改 board 欄位","在 reopen transition 加 post function 清空 Resolution 欄位"],"fig":"","opts":["Rename the In Progress status","Add the Resolution field to the create screen","Change the board columns","Add a post function on the reopen transition to clear the Resolution field"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Status 名稱不影響 resolution。","B":"錯。放在 create screen 會讓 issue 一建立就被視為已解決。","C":"錯。Board 欄位與 filter 結果無關。","D":"對。Reopen 時要用 post function 把 resolution 設為 None。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-e03","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A new status 'In QA' was added to the workflow, and issues moved to it disappear from the Scrum board. Why?","zh":"Workflow 新增了「In QA」status，issue 移到這個 status 後就從 Scrum board 消失。為什麼？","zo":["這個 status 沒有對應到 board 欄位","這個 status 沒有 category","Workflow 沒有被複製","新 status 的 issue 會隱藏 24 小時"],"fig":"","opts":["The status isn't mapped to a board column","The status has no category","The workflow wasn't copied","Issues in new statuses are hidden for 24 hours"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Board 只顯示已對應到欄位的 status。","B":"錯。每個 status 都有 category。","C":"錯。與複製無關。","D":"錯。沒有這種機制。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-e04","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"When an issue is transitioned to 'Escalated', the operations manager must receive a specific email that no other event sends. Which configuration is needed? (Choose two.)","zh":"Issue 轉到「Escalated」時，營運經理要收到一封其他 event 不會寄的特定 email。需要哪些設定？（選兩個）","zo":["加 jira.issue.editable property","建立新的 screen","建立 custom event，並在 transition 的 post function 觸發它","在 notification scheme 為該 custom event 設定經理為收件人","在 transition 加 validator"],"fig":"","opts":["Add a property jira.issue.editable","Create a new screen","Create a custom event and fire it in the transition's post function","Add the custom event to the notification scheme with the manager as recipient","Add a validator to the transition"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。Property 與通知無關。","B":"錯。Screen 與通知無關。","C":"對。建立 custom event，在 transition 的 post function 觸發。","D":"對。Notification scheme 中為該 event 設定收件人。","E":"錯。Validator 是檢查用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-custom-event/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-e05","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Issues in the 'Approved' status must not be editable. What should be configured?","zh":"處於「Approved」status 的 issue 不能被編輯。應該設定什麼？","zo":["在轉入 Approved 的 transition 加 condition","從 permission scheme 移除 Edit Issues","在 field configuration 隱藏所有欄位","在 Approved status 加 jira.issue.editable = false property"],"fig":"","opts":["Add a condition to the transition into Approved","Remove Edit Issues from the permission scheme","Hide all fields in the field configuration","Add the property jira.issue.editable = false to the Approved status"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Condition 控制能否轉入，不控制轉入後能否編輯。","B":"錯。會讓所有 status 都不能編輯。","C":"錯。隱藏欄位會連看都看不到。","D":"對。這個 workflow property 讓該 status 的 issue 不可編輯。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-workflow-properties/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-e06","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which are ways to set the Resolution field when resolving issues? (Choose two.)","zh":"解決 issue 時，可以用哪些方式設定 Resolution 欄位？（選兩個）","zo":["含 Resolution 欄位的 transition screen","更新 Resolution 欄位的 post function","把 Resolution 加到 issue create screen","把 Done status 改名為 Resolved","把 issue 移到 board 最後一欄"],"fig":"","opts":["A transition screen containing the Resolution field","A post function that updates the Resolution field","Adding Resolution to the issue create screen","Renaming the Done status to Resolved","Moving the issue to the last board column"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。轉換時讓使用者選。","B":"對。Post function 自動設值。","C":"錯。會讓 issue 一建立就被視為已解決。","D":"錯。Status 名稱與 resolution 無關。","E":"錯。CMP board 欄位不會設 resolution（TMP 的 Done 欄才會）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-e07","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user clicks a transition, fills the screen, and gets an error that 'Fix versions' is required. Which workflow component produced this?","zh":"使用者點了 transition、填完 screen 後，出現「Fix versions 必填」的錯誤。這是哪個 workflow 元件造成的？","zo":["Condition","Post function","Workflow property","Validator"],"fig":"","opts":["A condition","A post function","A workflow property","A validator"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Condition 不符時按鈕根本不會出現。","B":"錯。Post function 不檢查輸入。","C":"錯。Property 不會產生這種錯誤訊息。","D":"對。Validator 在提交時檢查輸入，不符就報錯。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-workflow-validators-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.2-e08","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project, Bugs need a different workflow than Tasks. What is true?","zh":"在 team-managed project，Bug 需要與 Task 不同的 workflow。何者正確？","zo":["所有 issue type 共用一個 workflow","要由 Jira admin 建立 workflow scheme","Team-managed project 沒有 workflow","每個 issue type 都能有自己的 workflow，由 project admin 編輯"],"fig":"","opts":["All issue types share one workflow","A Jira admin must create a workflow scheme","Team-managed projects don't have workflows","Each issue type can have its own workflow, edited by the project admin"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不必共用。","B":"錯。TMP 沒有 workflow scheme。","C":"錯。當然有 workflow。","D":"對。TMP 可為每個 issue type 設定各自的 workflow。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-work-flows-in-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.2-e09","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Only the QA role should be able to move issues out of 'In review' in a team-managed project. Which rule should be added?","zh":"在 team-managed project，只有 QA role 能把 issue 移出「In review」。應該加哪個 rule？","zo":["Copy the value of one field to another","Restrict to when a work item is a specific value","Restrict who can move a work item（role：QA）","Assign a work item to someone"],"fig":"","opts":["Copy the value of one field to another","Restrict to when a work item is a specific value","Restrict who can move a work item (role: QA)","Assign a work item to someone"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。這是複製欄位。","B":"錯。這是依欄位值限制，不是依人。","C":"對。限制誰能移動，可指定 role。","D":"錯。這是自動指派。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.2-e10","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Work must go through 'In review' immediately before 'Done' in a team-managed project. Which rule fits?","zh":"在 team-managed project，工作必須在 Done 之前剛好經過「In review」。適合哪個 rule？","zo":["Assign a work item to someone","Update a work item field","Validate that people have a specific permission","Restrict to when a work item has been through a status，並勾「Only consider the most recent status」"],"fig":"","opts":["Assign a work item to someone","Update a work item field","Validate that people have a specific permission","Restrict to when a work item has been through a status, with 'Only consider the most recent status'"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。指派不會限制流程。","B":"錯。更新欄位不會限制流程。","C":"錯。檢查權限，不是流程順序。","D":"對。官方範例：檢查最近的 status 是 In review。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.2-e11","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin renames the status 'Doing' to 'In progress' in a team-managed project. What is affected?","zh":"Project admin 在 team-managed project 把 status「Doing」改名為「In progress」。影響範圍？","zo":["只有這個 team-managed project","站上所有 project","所有 team-managed project","只影響 board、不影響 workflow"],"fig":"","opts":["Only that team-managed project","All projects on the site","All team-managed projects","Only the board, not the workflow"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。TMP 的 status 屬於該 project。","B":"錯。不是全站物件。","C":"錯。各 TMP 獨立。","D":"錯。Board 欄位與 status 連動。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-statuses-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.2-e12","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When an issue moves to 'In design' in a team-managed project, it should be assigned to the team's designer automatically. Which rule should be used?","zh":"在 team-managed project，issue 移到「In design」時要自動指派給團隊設計師。應使用哪個 rule？","zo":["Assign a work item to someone","Restrict who can move a work item","Restrict to when a work item has been through a status","Validate that people have a specific permission"],"fig":"","opts":["Assign a work item to someone","Restrict who can move a work item","Restrict to when a work item has been through a status","Validate that people have a specific permission"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方範例：移到 In design 時指派給設計師。","B":"錯。是限制，不是指派。","C":"錯。是限制流程。","D":"錯。是驗證權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.2-e13","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about statuses in team-managed projects are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 team-managed project 的 status，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Status 與 company-managed project 共用","刪除 status 會刪除其中的 issue","只有 Jira admin 能建立 status","每個 status 都有 To do、In progress 或 Done 的 category","在 board 加欄位會建立 status"],"fig":"","opts":["Statuses are shared with company-managed projects","Deleting a status deletes its issues","Only Jira admins can create statuses","Each status has a category of To do, In progress, or Done","Adding a column to the board creates a status"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 的 status 屬於自己。","B":"錯。刪除時要選把 issue 移到哪個 status。","C":"錯。Project admin 就能建立。","D":"對。Category 決定 board 與報表的分類。","E":"對。TMP 的 board 欄位與 status 連動。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-statuses-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.2-e14","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project, a 'Blocked' status should be reachable from any status. What should the project admin configure?","zh":"在 team-managed project，「Blocked」status 要能從任何 status 進入。Project admin 應設定什麼？","zo":["Workflow scheme 中的 condition","Post function","新的 board","設定允許所有 status 轉入 Blocked 的 transition"],"fig":"","opts":["A condition in a workflow scheme","A post function","A new board","A transition that allows all statuses to transition to Blocked"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 沒有 workflow scheme。","B":"錯。Post function 是 CMP 的概念，也不建立路徑。","C":"錯。不需要新 board。","D":"對。TMP 的 transition 可設定為所有 status 都能轉入。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-transitions-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-e15","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When a Story is transitioned to Done, all its sub-tasks should be transitioned to Done too. Which rule structure fits?","zh":"Story 轉到 Done 時，其所有 sub-task 也要轉到 Done。哪個 rule 結構適合？","zo":["只有 Action：轉換 sub-task，不用 branch","Trigger：Work item transitioned → Branch：For sub-tasks → Action：Transition to Done","Trigger：Scheduled → Action：轉換所有 issue","Trigger：Work item created → Condition：有 sub-task"],"fig":"","opts":["Action only: Transition sub-tasks, without a branch","Trigger: Work item transitioned → Branch: For sub-tasks → Action: Transition to Done","Trigger: Scheduled → Action: Transition all issues","Trigger: Work item created → Condition: sub-tasks exist"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。要用 branch 才能作用在相關 issue。","B":"對。用 branch 對每個 sub-task 執行轉換。","C":"錯。排程不會在 Story 轉 Done 時立即執行，也會影響所有 issue。","D":"錯。建立時觸發不符需求。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-branches/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-e16","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants one automation rule to run across five projects. What is true?","zh":"Project admin 希望一條 automation rule 在五個 project 執行。何者正確？","zo":["Rule 只能在一個 project 執行","每個 project 都要複製一份 rule","要由 Jira admin 建立成 multi-project（global）rule","Project admin 可以把 scope 設為多個 project"],"fig":"","opts":["Rules can only run in one project","Each project must copy the rule","A Jira admin must create it as a multi-project (global) rule","The project admin can set the scope to multiple projects"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Global rule 可跨 project。","B":"錯。不必複製。","C":"對。多 project 或 global scope 要 Jira admin。","D":"錯。Project admin 只能建單一 project 的 rule。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-e17","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An automation rule fails with a permission error when transitioning issues in the Payroll project. The permission scheme was recently tightened. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Automation rule 在 Payroll project 轉換 issue 時出現權限錯誤。最近 permission scheme 被收緊了。最可能的原因？","zo":["Rule 的 actor 不再擁有必要的 project 權限","Automation 會忽略權限","Rule 的 condition 太多","Trigger 必須是 scheduled"],"fig":"","opts":["The rule actor no longer has the required project permissions","Automation ignores permissions","The rule has too many conditions","The trigger must be scheduled"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Rule 以 actor 執行，actor 缺 Transition 等權限就會失敗。","B":"錯。Automation 受權限限制。","C":"錯。Condition 數量與權限無關。","D":"錯。Trigger 類型與權限無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-e18","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a branch for linked issues, an action must reference the summary of the issue that started the rule. Which smart value should be used?","zh":"在處理 linked issues 的 branch 中，action 要引用觸發 rule 的那張 issue 的 summary。應使用哪個 smart value？","zo":["{{issue.summary}}","{{parent.summary}}","{{now.summary}}","{{triggerIssue.summary}}"],"fig":"","opts":["{{issue.summary}}","{{parent.summary}}","{{now.summary}}","{{triggerIssue.summary}}"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。在 branch 中 {{issue}} 指目前 branch 處理的 issue。","B":"錯。parent 不一定是觸發 issue。","C":"錯。不存在。","D":"對。在 branch 中，{{triggerIssue}} 指觸發 rule 的原始 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/smart-values-in-jira-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-e19","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"High-priority issues should post a Slack message, and all other issues should get a comment, in one rule. What should be used?","zh":"同一條 rule 中，高優先 issue 要發 Slack 訊息，其他 issue 則加留言。應使用什麼？","zo":["兩個 trigger","For sub-tasks branch","Scheduled trigger","If/else block"],"fig":"","opts":["Two triggers","A branch for sub-tasks","A scheduled trigger","An If/else block"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。一條 rule 只能一個 trigger。","B":"錯。與 sub-task 無關。","C":"錯。不需要排程。","D":"對。If/else 依條件執行不同動作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-conditions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-e20","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which are valid branch targets in Jira automation? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些是 Jira automation 有效的 branch 目標？（選兩個）","zo":["Board columns","Linked issues","Sub-tasks","Dashboards","Permission schemes"],"fig":"","opts":["Board columns","Linked issues","Sub-tasks","Dashboards","Permission schemes"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。不是。","B":"對。可以對 linked issues 分支。","C":"對。可以對 sub-tasks 分支。","D":"錯。不是 branch 目標。","E":"錯。不是。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-branches/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-e21","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"By default, changes made by an automation rule appear in issue history as made by whom?","zh":"預設情況下，automation rule 做的變更在 issue history 中顯示為誰做的？","zo":["建立站台的 Jira admin","Automation for Jira","Rule owner","Project lead"],"fig":"","opts":["The Jira admin who created the site","Automation for Jira","The rule owner","The project lead"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不是。","B":"對。預設 actor 是 Automation for Jira。","C":"錯。Owner 收錯誤通知，不是預設 actor。","D":"錯。不是。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-a-rule-actor/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.1-e01","sec":"120.5.1","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The 'managers' group is a recipient of Issue Commented in the notification scheme, but Leo, a manager, doesn't receive emails for comments on HR issues that use a restricted security level. Why?","zh":"Notification scheme 中「managers」group 是 Issue Commented 的收件人，但經理 Leo 收不到 HR issue（使用受限 security level）的留言通知。為什麼？","zo":["留言永遠不會觸發通知","Leo 必須是 project lead","因為 issue security level，Leo 無法瀏覽這些 issue","Notification scheme 不能使用 group"],"fig":"","opts":["Comments never trigger notifications","Leo must be the project lead","Leo can't browse those issues because of the issue security level","Notification schemes can't use groups"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Issue Commented 會觸發。","B":"錯。不需要。","C":"對。收件人必須看得到 issue；security level 不含他就不會寄。","D":"錯。Scheme 可以用 group。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-notification-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.1-e02","sec":"120.5.1","dom":"120.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Only when an issue transitions to 'Escalated' should the support managers group be emailed. Which configuration is required? (Choose two.)","zh":"只有在 issue 轉到「Escalated」時，才寄 email 給 support managers group。需要哪些設定？（選兩個）","zo":["在 notification scheme 把 managers group 設為該 custom event 的收件人","把 managers 加到 Issue Updated","給 managers Browse users and groups","在 Escalate transition 加 validator","建立 custom event，並由 Escalate transition 的 post function 觸發"],"fig":"","opts":["Add the managers group as recipient of that custom event in the notification scheme","Add managers to Issue Updated","Give managers Browse users and groups","Add a validator to the Escalate transition","Create a custom event and fire it from the Escalate transition's post function"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Notification scheme 為該 event 設收件人。","B":"錯。Issue Updated 會在許多變更時寄。","C":"錯。與通知無關。","D":"錯。Validator 不寄信。","E":"對。Custom event 由 transition 的 post function 觸發。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-custom-event/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.1-e03","sec":"120.5.1","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can edit a notification scheme used by company-managed projects?","zh":"誰能編輯 company-managed project 使用的 notification scheme？","zo":["任何 watcher","Jira admin","任何 project admin","Project lead"],"fig":"","opts":["Any watcher","A Jira admin","Any project admin","The project lead"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不是。","B":"對。Notification scheme 是全站設定，要 Jira admin。","C":"錯。Project admin 只能看。","D":"錯。不是。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-notification-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.2-e04","sec":"120.5.2","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project, the Scrum master should be emailed when any work item is deleted. Who configures this and where?","zh":"在 team-managed project，任何 work item 被刪除時要寄信給 Scrum master。誰設定？在哪裡？","zo":["Project admin，在 Space settings > Notifications","Jira admin，在 notification scheme","每位使用者，在個人設定","Org admin，在 Atlassian Administration"],"fig":"","opts":["The project admin, in Space settings > Notifications","A Jira admin, in a notification scheme","Each user, in personal settings","An org admin, in Atlassian Administration"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。TMP 的通知由 project admin 在 project 設定。","B":"錯。TMP 沒有 notification scheme。","C":"錯。個人設定只能過濾自己的通知。","D":"錯。不是 org admin 的工作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-notifications-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.2-e05","sec":"120.5.2","dom":"120.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which recipients can be selected for team-managed project notifications? (Choose two.)","zh":"Team-managed project 的通知可以選哪些收件人？（選兩個）","zo":["Group custom field value","匿名使用者","Project role","All watchers","User custom field value"],"fig":"","opts":["A group custom field value","Anonymous users","A project role","All watchers","A user custom field value"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。不包含 group custom field。","B":"錯。不能。","C":"對。可以選 project role。","D":"對。可以選 all watchers。","E":"錯。TMP 的收件人不包含 user custom field。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-notifications-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.2-e06","sec":"120.5.2","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin deletes the 'Reviewer' role in a team-managed project. What happens to notifications that sent emails to that role?","zh":"Project admin 在 team-managed project 刪除了「Reviewer」role。原本寄給該 role 的通知會怎樣？","zo":["自動改寄給 Member role","自動被刪除","照常運作","失效，應手動移除"],"fig":"","opts":["They're automatically moved to the Member role","They're automatically deleted","They keep working","They stop working and should be removed manually"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不會自動轉移。","B":"錯。不會自動刪除。","C":"錯。不會繼續運作。","D":"對。官方：刪除 role 後相關通知失效，要手動移除。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-notifications-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.3-e07","sec":"120.5.3","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mia is a watcher, and the notification scheme notifies all watchers of comments, but she gets no emails. Her permissions are fine. What should be checked?","zh":"Mia 是 watcher，notification scheme 也設定通知所有 watcher 留言，但她收不到任何信。她的權限沒問題。應檢查什麼？","zo":["Mia 的個人通知設定","Project 的 issue type scheme","Board filter","SLA calendar"],"fig":"","opts":["Mia's personal notification settings","The project's issue type scheme","The board filter","The SLA calendar"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。個人設定可能關掉了 watching 的 email 或整個 issue 活動 email。","B":"錯。無關。","C":"錯。無關。","D":"錯。無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-your-jira-personal-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.3-e08","sec":"120.5.3","dom":"120.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about personal notification settings are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於個人通知設定，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["它可以覆蓋 issue security","不能針對 project 客製","它是疊在 admin 通知設定之上的濾網","使用者可以關掉自己是 reporter 的 work item email","使用者可以收到 admin 沒設定的通知"],"fig":"","opts":["They override issue security","They can't be customized per project","They act as a filter on top of the admin's notification settings","Users can turn off email for work items where they're the reporter","Users can receive notifications the admin hasn't configured"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。不能繞過權限。","B":"錯。可以針對最多 50 個 space 客製。","C":"對。官方：個人設定像濾網。","D":"對。可以選擇不收自己是 reporter 的通知。","E":"錯。不能多收。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-your-jira-personal-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.3-e09","sec":"120.5.3","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user wants to automatically become a watcher of every issue they create or comment on. Which setting does this?","zh":"使用者希望自己建立或留言的每張 issue 都自動成為 watcher。哪個設定能做到？","zo":["個人 General settings 的 Watch your work items","Notify me of my own changes","Browse users and groups","Filter subscription"],"fig":"","opts":["Watch your work items in personal general settings","Notify me of my own changes","Browse users and groups","A filter subscription"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。開啟後自己建立或留言的 issue 會自動 watch。","B":"錯。那是讓自己的變更也通知自己。","C":"錯。權限無關。","D":"錯。訂閱 filter 不會 watch issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-your-jira-personal-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.4-e10","sec":"120.5.4","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Emails from customers who aren't Jira users are ignored by the mail handler. What should be configured?","zh":"Mail handler 忽略了不是 Jira 使用者的客戶來信。應該設定什麼？","zo":["Bulk = accept","在目標 project 有建立權限的 Default reporter","Catch email address","Strip quotes"],"fig":"","opts":["Bulk = accept","A Default reporter with permission to create issues in the target project","Catch email address","Strip quotes"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。只影響自動寄出的 bulk 信。","B":"對。寄件人不是使用者時以 default reporter 建立，原寄件人會寫在 description。","C":"錯。只過濾收件別名。","D":"錯。只移除引用文字。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-issues-and-comments-from-email/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.4-e11","sec":"120.5.4","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"With 'CC assignee' enabled, an email is sent To: jira@company.com, CC: nobody@external.com (not a user), BCC: mia@company.com (a user). Who becomes the assignee?","zh":"開啟「CC assignee」後，email 寄給 To：jira@company.com、CC：nobody@external.com（非使用者）、BCC：mia@company.com（使用者）。誰會被指派？","zo":["Mia，因為 CC 與 To 都沒有有效使用者，所以會看 BCC","nobody@external.com","沒有人，因為 CC 無效","Default reporter"],"fig":"","opts":["Mia, because no valid user is in CC or To, so BCC is checked","nobody@external.com","No one, because CC is invalid","The default reporter"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。依序看 CC → To → BCC 中第一個有效使用者。","B":"錯。不是 Jira 使用者。","C":"錯。CC 無效時會繼續找 To 與 BCC。","D":"錯。Default reporter 是 reporter，不是 assignee。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-issues-and-comments-from-email/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.4-e12","sec":"120.5.4","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A reply email with the subject 'Re: [OPS-142] Server down' arrives at a 'Create a new issue or add a comment' handler. What happens?","zh":"主旨為「Re: [OPS-142] Server down」的回信送到「Create a new issue or add a comment」handler。會怎樣？","zo":["建立一張新 issue","Email 被忽略","OPS-142 被關閉","Email 被加為 OPS-142 的留言"],"fig":"","opts":["A new issue is created","The email is ignored","OPS-142 is closed","The email is added as a comment on OPS-142"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。沒有 key 時才建新 issue。","B":"錯。不會忽略。","C":"錯。不會轉換 status。","D":"對。主旨有 issue key 時留言到該 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-issues-and-comments-from-email/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.1-e01","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A manager wants WEB project issues that are either High priority or labeled 'urgent'. Which JQL is correct?","zh":"經理想要 WEB project 中「High priority 或有 urgent label」的 issue。哪段 JQL 正確？","zo":["(project = WEB AND priority = High) OR labels = urgent","project = WEB AND (priority = High OR labels = urgent)","project = WEB AND priority = High OR labels = urgent","project = WEB OR priority = High AND labels = urgent"],"fig":"","opts":["(project = WEB AND priority = High) OR labels = urgent","project = WEB AND (priority = High OR labels = urgent)","project = WEB AND priority = High OR labels = urgent","project = WEB OR priority = High AND labels = urgent"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。與 B 相同，會包含其他 project 的 urgent issue。","B":"對。括號讓 OR 只作用在 priority 與 labels，並限定 WEB。","C":"錯。沒有括號時這句等於 (WEB AND High) OR urgent，會把其他 project 的 urgent issue 也找出來。","D":"錯。邏輯完全不同。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.1-e02","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL returns issues created last calendar month?","zh":"哪段 JQL 能找出上個日曆月建立的 issue？","zo":["created >= -30d","created = lastMonth()","created > endOfMonth(-1)","created >= startOfMonth(-1) AND created < startOfMonth()"],"fig":"","opts":["created >= -30d","created = lastMonth()","created > endOfMonth(-1)","created >= startOfMonth(-1) AND created < startOfMonth()"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。過去 30 天不等於上個日曆月。","B":"錯。沒有這個函數。","C":"錯。這是本月開始之後。","D":"對。上個月第一天起、到本月第一天之前。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.1-e03","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL finds issues whose priority was ever High, including issues created as High and never changed?","zh":"哪段 JQL 能找出 priority 曾經是 High 的 issue（包含建立時就是 High、從未改過的）？","zo":["priority CHANGED TO High","priority = High","priority CHANGED FROM High","priority WAS High"],"fig":"","opts":["priority CHANGED TO High","priority = High","priority CHANGED FROM High","priority WAS High"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。CHANGED 只找有改過的，建立時就是 High 的會漏。","B":"錯。只找目前是 High 的。","C":"錯。只找從 High 改走的。","D":"對。WAS 包含目前與過去的值，含建立時的值。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.1-e04","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements describe limitations of basic search compared with JQL? (Choose two.)","zh":"與 JQL 相比，basic search 有哪些限制？（選兩個）","zo":["Basic search 不能存成 filter","Basic search 不能用 OR 組合不同欄位的條件","Basic search 不能用 WAS 或 CHANGED 等歷史 operator","Basic search 不能篩選 project","Basic search 不能篩選 status"],"fig":"","opts":["Basic search can't save filters","Basic search can't combine conditions across different fields with OR","Basic search can't use history operators like WAS or CHANGED","Basic search can't filter by project","Basic search can't filter by status"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。可以存成 filter。","B":"對。跨欄位 OR 需要 JQL。","C":"對。歷史查詢需要 JQL。","D":"錯。可以選 project。","E":"錯。可以選 status。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/perform-a-basic-search/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.1-e05","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL lists overdue, unresolved issues assigned to members of the 'support' group?","zh":"哪段 JQL 能列出指派給「support」group 成員、已過期且未解決的 issue？","zo":["assignee IN membersOf(\"support\") AND status = Done","assignee IN membersOf(\"support\") AND duedate < now() AND resolution = Unresolved","assignee = support AND duedate < now()","group = support AND status != Done"],"fig":"","opts":["assignee IN membersOf(\"support\") AND status = Done","assignee IN membersOf(\"support\") AND duedate < now() AND resolution = Unresolved","assignee = support AND duedate < now()","group = support AND status != Done"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。找的是已完成的。","B":"對。membersOf 取 group 成員，duedate < now() 為過期，resolution = Unresolved 為未解決。","C":"錯。support 是 group 不是使用者，也漏了未解決。","D":"錯。沒有 group 欄位；status != Done 也不等於未解決。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.1-e06","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"How can a custom field named 'Story Points' be referenced in JQL? (Choose two.)","zh":"JQL 中可以用哪些方式引用名為「Story Points」的 custom field？（選兩個）","zo":["storypoints() > 5","field.StoryPoints > 5","\"Story Points\" > 5","cf[10016] > 5（使用欄位 ID）","Story_Points > 5"],"fig":"","opts":["storypoints() > 5","field.StoryPoints > 5","\"Story Points\" > 5","cf[10016] > 5 (using its field ID)","Story_Points > 5"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。不是 function。","B":"錯。不是 JQL 語法。","C":"對。有空白的欄位名稱要加引號。","D":"對。也可以用 cf[欄位 ID]。","E":"錯。不能自行改名。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.2-e07","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A filter using 'assignee = currentUser()' is subscribed to the 'support' group. What does each member receive?","zh":"使用「assignee = currentUser()」的 filter 被訂閱給「support」group。每位成員會收到什麼？","zo":["不管 assignee，filter 中所有 issue","什麼都沒有，因為 currentUser() 在訂閱中無效","指派給自己的 issue","指派給 filter 擁有者的 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["All issues in the filter regardless of assignee","Nothing, because currentUser() doesn't work in subscriptions","Issues assigned to themselves","Issues assigned to the filter owner"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。仍套用條件。","B":"錯。可以運作。","C":"對。訂閱時 currentUser() 依每位收件人分別計算。","D":"錯。不是依建立者計算。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/work-with-search-results/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.2-e08","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team lead can't create a filter subscription for the 'qa-team' group, but can subscribe herself. What is missing?","zh":"Team lead 能訂閱給自己，卻無法替「qa-team」group 建立 filter subscription。缺少什麼？","zo":["Share dashboards and filters","Browse users and groups","Administer Projects","Manage group filter subscriptions 全域權限"],"fig":"","opts":["Share dashboards and filters","Browse users and groups","Administer Projects","Manage group filter subscriptions global permission"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。那是分享權限。","B":"錯。與訂閱無關。","C":"錯。不是 project 權限問題。","D":"對。訂閱給 group 需要這個全域權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.2-e09","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A dashboard is shared with the Sales group, but some Sales members see empty gadgets. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Dashboard 分享給 Sales group，但部分 Sales 成員看到的 gadget 是空的。最可能的原因？","zo":["Dashboard 只能分享給個人","Gadget 需要 Administer Jira","Dashboard 必須是 default dashboard","他們對 gadget filter 中的 project 沒有 Browse 權限"],"fig":"","opts":["Dashboards can only be shared with individuals","Gadgets require Administer Jira","The dashboard must be the default dashboard","They lack Browse permission on the projects in the gadget's filter"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。可以分享給 group。","B":"錯。不需要。","C":"錯。不需要。","D":"對。被分享的人只看得到自己有權限的 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/save-your-search-as-a-filter/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.2-e10","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A subscription should send an email every weekday at 9:00 even when the filter returns no issues. Which settings are needed? (Choose two.)","zh":"訂閱要在每個工作日 9:00 寄信，即使 filter 沒有結果也要寄。需要哪些設定？（選兩個）","zo":["勾選「Email this filter even if there are no issues found」","公開分享 filter","把 filter 加到 dashboard","給 Make bulk changes","排程：Days per week，週一到週五，9:00"],"fig":"","opts":["Select 'Email this filter even if there are no issues found'","Share the filter publicly","Add the filter to a dashboard","Grant Make bulk changes","Schedule: days per week, Monday to Friday, at 9:00"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。預設沒結果不寄，要勾這個。","B":"錯。不需要公開。","C":"錯。與訂閱無關。","D":"錯。無關。","E":"對。依週間排程。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/work-with-search-results/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.2-e11","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which global permission is required to share a filter with a group?","zh":"把 filter 分享給 group 需要哪個全域權限？","zo":["Manage group filter subscriptions","Browse users and groups","Make bulk changes","Share dashboards and filters"],"fig":"","opts":["Manage group filter subscriptions","Browse users and groups","Make bulk changes","Share dashboards and filters"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。那是訂閱給 group。","B":"錯。無關。","C":"錯。無關。","D":"對。分享 filter 與 dashboard 需要這個權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.2-e12","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A report must be emailed on the last business day of every month. Which subscription schedule option fits?","zh":"報表要在每月最後一個工作天寄出。哪個訂閱排程適合？","zo":["Daily","Days per week","Hourly","Advanced（cron 表達式）"],"fig":"","opts":["Daily","Days per week","Hourly","Advanced (cron expression)"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。每天會寄太多。","B":"錯。週間排程無法表達月底最後一個工作天。","C":"錯。沒有這個需求。","D":"對。複雜排程用 advanced（cron）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/work-with-search-results/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.3-e13","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user has Make bulk changes but the 'Move issues' option is unavailable for issues in project HR. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"使用者有 Make bulk changes，但 HR project 的 issue 沒有「Move issues」選項。最可能的原因？","zo":["Bulk move 需要 Administer Jira","Move 上限 100 個 issue","Move 只能用於 team-managed project","他在 HR 缺少 Move Issues 權限（或在目標 project 缺少 Create Issues）"],"fig":"","opts":["Bulk move requires Administer Jira","Move is limited to 100 issues","Move is only available for team-managed projects","They lack the Move Issues permission in HR (or Create Issues in the destination)"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不需要 Jira admin。","B":"錯。上限是 1,000。","C":"錯。兩種 project 都可以。","D":"對。Bulk 還要每個動作對應的 project 權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.3-e14","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin bulk-edits 300 issues, choosing 'Replace all with' for Labels with the value 'archived'. What happens to existing labels?","zh":"Admin 對 300 張 issue 做 bulk edit，Labels 選「Replace all with」並填「archived」。原本的 label 會怎樣？","zo":["只更新沒有 label 的 issue","被移除並換成「archived」","加上「archived」並保留原 label","沒有變化"],"fig":"","opts":["Only issues without labels are updated","They are removed and replaced by 'archived'","'archived' is added, keeping existing labels","Nothing changes"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。全部都會更新。","B":"對。Replace all with 會清掉原值。","C":"錯。那是 Add to existing。","D":"錯。會變更。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.3-e15","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Selected issues use two different workflows. What happens when the user chooses to bulk transition them?","zh":"選取的 issue 使用兩種不同 workflow。使用者選擇 bulk transition 時會怎樣？","zo":["依 workflow 分組，一次轉換一組","全部一起轉換","整個操作被擋下","Jira 把它們轉成同一個 workflow"],"fig":"","opts":["Issues are grouped by workflow and transitioned one group at a time","All issues transition together","The operation is blocked entirely","Jira converts them to the same workflow"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：不同 workflow 要分組，一次一組。","B":"錯。不能一起轉換。","C":"錯。不是完全擋下。","D":"錯。不會改 workflow。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.3-e16","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Issues are bulk-moved from a company-managed project to a team-managed project. Which data is permanently lost? (Choose two.)","zh":"把 issue 從 company-managed project bulk move 到 team-managed project。哪些資料會永久遺失？（選兩個）","zo":["Comments","Components","Versions","Summary","Description"],"fig":"","opts":["Comments","Components","Versions","Summary","Description"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。會保留。","B":"對。官方：components 不會保留。","C":"對。官方：version 資訊不會保留。","D":"錯。會保留。","E":"錯。會保留。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/migrate-between-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.3-e17","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin wants to bulk-edit 2,500 issues at once. What is true?","zh":"Admin 想一次 bulk edit 2,500 張 issue。何者正確？","zo":["上限是 100","只有 Jira admin 能一次超過 1,000","Bulk 操作一次最多 1,000 張","沒有上限"],"fig":"","opts":["The limit is 100","Only Jira admins can bulk edit more than 1,000","Bulk operations are limited to 1,000 issues at a time","There's no limit"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。上限是 1,000。","B":"錯。上限對所有人都一樣。","C":"對。一次最多 1,000 個。","D":"錯。有上限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.3-e18","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"During a large bulk edit, the admin wants to avoid flooding watchers with emails. What can be done?","zh":"大量 bulk edit 時，admin 想避免大量 email 寄給 watcher。可以怎麼做？","zo":["在可用時取消勾選「Send mail for this update」","先移除所有 watcher","永久停用 notification scheme","逐張編輯"],"fig":"","opts":["Clear 'Send mail for this update' when available","Remove all watchers first","Disable the notification scheme permanently","Edit issues one by one"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：可以取消勾選以避免通知轟炸。","B":"錯。不必要且會失去 watcher。","C":"錯。過度且影響日常通知。","D":"錯。不切實際。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.2-e19","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team lead with Manage group filter subscriptions wants to subscribe the 'finance' group to her filter, but the group doesn't appear in the recipient list. What is the most likely reason?","zh":"擁有 Manage group filter subscriptions 的 team lead 想把她的 filter 訂閱給「finance」group，但收件人清單中沒有這個 group。最可能的原因？","zo":["Filter 必須公開分享","她只能選擇自己是成員的 group","Group 不能接收訂閱","Filter 結果超過 200 筆"],"fig":"","opts":["The filter must be shared publicly","She can only select groups she is a member of","Groups can't receive subscriptions","The filter returns more than 200 results"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不需要公開分享。","B":"對。官方：指定 group 為收件人時，只能選自己是成員的 group。","C":"錯。有權限時可以訂閱給 group。","D":"錯。超過 200 筆只是信中只列前 200 筆，不影響能否選 group。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.1-e01","sec":"120.7.1","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin changes the user default email format from HTML to Text. Existing users still receive HTML emails. Why?","zh":"Jira admin 把使用者預設 email 格式從 HTML 改成 Text，既有使用者仍收到 HTML。為什麼？","zo":["Email 格式不能改","Notification scheme 覆蓋了它","使用者要先登出","User default settings 只套用到新使用者，除非 admin 把變更套用到既有使用者"],"fig":"","opts":["Email format can't be changed","The notification scheme overrides it","Users need to log out first","User default settings apply to new users unless the admin applies the change to existing users"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。可以改。","B":"錯。Notification scheme 不決定格式。","C":"錯。不需要。","D":"對。官方：user default settings 在建立帳號時套用；要讓既有使用者也改用 Text，admin 要按 Email format 的 Apply，這會強制所有使用者使用該格式（使用者之後不能再改）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-user-default-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.1-e02","sec":"120.7.1","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A planned maintenance notice must appear at the top of Jira for everyone, including anonymous visitors to public projects. What should be configured?","zh":"計畫性維護公告必須出現在 Jira 頂端給所有人看，包括瀏覽公開 project 的匿名訪客。應設定什麼？","zo":["Private announcement banner","Dashboard gadget","Filter subscription","Public announcement banner"],"fig":"","opts":["A private announcement banner","A dashboard gadget","A filter subscription","A public announcement banner"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Private 只給登入者。","B":"錯。Dashboard 不在每頁頂端。","C":"錯。訂閱是寄信。","D":"對。Public banner 所有人（含匿名）都看得到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-look-and-feel-of-jira-applications/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.1-e03","sec":"120.7.1","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Users who haven't created their own dashboard should see a company-wide set of gadgets. Who can configure this and where?","zh":"還沒建立自己 dashboard 的使用者，應看到全公司一致的 gadget。誰能設定？在哪裡？","zo":["每位使用者，在個人設定","Org admin，在 Atlassian Administration","Jira admin，編輯 default（system）dashboard","任何 project admin，在 Project settings"],"fig":"","opts":["Each user, in personal settings","An org admin, in Atlassian Administration","A Jira admin, by editing the default (system) dashboard","Any project admin, from Project settings"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。個人只能改自己的。","B":"錯。不在 Atlassian Administration。","C":"對。Default dashboard 由 Jira admin 編輯。","D":"錯。Project admin 不能改。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-default-dashboard/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.1-e04","sec":"120.7.1","dom":"120.7","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about user default settings and personal settings are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 user default settings 與 personal settings，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["預設值永遠覆蓋個人設定","Personal settings 可以授予權限","預設值只套用到匿名使用者","Personal settings 對該使用者覆蓋預設值","Default settings 由 Jira admin 設定"],"fig":"","opts":["Defaults always override personal settings","Personal settings can grant permissions","Defaults apply only to anonymous users","Personal settings override the defaults for that user","Default settings are configured by a Jira admin"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。相反。","B":"錯。不能給權限。","C":"錯。預設也給新使用者。","D":"對。個人設定優先。","E":"對。由 Jira admin 設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-user-default-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.2-e05","sec":"120.7.2","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After a Jira admin changes 'Working hours per day' from 8 to 6, an estimate previously shown as '1d' now displays differently. Why?","zh":"Jira admin 把「Working hours per day」從 8 改成 6 後，原本顯示為「1d」的估計顯示改變了。為什麼？","zo":["Time tracking 被停用","Board 的 estimation 改變了","估計以時間單位儲存，「天」的換算改變了","估計被刪除了"],"fig":"","opts":["Time tracking was disabled","The board estimation changed","Estimates are stored in time units, and the day conversion changed","The estimates were deleted"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。沒有停用。","B":"錯。與 board 無關。","C":"對。估計以時間單位儲存，改 hours per day 會改變「天」的換算顯示。","D":"錯。沒有被刪除。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.2-e06","sec":"120.7.2","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Users with the Link Issues permission can't find the Link option anywhere. Other features work. What should the Jira admin check?","zh":"有 Link Issues 權限的使用者到處都找不到 Link 選項，其他功能正常。Jira admin 應檢查什麼？","zo":["Project 是否有 components","全站是否啟用 issue linking","是否啟用 time tracking","使用者是否有 Browse users and groups"],"fig":"","opts":["Whether the project has components","Whether issue linking is enabled globally","Whether time tracking is enabled","Whether the users have Browse users and groups"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。無關。","B":"對。全站關閉 issue linking 時看不到 Link。","C":"錯。無關。","D":"錯。無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-linking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.2-e07","sec":"120.7.2","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin disables time tracking for a month, then re-enables it. What happens to previously logged work?","zh":"Jira admin 停用 time tracking 一個月後再重新啟用。之前記錄的工時會怎樣？","zo":["保留，並再次顯示","被永久刪除","轉成 story points","移到留言"],"fig":"","opts":["It is preserved and visible again","It is permanently deleted","It is converted to story points","It is moved to comments"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。停用只是隱藏，重新開啟後資料仍在。","B":"錯。不會刪除。","C":"錯。不會轉換。","D":"錯。不會。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.3-e08","sec":"120.7.3","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin renames the status 'In Review' to 'Peer Review' in a company-managed workflow. Which projects see the new name?","zh":"Jira admin 在 company-managed workflow 把 status「In Review」改名為「Peer Review」。哪些 project 會看到新名稱？","zo":["只有編輯 workflow 的那個 project","只有 team-managed project","要重新索引才會","所有 workflow 使用該 status 的 project"],"fig":"","opts":["Only the project where the workflow was edited","Only team-managed projects","None until re-indexing","All projects whose workflows use that status"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不限單一 project。","B":"錯。TMP 的 status 各自獨立。","C":"錯。不需要。","D":"對。CMP 的 status 是全站物件。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-statuses-resolutions-and-priorities/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.3-e09","sec":"120.7.3","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The Support project needs a different set of priorities from the Engineering project. What should the Jira admin use?","zh":"Support project 需要和 Engineering project 不同的 priority 清單。Jira admin 應使用什麼？","zo":["Workflow properties","Priority schemes","Priority 的 field context","兩個 notification scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Workflow properties","Priority schemes","Field contexts on Priority","Two notification schemes"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。無關。","B":"對。Priority scheme 讓不同 project 用不同 priority 清單。","C":"錯。Priority 是系統欄位，用 priority scheme 管理。","D":"錯。無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-statuses-priorities-and-resolutions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.3-e10","sec":"120.7.3","dom":"120.7","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about renaming statuses are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 status 改名，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Team-managed 的 status 名稱全站共用","只有 project admin 能改 company-managed 的 status 名稱","在 team-managed project 改 status 名稱只影響該 project","改 company-managed 的 status 名稱會影響所有使用它的 workflow","改 status 名稱會讓所有已存 filter 失效"],"fig":"","opts":["Team-managed status names are shared site-wide","Only project admins can rename company-managed statuses","Renaming a status in a team-managed project affects only that project","Renaming a company-managed status affects all workflows using it","Renaming a status breaks all saved filters"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。不共用。","B":"錯。要 Jira admin。","C":"對。TMP 的 status 屬於自己。","D":"對。CMP 的 status 是全站共用。","E":"錯。Filter 以 ID 儲存，不會壞。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-statuses-resolutions-and-priorities/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-statuses-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.4-e11","sec":"120.7.4","dom":"120.7","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which data is NOT included in a Jira Cloud backup from Backup manager? (Choose two.)","zh":"Backup manager 產生的 Jira Cloud backup 不包含哪些資料？（選兩個）","zo":["第三方 app 資料","Issue 留言","Workflow 與 scheme","Archived projects","Automation rules"],"fig":"","opts":["Third-party app data","Issue comments","Workflows and schemes","Archived projects","Automation rules"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。第三方 app 資料不包含。","B":"錯。留言包含在內。","C":"錯。設定包含在內。","D":"錯。Archived projects 包含在內。","E":"對。官方：automation rules 不會匯出，要另外匯出匯入。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/export-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.4-e12","sec":"120.7.4","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin creates a backup including attachments at 10:00 on Monday and wants another one including attachments at 15:00 the same day. What happens?","zh":"Admin 週一 10:00 建立了含附件的 backup，想在同日 15:00 再建一份含附件的。會怎樣？","zo":["附件永遠不能備份","每月只能備份一次","含附件的 backup 之間必須間隔 48 小時","可以立即建立"],"fig":"","opts":["Attachments can never be backed up","Only one backup per month is allowed","They must wait 48 hours between backups that include attachments","It works immediately"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。可以勾選包含附件。","B":"錯。沒有這種限制。","C":"對。官方：含附件、avatar、logo 時兩次 backup 間隔 48 小時。","D":"錯。含附件有間隔限制。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/export-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.4-e13","sec":"120.7.4","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin imports a full Jira Cloud backup file into a site that already has active projects. What is the impact?","zh":"Admin 把完整的 Jira Cloud backup 匯入一個已有運作中 project 的站台。影響為何？","zo":["Backup 會與現有 project 合併","只會新增新的 issue","Archived projects 會被略過","站上現有資料被 backup 的資料覆蓋"],"fig":"","opts":["The backup is merged with existing projects","Only new issues are added","Archived projects are skipped","Existing data on the site is overwritten by the backup's data"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不會合併。","B":"錯。不是只新增。","C":"錯。官方 Learning 課程把 archived spaces 列在 backup 內容中，匯入時會一起還原（是否維持封存狀態官方未明說）。","D":"對。匯入完整 backup 會覆蓋現有資料；archived projects 也會一起還原。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/atlassian-cloud/kb/partial-or-selective-import-of-a-jira-backup-export-into-jira-cloud/","https://community.atlassian.com/learning/lesson/jira-cloud-backup-and-restore"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-b01","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Which statements about these users are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。關於這些使用者，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Acme 不能修改 Jane 的帳號資料","Acme 可以完全刪除 Jane 的帳號","Liam 是 external user","兩人都用 acme.com，所以都是 managed account","Acme 可以停用 Liam 的帳號"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 234\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Users\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"232.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Users</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Directory</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-green\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">liam@acme.com</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Managed（claimed）</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"126\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">jane@acme.com</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">External（not claimed）</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"152\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">jane@gmail.com</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">External</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Verified domains</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"209\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">acme.com</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"232.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Jane's account details can't be updated by Acme","Jane can be deleted entirely by Acme","Liam is an external user","Both are managed accounts because they use acme.com","Liam's account can be deactivated by Acme"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Jane 未被 claim，是 external user，Acme 不能改她的帳號資料。","B":"錯。External user 不能被 Acme 刪除帳號。","C":"錯。Liam 是 managed。","D":"錯。要 claim 才算 managed。","E":"對。Liam 的 domain 已驗證且帳號已 claim，是 managed account。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-managed-accounts/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-b02","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A contractor's engagement ended and the company won't rehire them. Their account isn't managed by the company. What is the appropriate action?","zh":"外包合約結束，公司不會再聘用。他的帳號不是公司管理的帳號。適當的做法是？","zo":["刪除他的 Atlassian 帳號","停用（deactivate）帳號","修改他的帳號名稱","把使用者移出 organization"],"fig":"","opts":["Delete the contractor's Atlassian account","Deactivate the account","Rename their account","Remove the user from the organization"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。只能刪除 managed account。","B":"錯。Deactivate 只適用 managed account。","C":"錯。不能修改 external user 的資料。","D":"對。External user 只能移除他在你們 organization 的存取。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/","https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-managed-accounts/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-b03","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin removes a user from the organization and invites them again a month later. What must the admin do?","zh":"Admin 把某使用者移出 organization，一個月後再邀請回來。Admin 必須做什麼？","zo":["重新啟用他的 managed account","重新指定使用者的角色與 group","什麼都不用，group 會自動恢復","從 trash 還原使用者"],"fig":"","opts":["Reactivate the user's managed account","Reassign the user's roles and group memberships","Nothing; groups are restored automatically","Restore the user from the trash"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Remove 與 deactivate 不同。","B":"對。官方：remove 後重新邀請，要重新指定角色與 group。","C":"錯。只有 suspend 後 restore 才會恢復。","D":"錯。沒有使用者 trash。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-b04","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about suspending a user's access are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於暫停（suspend）使用者存取，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["被暫停的使用者仍能登入 Jira","只有 project admin 能暫停使用者","暫停期間不計費","還原後角色與 group 成員資格都回來","暫停會刪除他的內容"],"fig":"","opts":["Suspended users can still log in to Jira","Only project admins can suspend users","The user isn't billed while suspended","Restoring access returns their roles and group memberships","Suspending deletes their content"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。不能登入使用 app。","B":"錯。是 org admin（或 user access admin）。","C":"對。暫停期間不計費。","D":"對。Restore 後角色與 group 回來。","E":"錯。不會刪內容。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/remove-or-suspend-a-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-b05","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin plans to delete the 'old-contractors' group, which is still granted Browse Projects in a permission scheme. What does Atlassian recommend?","zh":"Admin 打算刪除仍在 permission scheme 中有 Browse Projects 的「old-contractors」group。Atlassian 建議怎麼做？","zo":["直接刪除，權限會自動清理","改名而不是刪除","先刪除使用者","先移除該 group 的權限，避免日後建立同名 group 時權限自動回來"],"fig":"","opts":["Delete the group directly; permissions are cleaned up automatically","Rename the group instead of deleting it","Delete the users first","Remove the group's permissions first, so they aren't automatically reassigned if a group with the same name is created later"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。官方特別提醒要先處理權限。","B":"錯。不是官方建議。","C":"錯。刪 group 不需要先刪使用者。","D":"對。官方：先移除權限，避免日後重建同名 group 時權限自動回來。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/delete-a-group/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-b06","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. With these settings, what happens when a new employee with an acme.com address tries to access Jira?","zh":"請看圖。在這些設定下，使用 acme.com 地址的新員工想存取 Jira 時會怎樣？","zo":["成為 organization admin","要等 admin 核准他的存取申請","不用核准，立即取得存取","完全不能申請存取"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 237\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"User access settings\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"235.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">User access settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Approved domains</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">acme.com</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Jira：User</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"129\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M15,136 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Required：admins must approve requests</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"169\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">User invites</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"182\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"186\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Invite anyone</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"203\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"203\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"207\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Only admins can invite</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"235.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["They become an organization admin","They must wait for an admin to approve their access request","They get access immediately without approval","They can't request access at all"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不會給 admin。","B":"對。Approved domain 勾了 Required 時需要 admin 核准；取消勾選才是即時加入。","C":"錯。圖中勾了 Required。","D":"錯。可以申請，只是要核准。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/control-how-users-get-access-to-products/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-b07","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Regular users report they can invite colleagues from any email domain to Jira without admin approval. Which setting explains this?","zh":"一般使用者回報，他們不用 admin 核准就能邀請任何 email 網域的同事進 Jira。是哪個設定造成的？","zo":["他們有 Administer Jira 權限","他們在 Administrators project role","開啟了匿名存取","User invites 設為「Invite anyone」"],"fig":"","opts":["They have the Administer Jira permission","They're in the Administrators project role","Anonymous access is enabled","User invites is set to 'Invite anyone'"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Administer Jira 不管邀請。","B":"錯。Project role 不影響邀請到站台。","C":"錯。匿名存取與邀請無關。","D":"對。官方：Invite anyone 允許使用者邀請任何 domain 的人，不需 org admin 核准。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/control-how-users-get-access-to-products/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-b08","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A company wants anonymous visitors to submit bug reports in a public company-managed project without seeing internal comments or editing issues. Which permissions can be granted to Public? (Choose two.)","zh":"公司希望匿名訪客能在公開的 company-managed project 回報 bug，但不能看內部留言、不能編輯 issue。哪些權限可以給 Public？（選兩個）","zo":["Assign Issues","Transition Issues","Browse Projects","Create Issues","Edit Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Assign Issues","Transition Issues","Browse Projects","Create Issues","Edit Issues"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。只能給受邀使用者。","B":"錯。只能給受邀使用者。","C":"對。Browse 可以給 Public。","D":"對。官方：Create work items 可以給 Public，讓任何能連到站台的人建立。","E":"錯。只能給受邀使用者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-permissions-to-make-a-space-publicly-visible/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.1-b09","sec":"120.1.1","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira site is on the Free plan. The admin wants to make a project publicly visible. What is true?","zh":"Jira 站台是 Free 方案。Admin 想讓某 project 公開可見。何者正確？","zo":["改用 Open access 的 team-managed project","在個人設定開啟匿名存取","Free 方案站台的 project 不能公開","把 Browse Projects 給 Public"],"fig":"","opts":["Use a team-managed project with Open access","Enable anonymous access in personal settings","Projects on Free Jira sites can't be opened to the public","Grant Browse Projects to Public"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 不支援匿名。","B":"錯。個人設定無關。","C":"對。官方：Free 方案的 project 不能公開。","D":"錯。Free 方案不行。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-permissions-to-make-a-space-publicly-visible/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-b10","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Mia is a site admin but isn't in the jira-admins group. Which can she do? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。Mia 是 site admin，但不在 jira-admins group。她能做哪些事？（選兩個）","zo":["管理 site 上的 Marketplace app","編輯 company-managed workflow","編輯 permission scheme","指派 organization admin 角色","管理 site 上安裝的 app"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 244\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mia Chen\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"242.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Users</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Mia Chen</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Roles</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Site admin（acme.atlassian.net）</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Jira：User</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Groups</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"196\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">site-admins</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"222\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"222\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"214\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">jira-users-acme</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"214\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"242.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Manage Marketplace apps on the site","Edit a company-managed workflow","Edit permission schemes","Assign the organization admin role","Manage apps installed on the site"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Site admin 管理 Marketplace app。","B":"錯。要 Administer Jira（Jira admin）。","C":"錯。要 Jira admin。","D":"錯。只有 org admin 能指派 org admin。","E":"對。Site admin 管理 site 上的 app。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-b11","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about app admins are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 app admin，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Jira 的 app admin 角色是在 Jira Administration 授予","他們可以指派其他 Jira app admin","自動取得 organization admin 角色","管理 organization 的帳單","他們不能進入 Atlassian Administration"],"fig":"","opts":["For Jira, the app admin role is granted on Jira Administration","They can assign other app admins for Jira","They automatically get the organization admin role","They manage billing for the organization","They can't access Atlassian Administration"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。官方：Jira 的 app admin 是在 Jira Administration 授予，因為 Jira apps 共用管理介面。","B":"錯。只有 org admin 能指派 Jira 的 app admin。","C":"錯。不會。","D":"錯。不負責帳單。","E":"對。官方：app admin 不能進 Atlassian Administration。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-b12","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The only organization admin left the company and their account is unavailable. What should be done?","zh":"唯一的 organization admin 離職，帳號無法使用。應怎麼做？","zo":["任何 Jira admin 指派新的 org admin","刪除 organization","聯絡 Atlassian support 啟動角色移轉流程","任何 site admin 自行升級"],"fig":"","opts":["Any Jira admin assigns a new org admin","Delete the organization","Contact Atlassian support to start a role transfer process","Any site admin promotes themselves"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Jira admin 不能。","B":"錯。不合理。","C":"對。官方：org admin 無法使用時聯絡 Atlassian support 啟動角色移轉。","D":"錯。Site admin 不能指派 org admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-b13","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which actions can a project admin of a company-managed project perform without a Jira admin? (Choose two.)","zh":"Company-managed project 的 project admin 不需要 Jira admin 就能做哪些事？（選兩個）","zo":["建立 components","更換 project 的 workflow scheme","建立新的 custom field","授予 global permission","修改 project 的 default assignee"],"fig":"","opts":["Create components","Change the project's workflow scheme","Create a new custom field","Grant global permissions","Change the project's default assignee"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Components 由 project admin 管理。","B":"錯。要 Jira admin。","C":"錯。要 Jira admin。","D":"錯。要 Jira admin。","E":"對。Details 頁的 default assignee。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/edit-a-projects-details/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-b14","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In the centralized user management experience, what is true about organization admins and Jira app admin roles?","zh":"在集中式使用者管理介面中，關於 organization admin 與 Jira app admin 角色，何者正確？","zo":["Org admin 必須是 Jira admin 才能管理使用者","Org admin 要等 30 天才有 app 存取","Org admin 自動取得每個 app 的 user 與 app admin 角色，但可以被移除","Org admin 永遠不能管理 Jira 設定"],"fig":"","opts":["Org admins must be Jira admins to manage users","Org admins only get app access after a 30-day wait","Org admins get the user and app admin roles for every app automatically, but these can be removed","Org admins can never administer Jira settings"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。管理使用者不需要 Jira admin。","B":"錯。沒有等待期。","C":"對。官方：集中式介面下自動給 org admin 各 app 的 user 與 app admin 角色，可被移除。","D":"錯。可以。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-b15","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can change a project's key?","zh":"誰能修改 project 的 key？","zo":["只有 project lead","任何 project admin","只有 organization admin","Organization、site 與 Jira admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Only the project lead","Any project admin","Only organization admins","Organization, site, and Jira admins"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不是。","B":"錯。Project admin 不能。","C":"錯。不只 org admin。","D":"對。官方：只有 org、site、Jira admin 能改 project key。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-b16","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user access admin for Confluence wants to work in Confluence spaces. What is true?","zh":"Confluence 的 user access admin 想在 Confluence space 中工作。何者正確？","zo":["User access admin 可以使用任何 app","他們會成為 Confluence app admin","他們可以管理所有 app 的使用者","User access admin 角色不會自動給 Confluence 存取"],"fig":"","opts":["User access admins can use any app","They become Confluence app admins","They can manage all apps' users","The user access admin role doesn't automatically give access to Confluence"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不會自動。","B":"錯。是不同角色。","C":"錯。只管理指定 app 的使用者存取。","D":"對。官方：user access admin 不會自動取得所管理 app 的存取。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-admin-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.2-b17","sec":"120.1.2","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Which admin role does membership in each default group grant? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。加入每個 default group 會得到哪種 admin 角色？（選兩個）","zo":["org-admins 給 organization admin 角色","jira-users-acme 給 site admin 角色","site-admins 給 Jira project admin","Group 名稱會自動決定 Jira project 權限","jira-admins-acme 給 Jira app admin 角色"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 193\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Groups\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"191.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Atlassian Administration → Directory</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Groups</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Default groups</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">jira-admins-acme</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Role: App admin</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">org-admins</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Role: Organization admin</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">jira-users-acme</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Role: User</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"191.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["org-admins grants the organization admin role","jira-users-acme grants the site admin role","site-admins grants Jira project admin","Group names determine Jira project permissions automatically","jira-admins-acme grants the Jira app admin role"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。org-admins（或舊名 site-admins）對應 organization admin。","B":"錯。那是 app 的 user 角色。","C":"錯。Project admin 由 permission scheme 決定。","D":"錯。Project 權限由 scheme 決定。","E":"對。<app>-admins-<site> 對應 app admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-b18","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Which users can create filter subscriptions sent to groups they belong to?","zh":"請看圖。哪些使用者能建立寄給自己所屬 group 的 filter subscription？","zo":["「team-leads」的成員","所有 Jira 使用者","「jira-users-acme」的成員","沒有人"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 228\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Global permissions\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"226.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings → System → Global permissions</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Global permissions</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"102\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Administer Jira</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-admins-acme</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"128\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Share dashboards and filters</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-users-acme</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"154\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Manage group filter subscriptions</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">team-leads</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"180\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Make bulk changes</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-admins-acme</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"206\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"206\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Create team-managed projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-users-acme</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"226.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Members of 'team-leads'","All Jira users","Members of 'jira-users-acme'","Nobody"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Manage group filter subscriptions 只給了 team-leads。","B":"錯。不是所有人。","C":"錯。他們只有 Share 與 Create TMP。","D":"錯。team-leads 可以。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-b19","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the same configuration: a regular Jira user (only in jira-users-acme) wants to bulk-edit 40 issues in a project where they have Edit Issues. What happens?","zh":"同上設定：一般 Jira 使用者（只在 jira-users-acme）想在他有 Edit Issues 的 project bulk 編輯 40 張 issue。結果？","zo":["最多只能 bulk 編輯 10 張","分享 filter 之後就可以","不能，因為 Make bulk changes 只給了 jira-admins-acme","可以，因為他有 Edit Issues"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 150\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Global permissions\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"148.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings → System → Global permissions</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Global permissions</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"102\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Make bulk changes</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-admins-acme</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"128\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Share dashboards and filters</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-users-acme</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"148.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["They can bulk-edit up to 10 issues","They can, after sharing a filter","They can't, because Make bulk changes is granted only to jira-admins-acme","They can, because they have Edit Issues"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。沒有這種限制。","B":"錯。分享 filter 與 bulk 無關。","C":"對。Bulk change 要 Make bulk changes 全域權限；只有 Edit Issues 不夠。","D":"錯。還要全域權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-b20","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user without Browse users and groups types @ in a comment. Whom can they mention?","zh":"沒有 Browse users and groups 的使用者在留言中輸入 @。他可以 mention 誰？","zo":["站上所有人","只有 project admin","在目前 project 有 Browse Projects 權限的使用者","沒有人"],"fig":"","opts":["Everyone on the site","Only project admins","Users who have Browse Projects permission in the current project","Nobody"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。看不到全站。","B":"錯。不限 admin。","C":"對。官方：沒有這個權限時只看得到在該 project 有 Browse 權限的使用者。","D":"錯。仍可 mention 部分人。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-b21","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What does the 'Manage custom onboarding' global permission allow?","zh":"「Manage custom onboarding」全域權限允許做什麼？","zo":["建立 team-managed project","建立與編輯自訂 onboarding 內容，並查看分析","邀請新使用者","管理 product access"],"fig":"","opts":["Creating team-managed projects","Creating and editing custom onboarding content and viewing its analytics","Inviting new users","Managing product access"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。那是另一個權限。","B":"對。官方：建立與編輯自訂 onboarding 內容並查看分析。","C":"錯。邀請由 org 設定控制。","D":"錯。Product access 由 org admin 管。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-b22","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about the Administer Jira global permission are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 Administer Jira 全域權限，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["擁有者不受存取限制都能登入 Jira","可以編輯 field、permission、notification 的 scheme","可以管理現有使用者","可以編輯系統 email 設定","可以授予 project role"],"fig":"","opts":["Users with it can log in to Jira regardless of access restrictions","It allows editing schemes for fields, permissions, and notifications","It allows managing existing users","It allows editing system email settings","It can be granted to a project role"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。官方：可以不受存取限制登入。","B":"對。官方：可以建立與編輯 field、permission、notification 等 scheme。","C":"錯。官方明列不能。","D":"錯。官方明列不能。","E":"錯。Global permission 不能給 project role。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.3-b23","sec":"120.1.3","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"In current Jira Cloud documentation, which grantee options appear when granting a global permission? (Choose two.)","zh":"依現行 Jira Cloud 文件，授予 global permission 時有哪些授權對象選項？（選兩個）","zo":["Reporter","Issue security level","Group","Anyone（所有能存取站台的人）","Project role"],"fig":"","opts":["Reporter","Issue security level","Group","Anyone (all users who can access the site)","Project role"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。Reporter 是 project 層級的概念。","B":"錯。不是授權對象。","C":"對。考綱的標準答案：給 group。","D":"對。現行文件另有 Anyone 選項（考試以 group 為準）。","E":"錯。Global permission 不能給 project role。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/view-grant-revoke-global-permissions-in-jira/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"120.1.4-b24","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Leo is in the Developers role, and Kim is in the Users role only. Who can transition issues and who can be assigned issues?","zh":"請看圖。Leo 在 Developers role，Kim 只在 Users role。誰能轉換 issue、誰能被指派？","zo":["Leo 能轉換；只有 Leo 能被指派","兩人都能轉換、都能被指派","Kim 能轉換；Leo 能被指派","沒有人能被指派"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 320\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Permission scheme：Web\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"318.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings → Issues → Permission schemes</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Permission scheme：Web</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Browse Projects</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Project role: Users</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Project role: Developers</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Transition Issues</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"196\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Project role: Developers</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"217\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Assignable User</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"247\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"247\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Project role: Developers</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Assign Issues</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"298\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"298\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Project role: Developers</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"318.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Leo can transition; only Leo can be assigned","Both can transition; both can be assigned","Kim can transition; Leo can be assigned","Nobody can be assigned"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Transition 與 Assignable User 都只給 Developers；Kim 只有 Browse。","B":"錯。Kim 沒有這兩個權限。","C":"錯。顛倒了。","D":"錯。Developers 可被指派。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-b25","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Agents can transition issues to Done, but the Resolution field isn't updated and they can't close issues. Which permissions should be checked? (Choose two.)","zh":"Agent 能把 issue 轉到 Done，但 Resolution 欄位沒有更新，也無法關閉 issue。應檢查哪些權限？（選兩個）","zo":["Manage watchers","Resolve Issues","Close Issues","Schedule Issues","Browse users and groups"],"fig":"","opts":["Manage watchers","Resolve Issues","Close Issues","Schedule Issues","Browse users and groups"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。無關。","B":"對。官方：Resolve 讓使用者更新 Resolution 欄位。","C":"對。官方：關閉 issue 可能還需要 Close 權限。","D":"錯。管 due date 與 rank。","E":"錯。無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-b26","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A permission is granted to 'Any logged in user'. Who receives it?","zh":"某權限授予「Any logged in user」。誰會得到它？","zo":["只有匿名使用者","只有 project role 成員","所有登入站台的人，可能包含沒有 Jira 授權的人","只有有 Jira product access 的使用者"],"fig":"","opts":["Only anonymous users","Only project role members","Anyone logged in to the site, which can include users without a Jira license","Only users with Jira product access"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。匿名是 Public。","B":"錯。不是 role。","C":"對。所有登入站台的人，可能包含沒有 Jira 授權者；要只給 Jira 使用者，改用 Application access 指定 Jira。","D":"錯。那是 Application access：Jira。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-or-revoke-permissions-in-a-scheme/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"120.1.4-b27","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"In a team-managed project with Limited access, a user who isn't added to the project visits it. What can they do? (Choose two.)","zh":"Access 為 Limited 的 team-managed project，一位沒被加入的使用者來瀏覽。他能做什麼？（選兩個）","zo":["修改 project 設定","檢視 work item","在 work item 留言","編輯 work item","建立 work item"],"fig":"","opts":["Change project settings","View work items","Comment on work items","Edit work items","Create work items"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。只有 Administrator。","B":"對。Limited 讓站上使用者成為 Viewer，可以檢視。","C":"對。Viewer 可以留言。","D":"錯。Viewer 不能編輯。","E":"錯。Viewer 不能建立。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-b28","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a company-managed project, the 'Approver' user picker should let named approvers edit the issue. Which grant type should be used for Edit Issues?","zh":"在 company-managed project，「Approver」user picker 中的人要能編輯 issue。Edit Issues 應使用哪種授權類型？","zo":["Project lead","User custom field value：Approver","Single user","Group custom field value"],"fig":"","opts":["Project lead","User custom field value: Approver","Single user","Group custom field value"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。固定 project lead。","B":"對。依欄位中的使用者授權。","C":"錯。固定一人。","D":"錯。那是 group picker。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-or-revoke-permissions-in-a-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-b29","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A Jira admin wants the same permission scheme for 30 projects, with each project admin controlling who the developers are. What should the scheme use, and who maintains membership? (Choose two.)","zh":"Jira admin 希望 30 個 project 使用同一個 permission scheme，而由各 project admin 決定誰是開發者。Scheme 應授權給誰？誰維護成員？（選兩個）","zo":["授權給 Developers project role","各 project 的 project admin 把人加進 role","授權給單一「developers」group","由 org admin 維護 role 成員","建立 30 個 permission scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Grant permissions to a Developers project role","Project admins add people to the role in each project","Grant permissions to a single 'developers' group","Org admins maintain role membership","Create 30 permission schemes"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。Role 讓 scheme 共用、成員依 project 不同。","B":"對。Project admin 在 People 頁管理 role 成員。","C":"錯。單一 group 會讓所有 project 的開發者相同。","D":"錯。Role 成員由 project admin 管。","E":"錯。沒必要。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-b30","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which permissions can be granted to Public (anyone, including users who aren't logged in)? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些權限可以授予 Public（任何人，含未登入者）？（選兩個）","zo":["Edit Issues","Create Attachments","Edit Own Comments","Administer Projects","Assign Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Edit Issues","Create Attachments","Edit Own Comments","Administer Projects","Assign Issues"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。只能給受邀使用者。","B":"對。官方列為可給 Public 的權限之一。","C":"對。官方列為可給 Public 的權限之一。","D":"錯。只能給受邀使用者。","E":"錯。只能給受邀使用者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-permissions-to-make-a-space-publicly-visible/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-b31","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team-managed project uses Open access. An admin adds a user with the Viewer role. What can the user do?","zh":"Team-managed project 使用 Open access。Admin 以 Viewer role 加入一位使用者。他能做什麼？","zo":["只能檢視","什麼都不能做","只能留言","Member 能做的事都能做，因為 role 疊加在 access level 上"],"fig":"","opts":["Only view","Nothing","Only comment","Everything a Member can, because roles add to the access level"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不會覆蓋成唯讀。","B":"錯。不會。","C":"錯。Member 能做更多。","D":"對。Open 讓所有人是 Member，指派 Viewer 是疊加，不會降級。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.4-b32","sec":"120.1.4","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which grantee types are available in a company-managed permission scheme? (Choose two.)","zh":"Company-managed 的 permission scheme 有哪些授權對象類型？（選兩個）","zo":["Group custom field value","Application access","Board administrator","Sprint participant","Dashboard viewer"],"fig":"","opts":["Group custom field value","Application access","Board administrator","Sprint participant","Dashboard viewer"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。依 group picker 欄位授權。","B":"對。依 app 存取授權。","C":"錯。不是授權類型。","D":"錯。不是。","E":"錯。不是。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-or-revoke-permissions-in-a-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-b33","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. An issue has security level 'HR only'. Its reporter is Leo (not in hr-team), and its assignee is Ana (in hr-team). Who can see it? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。某 issue 的 security level 是「HR only」，reporter 是 Leo（不在 hr-team），assignee 是 Ana（在 hr-team）。誰看得到？（選兩個）","zo":["Ana","不是 reporter、assignee、也不在 hr-team 的開發者","匿名使用者","所有有 Browse Projects 的人","Leo"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 193\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Security level：HR only\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"191.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings → Issues → Issue security schemes</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Security level：HR only</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Members</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Group: hr-team</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Reporter</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Current assignee</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"191.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Ana","A developer who isn't the reporter, assignee, or in hr-team","Anonymous users","Everyone with Browse Projects","Leo"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Ana 在 hr-team（也是 assignee）。","B":"錯。不在 level 成員中。","C":"錯。不在 level 成員中。","D":"錯。Issue security 在 Browse 之上再限制。","E":"對。Level 包含 Reporter。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-users-access-to-security-levels-in-a-work-item-security-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-b34","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue security scheme has a default level 'Internal'. A user creates an issue without choosing a level. What happens?","zh":"某 issue security scheme 的 default level 是「Internal」。使用者建立 issue 時沒有選 level。會怎樣？","zo":["Issue 得到最高的 level","Issue 得到「Internal」level","Issue 沒有 level，有 Browse 的人都看得到","Issue 無法建立"],"fig":"","opts":["The issue gets the highest level","The issue gets the 'Internal' level","The issue has no level and is visible to all with Browse","The issue can't be created"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。沒有「最高」level 的概念。","B":"對。未選擇時套用 default level。","C":"錯。有 default 就會套用。","D":"錯。可以建立。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-work-item-security-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-b35","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A story is created under an epic with security level 'Confidential' using the parent field. What is true?","zh":"在 security level 為「Confidential」的 epic 底下，用 parent 欄位建立一張 story。何者正確？","zo":["Story 一定繼承「Confidential」","Story 不能有 security level","Epic 的 level 被移除","Story 不是 sub-task，不會自動繼承 epic 的 security level"],"fig":"","opts":["The story always inherits 'Confidential'","The story can't have a security level","The epic's level is removed","The story isn't a sub-task, so it doesn't automatically inherit the epic's security level"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。只有 sub-task 會繼承。","B":"錯。Story 可以有自己的 level。","C":"錯。不會。","D":"對。繼承規則適用 sub-task；透過 parent 欄位建立的 child（例如 epic 下的 story）不會自動繼承。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/allow-specific-users-to-view-tasks-and-subtasks-with-security-levels-in-jira/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"120.1.5-b36","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Users can't choose any value in the Security Level field, although a scheme is associated with the project. Which could be the cause? (Choose two.)","zh":"Project 已套用 issue security scheme，但使用者在 Security Level 欄位無法選任何值。可能原因？（選兩個）","zo":["Time tracking 關閉","他們缺少 Set Issue Security 權限","Security Level 欄位不在 screen 或 layout 上","停用了 issue linking","他們不是 watcher"],"fig":"","opts":["Time tracking is off","They lack the Set Issue Security permission","The Security Level field isn't on the screen or layout","Issue linking is disabled","They aren't watchers"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。無關。","B":"對。要有 Set Issue Security 才能設定。","C":"對。欄位要在 layout 上才看得到。","D":"錯。無關。","E":"錯。無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-work-item-security-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-b37","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team-managed project restricts the 'Contract' issue type to the Legal role. What about Contract issues created before the restriction?","zh":"Team-managed project 把「Contract」issue type 限制給 Legal role。設定前已建立的 Contract issue 會怎樣？","zo":["不受影響，只有之後新建的 issue 會被限制","立即被限制","被刪除","被移到其他 project"],"fig":"","opts":["They're unaffected; only newly created issues are restricted","They're restricted immediately","They're deleted","They're moved to another project"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：只有之後新建的 issue 會套用限制。","B":"錯。既有的不受影響。","C":"錯。不會刪除。","D":"錯。不會移動。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-issue-types-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-b38","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user wants to restrict a comment to the 'hr-team' group, but only project roles appear in the visibility list. What is the likely reason?","zh":"使用者想把留言限制給「hr-team」group，但可見性清單只出現 project role。可能原因？","zo":["永遠不能用 group","使用者缺少 Administer Jira","Issue 沒有 security level","站台的留言可見性設定是「Project Roles only」"],"fig":"","opts":["Groups can never be used","The user lacks Administer Jira","The issue has no security level","The site's comment visibility setting is 'Project Roles only'"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。設為 Groups & Project Roles 就可以。","B":"錯。不需要。","C":"錯。無關。","D":"對。全站 Comment visibility 設為 Project Roles only 時，只能選 role。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/add-restricted-comments-on-jira/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-b39","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which entries can be added to a security level? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些可以加到 security level？（選兩個）","zo":["Group custom field value","Project lead","Priority","Component","Fix version"],"fig":"","opts":["Group custom field value","Project lead","Priority","Component","Fix version"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。依 group picker 欄位。","B":"對。Project lead 是成員類型之一。","C":"錯。不是使用者類型。","D":"錯。不是使用者類型。","E":"錯。不是使用者類型。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-users-access-to-security-levels-in-a-work-item-security-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.1.5-b40","sec":"120.1.5","dom":"120.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can create issue security schemes and add members to security levels?","zh":"誰能建立 issue security scheme 並把成員加進 security level？","zo":["任何有 Set Issue Security 的使用者","Reporter","Jira admin","Project admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Any user with Set Issue Security","Reporters","Jira admins","Project admins"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Set Issue Security 只是在 issue 上設定 level。","B":"錯。不能。","C":"對。官方：需要 Administer Jira。","D":"錯。Project admin 不能建 scheme。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-users-access-to-security-levels-in-a-work-item-security-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.1-b01","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team-managed project has grown, and the team now needs components and issue security. There is no native conversion. What should be done?","zh":"某 team-managed project 規模變大，團隊現在需要 components 與 issue security，但沒有內建轉換功能。應該怎麼做？","zo":["由 Jira admin 建立 company-managed project，再把 issue bulk move 過去","在 Project settings 切換「Convert to company-managed」","請 Atlassian support 更改 project 類型","在 team-managed project 的 Features 頁開啟 components"],"fig":"","opts":["A Jira admin creates a company-managed project, then the issues are bulk-moved into it","Toggle 'Convert to company-managed' in Project settings","Ask Atlassian support to switch the project type","Enable components in the Features page of the team-managed project"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：TMP 不能直接轉成 CMP；要由 Jira admin 建立新的 CMP，再用 bulk move 把 issue 移過去。","B":"錯。沒有這種轉換開關。","C":"錯。官方的做法是建新 project 再移 issue。","D":"錯。TMP 沒有 components 功能可開。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/migrate-between-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.1-b02","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company on the Jira Free plan wants new projects to share configuration with an existing project. What is true?","zh":"使用 Jira Free 方案的公司，希望新 project 與既有 project 共用設定。何者正確？","zo":["Free 方案沒有共用設定功能","Free 方案任何使用者都能共用設定","共用設定只適用 team-managed project","需要 Marketplace app"],"fig":"","opts":["Shared configuration isn't available on the Free plan","Any user can share configuration on Free","Shared configuration only works for team-managed projects","It requires a Marketplace app"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：共用設定只有 Jira admin 能做，而且 Free 方案沒有。","B":"錯。不是任何人都能做，Free 也沒有。","C":"錯。共用設定只適用 company-managed。","D":"錯。是內建功能（付費方案）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-new-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.1-b03","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which configuration items are shared when a company-managed project is created with 'Share settings with an existing project'? (Choose two.)","zh":"以「Share settings with an existing project」建立 company-managed project 時，哪些設定會被共用？（選兩個）","zo":["Issues","Versions","Board quick filters","Workflows","Screens"],"fig":"","opts":["Issues","Versions","Board quick filters","Workflows","Screens"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。Issue 是資料，不會被共用。","B":"錯。Version 屬於各 project。","C":"錯。Board 設定不是 project 設定共用的一部分。","D":"對。官方列出共用的設定包含 workflows。","E":"對。也包含 screens（以及 issue types、fields、permissions、notifications 等）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-new-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.1-b04","sec":"120.2.1","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Ana, who isn't a Jira admin, is creating a new project. Why is the 'Share settings with an existing project' option unavailable to her?","zh":"請看圖。不是 Jira admin 的 Ana 正在建立新 project。為什麼她無法使用「Share settings with an existing project」？","zo":["她需要 Browse users and groups 權限","只有 Jira admin 能建立共用設定的 project","她選了 team-managed，會自動共用設定","這個 template 不支援共用"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 265\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Create project\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"263.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Projects</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Create project</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Template</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Scrum</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Project type</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"157\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"157\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Team-managed</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"178\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Company-managed（需要 Jira admin）</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"200\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Share settings with an existing project</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">此選項目前無法使用</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"263.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["She needs the Browse users and groups permission","Only Jira admins can create projects with shared configuration","She selected team-managed, which shares settings automatically","The template doesn't support sharing"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。與該權限無關。","B":"對。官方：只有 Jira admin 能建立共用設定的 project；而且共用設定只有 company-managed。","C":"錯。TMP 不共用設定。","D":"錯。與 template 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-new-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.2-b05","sec":"120.2.2","dom":"120.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which project keys are valid when changing a project key? (Choose two.)","zh":"修改 project key 時，哪些 key 是有效的？（選兩個）","zo":["OPS2","HR","2OPS","ops","O"],"fig":"","opts":["OPS2","HR","2OPS","ops","O"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。大寫字母開頭、只有大寫字母與數字、至少 2 字元。","B":"對。兩個大寫字母符合規則。","C":"錯。不能以數字開頭。","D":"錯。必須是大寫。","E":"錯。至少 2 個字元。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.2-b06","sec":"120.2.2","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Project MOB was renamed to key APP last year. A new team now wants to use the key MOB for its project. What happens?","zh":"去年 project key 從 MOB 改成 APP。現在新團隊想用 MOB 當自己 project 的 key。結果？","zo":["MOB 立刻可用","30 天後 MOB 可用","Admin 可以從 trash 釋放 MOB","MOB 不能用，因為舊 key 會被保留以維持舊連結"],"fig":"","opts":["MOB is available immediately","MOB becomes available after 30 days","The admin can release MOB from the trash","MOB can't be used, because previous keys are kept to keep old links working"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。舊 key 不能重用。","B":"錯。沒有這種期限。","C":"錯。不在 trash。","D":"對。官方：舊 key 會被保留，讓舊連結、filter、查詢繼續運作，所以不能被新 project 使用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.2-b07","sec":"120.2.2","dom":"120.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. A project admin of a company-managed project opens the Details page. Which fields can they change? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。Company-managed project 的 project admin 打開 Details 頁。他能修改哪些欄位？（選兩個）","zo":["Project type","Project lead","Description","Key","Project category"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Details\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"418.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V419.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"420\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Details</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Name</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Mobile App</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx gray\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"fill:var(--ink-3)\">MOB</text><path d=\"M348,163 v-2 a3,3 0 0 1 6,0 v2\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.4\"/><rect x=\"346\" y=\"163\" width=\"10\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Description</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"205\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">行動版 App</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Project category</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"260\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx gray\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"fill:var(--ink-3)\">Engineering</text><path d=\"M330,273 v-2 a3,3 0 0 1 6,0 v2\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.4\"/><rect x=\"328\" y=\"273\" width=\"10\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><path d=\"M350,271 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"309\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Project lead</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"315\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"333\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Adam</text><path d=\"M350,326 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"364\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Default assignee</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"370\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"388\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Project lead</text><path d=\"M350,381 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"39\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Details</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">People</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Permissions</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"418.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Project type","Project lead","Description","Key","Project category"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Project type 不能直接在 Details 改。","B":"對。Project admin 可以改 project lead。","C":"對。Project admin 可以改 description（以及 name、URL、avatar、default assignee）。","D":"錯。Key 要 org、site 或 Jira admin。","E":"錯。Category 由 Jira admin 指派。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.2-b08","sec":"120.2.2","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants to group the Mobile and Web projects under 'Digital' for reporting with JQL like category = Digital. Who must create and assign the category?","zh":"Project admin 想把 Mobile 與 Web project 歸到「Digital」category，方便用 category = Digital 做報表。誰必須建立並指派 category？","zo":["Jira admin","Project admin","任何 project 成員","Project lead"],"fig":"","opts":["A Jira admin","The project admin","Any project member","The project lead"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Category 由 Jira admin 建立並指派給 project。","B":"錯。CMP 的 project admin 不能指派 category。","C":"錯。不能。","D":"錯。Project lead 不代表有權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.3-b09","sec":"120.2.3","dom":"120.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which permissions allow a user to create or edit versions in a company-managed project? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些權限能讓使用者在 company-managed project 建立或編輯 version？（選兩個）","zo":["Browse users and groups","Schedule Issues","Administer Projects（project admin）","Manage versions","只有 Edit Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Browse users and groups","Schedule Issues","Administer Projects (project admin)","Manage versions","Edit Issues only"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。無關。","B":"錯。管 due date 與 rank。","C":"對。官方：project（space）admin 可以建立或編輯 version。","D":"對。官方：有 Manage versions 權限的人也可以。","E":"錯。Edit Issues 只能把 issue 加進 version。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/release-a-version-in-your-classic-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.3-b10","sec":"120.2.3","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A support team works on a company-managed Kanban board and releases whatever is done every Friday. How is a version typically released here?","zh":"支援團隊使用 company-managed Kanban board，每週五把做完的工作發布出去。通常怎麼發布 version？","zo":["Bulk transition issue 到 Released","使用 Kanban board 上的 Release 選項，會包含已完成的 issue","開始工作前先把每張 issue 指到 version","建立並完成一個 sprint"],"fig":"","opts":["Bulk-transition issues to Released","Use the Release option on the Kanban board, which includes completed issues","Pre-assign every issue to a version before starting work","Create a sprint and complete it"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。發布 version 不是轉換 status。","B":"對。官方：CMP Kanban 可以從 board 的 Release 選單發布；Kanban 隨時發布已完成的工作。","C":"錯。Kanban 不要求事先指定 version。","D":"錯。Kanban 沒有 sprint。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/release-a-version-in-your-classic-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-a-version/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.3-b11","sec":"120.2.3","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. The release manager selects the shown option and releases 3.0. What happens to the four unresolved issues?","zh":"請看圖。Release manager 選了圖中的選項並發布 3.0。四張未解決的 issue 會怎樣？","zo":["自動被設為已解決","被刪除","它們的 fix version 改成 3.1","留在 3.0，3.0 照樣發布"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 274\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Release 3.0\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"272.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Releases</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Release 3.0</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">4 個 issue 尚未解決</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Unresolved issues</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"126\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"126\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Move issues to version：3.1</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"147\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Ignore and proceed with release</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Release date</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"186\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026-10-20</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"224\" width=\"68.5\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"46.25\" y=\"241\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Release</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"272.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["They are resolved automatically","They are deleted","Their fix version changes to 3.1","They stay in 3.0, which is released anyway"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不會自動解決。","B":"錯。不會刪除。","C":"對。選 Move issues to version 時，未解決的 issue 會改到指定的 version。","D":"錯。那是 Ignore 的結果。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/release-a-version-in-your-classic-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.3-b12","sec":"120.2.3","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user can edit issues but can't add an issue to version 2.0, while a project admin can. Which statement is correct?","zh":"某使用者能編輯 issue，卻不能把 issue 加到 version 2.0，而 project admin 可以。哪個敘述正確？","zo":["把 issue 加到 version 需要 Edit Issues，所以比較可能是 field configuration 或 screen 的問題","只有 project admin 能把 issue 加到 version","把 issue 加到 version 需要 Manage versions","Version 只能由 automation 設定"],"fig":"","opts":["Adding an issue to a version requires the Edit Issues permission, so the issue is more likely the field configuration or screen","Only project admins can add issues to versions","Adding issues to versions requires Manage versions","Versions can only be set by automation"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：把 issue 加到 version 要 Edit Issues；能編輯卻設不了，常見原因是 Fix versions 欄位被隱藏或不在 screen。","B":"錯。不限 project admin。","C":"錯。Manage versions 是管理 version 本身。","D":"錯。手動就能設。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-versions-in-a-scrum-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"120.2.4-b13","sec":"120.2.4","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. An issue is created with components 'API' and 'UI', and Assignee set to Automatic. Who is assigned?","zh":"請看圖。建立 issue 時選了 component「API」與「UI」，Assignee 選 Automatic。指派給誰？","zo":["Ann","Bob","Project lead","Unassigned"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 193\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Components\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"191.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V192.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"193\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Components</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Component → default assignee</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">UI</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Component lead：Bob</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">API</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Component lead：Ann</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Docs</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Project default</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Details</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"65\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Components</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Versions</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"191.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Ann","Bob","The project lead","Unassigned"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。兩個 component 都是 Component lead，依 component 名稱字母序，API 在 UI 之前，所以是 Ann。","B":"錯。不是依 lead 名字或建立順序。","C":"錯。Component lead 類型高於 project lead。","D":"錯。有 component lead 時不會 Unassigned。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.4-b14","sec":"120.2.4","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The global setting 'Allow unassigned issues' is turned off. What is the impact on project default assignee options?","zh":"全站設定「Allow unassigned issues」被關閉。對 project default assignee 的選項有什麼影響？","zo":["不能建立 issue","Project default assignee 不能設為 Unassigned","Component 不能有 lead","自動指派被停用"],"fig":"","opts":["Issues can't be created","Project default assignee can't be set to Unassigned","Components can't have leads","Automatic assignment is disabled"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。可以建立，只是要有 assignee。","B":"對。關閉後 issue 一定要有 assignee，default assignee 不能選 Unassigned。","C":"錯。不影響 component lead。","D":"錯。自動指派仍可用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.4-b15","sec":"120.2.4","dom":"120.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue has components Network (Project lead) and Storage (Unassigned). The project lead is Kim. Who is assigned when Assignee is Automatic?","zh":"Issue 有 Network（Project lead）與 Storage（Unassigned）兩個 component，project lead 是 Kim。Assignee 選 Automatic 時指派給誰？","zo":["Unassigned","Network 的 component lead","Reporter","Kim"],"fig":"","opts":["Unassigned","The Network component lead","The reporter","Kim"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Unassigned 的類型低於 Project lead。","B":"錯。Network 設的是 Project lead，不是 component lead。","C":"錯。Reporter 不在規則中。","D":"對。類型優先序 Component lead＞Project lead＞Unassigned＞Project default；Project lead 高於 Unassigned，所以是 Kim。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.2.4-b16","sec":"120.2.4","dom":"120.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about Jira components are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 Jira components，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["它取代 issue type","只在 company-managed project 提供","屬於建立它的 project","可以在全站所有 project 共用","任何 project 成員都能設定"],"fig":"","opts":["They replace issue types","They are available only in company-managed projects","They are scoped to the project they're created in","They can be shared across all projects on the site","Any project member can configure them"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。是分組，不是 issue type。","B":"對。官方：components 只在 company-managed。","C":"對。官方：component 屬於建立它的 project。","D":"錯。不是全站共用。","E":"錯。官方：space admin 設定，其他人只能檢視與連結。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/organize-work-with-components/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-b01","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Which workflow does a Bug in this project use?","zh":"請看圖。這個 project 的 Bug 使用哪個 workflow？","zo":["Story Workflow","建立 bug 時所選的 workflow","Bug Workflow","Default Workflow"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 193\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workflow scheme：Engineering\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"191.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings → Issues → Workflow schemes</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Workflow scheme：Engineering</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue type → Workflow</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Bug</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Bug Workflow</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Story</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Story Workflow</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">All unassigned issue types</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Default Workflow</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"191.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Story Workflow","The workflow chosen when the bug was created","Bug Workflow","Default Workflow"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Story 用 Story Workflow。","B":"錯。由 scheme 決定，不是建立時選。","C":"對。Workflow scheme 把 Bug 對應到 Bug Workflow。","D":"錯。Default 只套用到沒有特別指定的 issue type。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-b02","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin wants to delete the issue type 'Defect', which has 300 issues across projects. What should be done first?","zh":"Jira admin 想刪除 issue type「Defect」，各 project 共有 300 張這類 issue。應該先做什麼？","zo":["把既有的 Defect issue 改成其他 issue type（例如用 bulk edit）","不用做什麼，刪除會一併移除 issue","把 issue type 改名為「Deleted」","從 permission scheme 移除它"],"fig":"","opts":["Move the existing Defect issues to another issue type (for example with bulk edit)","Nothing; deleting removes the issues","Rename the issue type to 'Deleted'","Remove it from the permission scheme"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方建議先把該類型的 issue 改成其他 type，再刪除，避免影響既有工作。","B":"錯。要先處理既有 issue。","C":"錯。改名不是刪除。","D":"錯。權限與 issue type 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-edit-and-delete-an-issue-type/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-sub-tasks/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-b03","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A parent issue has 600 sub-tasks. The team notices the parent's time tracking doesn't include sub-task time. Why?","zh":"某 parent issue 有 600 個 sub-task。團隊發現 parent 的 time tracking 沒有包含 sub-task 的工時。為什麼？","zo":["Sub-task 在別的 project","Child work item 太多，無法納入 time tracking","Sub-task 的工時永遠不會彙總","Time tracking 被停用"],"fig":"","opts":["The sub-tasks are in another project","The parent has too many child work items for them to be included in time tracking","Sub-task time never rolls up","Time tracking is disabled"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Sub-task 與 parent 同 project。","B":"對。官方：child 太多時無法納入 time tracking（Log time 頁寫超過 100 個，What are work types 頁寫超過 500 個；600 個兩者都超過）。","C":"錯。數量在上限內時可以彙總。","D":"錯。題目沒有這個線索，而且其他工時正常。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/log-time-on-an-issue/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-b04","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about sub-tasks are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 sub-task，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Sub-task 可以和 parent 屬於不同 project","停用 sub-task 會刪除既有 sub-task","Sub-task 必須使用 parent 的 workflow","Sub-task issue type 在 Work types > Sub-tasks 建立","Subtask Blocking Condition 可以阻止 parent 在 sub-task 完成前被解決"],"fig":"","opts":["Sub-tasks can belong to a different project from their parent","Disabling sub-tasks deletes existing sub-tasks","Sub-tasks must use the parent's workflow","Sub-task issue types are created under Work types > Sub-tasks","The Subtask Blocking Condition can prevent a parent from being resolved until sub-tasks are done"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。Sub-task 與 parent 同 project。","B":"錯。要先轉換既有 sub-task 才能停用。","C":"錯。Sub-task type 可以有自己的 workflow。","D":"對。官方路徑：Settings → Work items → Sub-tasks。","E":"對。官方：可阻止 parent 在 sub-task 完成前被解決。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-sub-tasks/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-b05","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants a 'Risk' issue type with its own required fields only in the PMO project. What is the right approach in a company-managed setup?","zh":"團隊想在 PMO project 有一個「Risk」issue type，有自己的必填欄位，而且只在 PMO 使用。Company-managed 下正確的做法是？","zo":["把 Risk 加到 permission scheme","用名為 Risk 的 label","建立 issue type、加進 PMO 的 issue type scheme，並透過 field configuration scheme 對應專屬的 field configuration","建立 TMP 欄位"],"fig":"","opts":["Add Risk to the permission scheme","Use a label named Risk","Create the issue type, add it to PMO's issue type scheme, and map it to its own field configuration via the field configuration scheme","Create a TMP field"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。權限無關。","B":"錯。Label 不能有不同的必填欄位。","C":"對。Issue type 加進 PMO 的 issue type scheme，再用 field configuration scheme 給它專屬的必填設定。","D":"錯。CMP 不用 TMP 欄位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-type-schemes/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/associate-field-behavior-with-an-issue-type/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-b06","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"In a team-managed project, a project admin creates a 'Vendor request' issue type. Which statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"在 team-managed project，project admin 建立了「Vendor request」issue type。哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["它只存在於該 project","Project admin 可以直接替它加欄位","它自動出現在所有 company-managed project","要由 Jira admin 建立它的 workflow","它需要 issue type scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["It exists only in that project","The project admin can add fields to it directly","It's automatically available in all company-managed projects","A Jira admin must create its workflow","It requires an issue type scheme"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。TMP 的 issue type 屬於該 project。","B":"對。Project admin 直接在 issue type 加欄位。","C":"錯。不會共用。","D":"錯。Project admin 自己設定 workflow。","E":"錯。TMP 沒有 scheme。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-issue-types-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-b07","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about the default issue type in an issue type scheme is correct?","zh":"關於 issue type scheme 的預設 issue type，哪個敘述正確？","zo":["使用該 scheme 的 project 建立 issue 時會預先選好它","使用者只能建立這個 type","它決定 workflow","它不能更改"],"fig":"","opts":["It's preselected when users create an issue in projects using that scheme","It's the only type users can create","It determines the workflow","It can't be changed"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Default issue type 是建立 issue 時預先選好的類型。","B":"錯。使用者可以改選其他 type。","C":"錯。Workflow 由 workflow scheme 決定。","D":"錯。可以修改。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-type-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-b08","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. A project uses this issue type scheme. A user tries to create a 'Change' issue in the project. What happens?","zh":"請看圖。某 project 使用這個 issue type scheme。使用者想在 project 建立「Change」issue。會怎樣？","zo":["「Change」被轉成 Task","使用者看到權限錯誤","選不到「Change」，因為它不在 scheme 中","以預設 workflow 建立「Change」"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 234\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Issue type scheme：Ops\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"232.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings → Issues → Issue type schemes</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Issue type scheme：Ops</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue types</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Task</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Default</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Incident</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Sub-task</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Available issue types</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"209\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Change、Story、Bug（未加入）</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"232.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["'Change' is converted to Task","The user gets a permission error","'Change' isn't available, because it isn't in the scheme","'Change' is created with the default workflow"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不會自動轉換。","B":"錯。不是權限問題。","C":"對。Project 只能用 issue type scheme 中的 type。","D":"錯。不在 scheme 就選不到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-type-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.1-b09","sec":"120.3.1","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An epic in the PLATFORM project has stories from PLATFORM and WEB. Which is true in company-managed projects?","zh":"PLATFORM project 中的 epic 有來自 PLATFORM 與 WEB 的 story。在 company-managed project 中何者正確？","zo":["Epic 可以有其他 company-managed project 的 child issue","跨 project 的 child 會自動移到 PLATFORM","只有 sub-task 可以跨 project","WEB 的 story 會失去 epic 連結"],"fig":"","opts":["An epic can have child issues from other company-managed projects","Cross-project children automatically move to PLATFORM","Only sub-tasks can be cross-project","The WEB stories lose their epic link"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。CMP 支援跨 project 的 epic child。","B":"錯。不會被搬移。","C":"錯。Sub-task 不能跨 project。","D":"錯。連結會保留。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"120.3.2-b10","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. A user creates a Bug in project ALPHA. Which options does the 'Severity' field show?","zh":"請看圖。使用者在 project ALPHA 建立 Bug。「Severity」欄位會顯示哪些選項？","zo":["沒有選項，因為欄位有兩個 context","S1、S2、S3","Low、High","所有 context 的全部選項"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 296\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Severity：Contexts\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"294.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Custom fields</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Severity：Contexts</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Context A</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">ALPHA</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Issue types</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Bug</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Options</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">S1, S2, S3</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Context B</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"222\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"222\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"214\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"214\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">BETA</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"248\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"248\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Issue types</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">All</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"274\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"274\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Options</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Low, High</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"294.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["No options, because the field has two contexts","S1, S2, S3","Low, High","All options from every context"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。多個 context 很正常。","B":"對。ALPHA 的 Bug 屬於 Context A，顯示它的選項。","C":"錯。那是 BETA 的 context。","D":"錯。只顯示符合的那個 context。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-context-to-a-custom-field/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-b11","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A custom field must be required for Bugs but optional for Tasks in the same project. Which configuration objects are involved? (Choose two.)","zh":"同一個 project 中，某 custom field 對 Bug 必填、對 Task 選填。涉及哪些設定物件？（選兩個）","zo":["兩個 Required 設定不同的 field configuration","把 Bug 與 Task 對應到它們的 field configuration scheme","欄位的兩個 context","兩個 permission scheme","兩個使用相同 screen 的 screen scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Two field configurations with different Required settings","A field configuration scheme mapping Bug and Task to them","Two contexts for the field","Two permission schemes","Two screens schemes with the same screens"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。Required 在 field configuration 設定。","B":"對。Field configuration scheme 依 issue type 套用。","C":"錯。Context 不控制必填。","D":"錯。權限無關。","E":"錯。Screen 只決定顯示，不決定必填。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-a-field-configuration/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/associate-field-behavior-with-an-issue-type/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-b12","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A deleted custom field was restored from the Deleted fields tab 20 days later. What happens to its data?","zh":"被刪除的 custom field 在 20 天後從 Deleted fields 分頁還原。資料會怎樣？","zo":["超過 7 天不能還原","加回原本使用的地方，資料也一起回來","還原成空白","只有欄位定義回來"],"fig":"","opts":["Restoring is impossible after 7 days","It's re-added to the places it was used, along with its data","It's restored empty","Only the field definition returns"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。期限是 60 天。","B":"對。官方：restore 時會加回原本使用的地方，連同資料。","C":"錯。資料會回來。","D":"錯。不只定義。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/specify-field-behavior/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-b13","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which settings belong to a custom field context? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些屬於 custom field context 的設定？（選兩個）","zo":["欄位是否必填","欄位的 renderer","哪些 screen 顯示欄位","預設值","適用的 issue type 與 project"],"fig":"","opts":["Whether the field is required","The field's renderer","Which screens show the field","Default value","Applicable issue types and projects"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。Required 在 field configuration。","B":"錯。Renderer 在 field configuration。","C":"錯。Screen 另外設定。","D":"對。每個 context 有自己的預設值。","E":"對。Context 決定適用的 issue type 與 project。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-context-to-a-custom-field/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-b14","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A field is on the Bug Create screen and in the context, but users still can't see it when creating Bugs. What else should be checked?","zh":"某欄位已在 Bug 的 Create screen 上、也在 context 中，但使用者建立 Bug 時仍看不到它。還要檢查什麼？","zo":["Bug 使用的 field configuration 是否隱藏了該欄位","欄位名稱是否太長","是否開啟 issue linking","使用者是否是 watcher"],"fig":"","opts":["Whether the field configuration used by Bug hides the field","Whether the field has a long name","Whether issue linking is on","Whether the user is a watcher"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Field configuration 設 Hide 時即使在 screen 上也看不到。","B":"錯。名稱長度無關。","C":"錯。無關。","D":"錯。無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-a-field-configuration/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-b15","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A Jira admin creates a site-wide custom field. What determines whether it appears for issues in a project? (Choose two.)","zh":"Jira admin 建立了全站 custom field。哪些因素決定它是否出現在某 project 的 issue 上？（選兩個）","zo":["Project lead 核准","使用者把它加星號","加到 dashboard","Context 包含該 project 與 issue type","加到該 project 使用的 screen"],"fig":"","opts":["The project lead approves it","Users star it","It's added to a dashboard","Its context includes the project and issue type","It's added to the screens used by that project"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。不需要核准。","B":"錯。無關。","C":"錯。無關。","D":"對。Context 決定欄位是否存在於該 project 與 issue type。","E":"對。要在 screen 上才看得到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-context-to-a-custom-field/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-a-custom-field/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-b16","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team-managed project admin wants a dropdown field for their project only. What is true?","zh":"Team-managed project 的 admin 想要只給自己 project 用的下拉欄位。何者正確？","zo":["欄位會自動共用給其他 team-managed project","在 issue type 的欄位設定建立；它只存在於該 project","必須請 Jira admin 建全站 custom field","需要 field configuration scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["The field is automatically shared with other team-managed projects","They create it in the issue type's field settings; it exists only in that project","They must ask a Jira admin to create a global custom field","They need a field configuration scheme"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不會共用。","B":"對。TMP 建立的欄位只屬於該 project。","C":"錯。可以自己建。","D":"錯。TMP 沒有 field configuration scheme。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-custom-fields-for-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.2-b17","sec":"120.3.2","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A description field shows raw markup like *bold* instead of formatting for one project's Bugs. What is the likely cause?","zh":"某 project 的 Bug 的 description 顯示原始標記（例如 *bold*），而不是格式化文字。可能原因？","zo":["那些 Bug 使用的 field configuration 把 renderer 設成 Default Text 而不是 Wiki Style","欄位沒有 context","使用者缺少 Edit Issues","Issue layout 隱藏了欄位"],"fig":"","opts":["The field configuration used by those Bugs sets the Default Text renderer instead of Wiki Style","The field has no context","The user lacks Edit Issues","The issue layout hides the field"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Renderer 在 field configuration 設定。","B":"錯。沒有 context 就根本看不到。","C":"錯。看得到內容，不是權限問題。","D":"錯。看得到欄位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-a-field-configuration/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"120.3.3-b18","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Which screen does a user see when editing a Bug?","zh":"請看圖。使用者編輯 Bug 時看到哪個 screen？","zo":["Default screen","Bug Create screen","沒有 screen，只能行內編輯","Bug Edit screen"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Issue type screen scheme\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"268.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings → Issues → Screens</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Issue type screen scheme</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue type → Screen scheme</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Bug</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Bug Screen Scheme</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Default</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Default Screen Scheme</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Bug Screen Scheme</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"196\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Create issue</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Bug Create screen</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"222\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"222\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"214\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Edit issue</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"214\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Bug Edit screen</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"248\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"248\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Default</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Default screen</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"268.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Default screen","Bug Create screen","No screen; editing is inline only","Bug Edit screen"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Default 是其他 issue type 用的。","B":"錯。Create 操作才用它。","C":"錯。Edit 操作有對應 screen。","D":"對。Bug 對應 Bug Screen Scheme，其 Edit 操作用 Bug Edit screen。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-issue-screens/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-b19","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A screen scheme defines screens for Create and Edit but not View. Which screen is used for viewing?","zh":"某 screen scheme 為 Create 與 Edit 指定了 screen，但沒指定 View。檢視時用哪個 screen？","zo":["Screen scheme 的 Default screen","Create screen","不顯示任何欄位","Edit screen"],"fig":"","opts":["The screen scheme's Default screen","The Create screen","No fields are shown","The Edit screen"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。沒有特別指定的操作使用 Default 那一列的 screen。","B":"錯。不會借用 Create。","C":"錯。仍有 Default screen。","D":"錯。不會借用 Edit。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-issue-screens/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"120.3.3-b20","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project admin wants the 'Environment' field to appear only when it has a value on Bugs. What should they do in the issue layout?","zh":"Project admin 想讓 Bug 的「Environment」欄位只有在有值時才顯示。在 issue layout 應怎麼做？","zo":["設為必填","放在 context fields 的「Hide when empty」線以下","放到 Hidden fields","從 screen 移除"],"fig":"","opts":["Make it required","Place it below the 'Hide when empty' line in context fields","Put it in Hidden fields","Remove it from the screen"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。必填與顯示時機無關。","B":"對。Hide when empty 以下的欄位沒值時收在 More fields，有值時顯示。","C":"錯。Hidden 永遠不顯示。","D":"錯。會完全不能用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-b21","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which actions require a Jira admin rather than a project admin? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些動作需要 Jira admin，而不是 project admin？（選兩個）","zo":["重新排列 project issue layout 的欄位","在 layout 把欄位移到 Hidden fields","調整 context fields 的順序","在 screen 新增欄位或 tab","把 issue layout 複製到其他 project"],"fig":"","opts":["Rearranging fields in the project's issue layout","Moving a field to Hidden fields in the layout","Reordering context fields","Adding a new field or tab to a screen","Copying an issue layout to other projects"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。Project admin 可以排列。","B":"錯。Project admin 可以隱藏。","C":"錯。Project admin 可以排序。","D":"對。改 screen（欄位與 tab）要 Jira admin。","E":"對。官方：只有 Jira admin 看得到 Copy issue layout。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-issue-layout-to-other-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-b22","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. A Jira admin copies Project A's layout for the 'Software Default Screen' to projects B and C. What is true?","zh":"請看圖。Jira admin 把 Project A 的「Software Default Screen」layout 複製到 B 與 C。何者正確？","zo":["三個 layout 之後保持連動","A 的欄位值被複製到 B 與 C","B 與 C 必須使用相同的 screen，它們的 layout 會被覆蓋","不論 screen 為何都能複製"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 274\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Copy issue layout\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"272.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings → Issue layout</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Copy issue layout</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Screen</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Software Default Screen</text><path d=\"M350,106 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Apply to projects（使用相同 screen）</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M15,157 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Project B</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"171\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M15,178 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Project C</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">會覆蓋所選 project 的 layout</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"224\" width=\"98.5\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"61.25\" y=\"241\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Copy layout</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"272.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["The three layouts stay linked afterward","Field values from A are copied to B and C","B and C must use the same screen, and their layouts are overwritten","Any project can receive it regardless of screen"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不建立連結。","B":"錯。只複製版面，不複製內容。","C":"對。只能複製到使用相同 screen 的 project，會覆蓋對方 layout。","D":"錯。有 screen 條件。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-issue-layout-to-other-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-b23","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Bugs and Tasks share the same view screen. A project admin changes the issue layout for Bugs. What happens to Tasks?","zh":"Bug 與 Task 共用同一個 view screen。Project admin 修改了 Bug 的 issue layout。Task 會怎樣？","zo":["Task 得到一份之後可以分開的副本","Task 也套用相同 layout，因為共用 view screen 的 issue type 會一起設定","Task 不受影響","Task 失去所有欄位"],"fig":"","opts":["Tasks get a copy that can diverge later","Tasks get the same layout, because issue types sharing a view screen are configured together","Tasks are unaffected","Tasks lose all fields"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不是複製，是同一組設定。","B":"對。官方：共用同一個 view screen 的 issue type 會一起設定 layout。","C":"錯。共用 screen 就一起變。","D":"錯。不會失去欄位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.3.3-b24","sec":"120.3.3","dom":"120.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project, where are the fields shown when creating a work item configured?","zh":"在 team-managed project，建立 work item 時顯示哪些欄位，是在哪裡設定？","zo":["Project settings > Issue types，逐一設定每個 issue type","Screen scheme","全站 Screens 頁","Permission scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["In Project settings > Issue types, for each issue type","In a screen scheme","In the global Screens page","In the permission scheme"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。TMP 在 issue type 的欄位設定配置。","B":"錯。TMP 沒有 screen scheme。","C":"錯。TMP 不用全站 screen。","D":"錯。權限無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-an-issues-fields-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-b01","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Users report that the 'Resolve' button doesn't appear on Stories that still have sub-tasks in progress. Which component hides the button?","zh":"請看圖。使用者回報仍有進行中 sub-task 的 Story 看不到「Resolve」按鈕。是哪個元件讓按鈕不出現？","zo":["Field Required validator","Update Issue Field post function","Resolve transition screen","Sub-task Blocking Condition"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 298\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Transition：Resolve\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"296.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Workflow editor</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Transition：Resolve</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Conditions</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"100\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Sub-task Blocking Condition：Done</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Validators</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"151\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-violet\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"170\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Field Required：Fix versions</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"191\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Post functions</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"202\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-green\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"221\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"221\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"213\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Update Issue Field：Resolution = Done</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"213\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"242\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Screen</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"248\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Resolve screen</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"296.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["The Field Required validator","The Update Issue Field post function","The Resolve transition screen","The Sub-task Blocking Condition"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Validator 在提交時才檢查，不會藏按鈕。","B":"錯。Post function 在轉換後執行。","C":"錯。Screen 是轉換時填寫的畫面。","D":"對。Condition 決定按鈕出不出現；Sub-task Blocking Condition 在 sub-task 還沒到 Done 前藏住按鈕。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-sub-tasks/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-b02","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about workflow statuses and boards are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 workflow status 與 board，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["一個 board 欄位不能有多個 status","Status category 與 board 無關","Status 要對應到 board 欄位，issue 才會出現在該 board","最右欄的 issue 在 board 上算完成","CMP 在 workflow 加 status 會自動多出 board 欄位"],"fig":"","opts":["Board columns can't contain multiple statuses","Status category is irrelevant to boards","A status must be mapped to a board column for its issues to appear on that board","Issues in the rightmost column count as done on the board","Adding a status to the workflow automatically adds a board column in company-managed projects"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。一個欄位可以有多個 status。","B":"錯。Status category 影響顏色與報表。","C":"對。未對應的 status 不會出現在 board。","D":"對。最右欄在 board 上代表完成。","E":"錯。CMP 要手動在 board 設定 map。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-b03","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Issues reach 'Closed', but dashboards using 'resolution = Unresolved' still count them. The Close transition has no screen. What should be added?","zh":"Issue 已到「Closed」，但用「resolution = Unresolved」的 dashboard 仍把它們算進去。Close transition 沒有 screen。應加什麼？","zo":["檢查 status 的 validator","Close transition 的 condition","把 Resolution 欄位加到 create screen","在 Close transition 加設定 Resolution 的 post function"],"fig":"","opts":["A validator that checks the status","A condition on the Close transition","The Resolution field on the create screen","A post function on the Close transition that sets the Resolution field"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Validator 不會設值。","B":"錯。Condition 只控制按鈕。","C":"錯。會讓 issue 一建立就被視為已解決。","D":"對。沒有 screen 時，用 post function 在轉換後設 resolution。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-b04","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A workflow status should prevent anyone from editing issues while they wait for legal approval. What should be configured?","zh":"某 workflow status 要讓 issue 在等待法務核准期間不能被任何人編輯。應設定什麼？","zo":["Notification scheme 的 event","Status property：jira.issue.editable = false","轉入該 status 的 validator","從 permission scheme 移除 Edit Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["A notification scheme event","The status property jira.issue.editable = false","A validator on the transition into the status","Remove Edit Issues from the permission scheme"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。通知與編輯權限無關。","B":"對。Status property 讓該 status 的 issue 不能編輯。","C":"錯。Validator 只檢查轉入時的輸入。","D":"錯。會影響所有 status。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-workflow-properties/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-b05","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which belong to a company-managed workflow transition? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些屬於 company-managed workflow 的 transition？（選兩個）","zo":["Issue type schemes","Validators","Post functions","Swimlanes","Quick filters"],"fig":"","opts":["Issue type schemes","Validators","Post functions","Swimlanes","Quick filters"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。不屬於 transition。","B":"對。Transition 可掛 validators。","C":"對。Transition 可掛 post functions（以及 conditions、properties、screen）。","D":"錯。Board 設定。","E":"錯。Board 設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-b06","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When reopening an issue from Done, which post function prevents it from staying 'resolved' in filters?","zh":"從 Done 重新打開 issue 時，哪個 post function 能避免它在 filter 中仍被當作已解決？","zo":["Add a comment","Update Issue Field：Resolution = None","Assign to reporter","Fire Generic Event"],"fig":"","opts":["Add a comment","Update Issue Field: Resolution = None","Assign to reporter","Fire Generic Event"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不影響 resolution。","B":"對。清空 resolution，issue 才會回到未解決。","C":"錯。指派與 resolution 無關。","D":"錯。只觸發通知。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.1-b07","sec":"120.4.1","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A transition should require a comment explaining why a change request is rejected. What is the most direct configuration?","zh":"某 transition 要求使用者填寫拒絕 change request 的理由。最直接的設定是？","zo":["在 Reject transition 加 screen，並用 validator 要求必填留言","加 condition 藏住 Reject","把 Reject 加到 notification scheme","更改 status category"],"fig":"","opts":["Add a screen to the Reject transition with a required comment via validator","Add a condition that hides Reject","Add Reject to the notification scheme","Change the status category"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Transition screen 讓使用者輸入，validator 確保有填。","B":"錯。藏按鈕不能收集理由。","C":"錯。通知不能強制輸入。","D":"錯。Category 與輸入無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-workflow-validators-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"120.4.2-b08","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Which of these rules exist for team-managed workflows? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。下列哪些是 team-managed workflow 實際有的 rule？（選兩個）","zo":["Marketplace app 的 condition","Restrict who can move a work item","Copy the value of one field to another","寄 email 給 reporter","Fire a custom event"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 322\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rules：In review → Done\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"320.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Issue type → Workflow</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Rules：In review → Done</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Restrict</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Restrict who can move a work item</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Restrict to when a work item has been through a status</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Restrict to when a work item is a specific value</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Validate that people have a specific permission</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Update</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"248\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"248\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Assign a work item to someone</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"274\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"274\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Update a work item field</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"300\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Copy the value of one field to another</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"320.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Add a condition from a Marketplace app","Restrict who can move a work item","Copy the value of one field to another","Send an email to the reporter","Fire a custom event"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。不是 TMP 內建 rule。","B":"對。官方 rule 之一。","C":"對。官方 rule 之一。","D":"錯。官方兩頁的 TMP rule 清單都沒有寄信的 rule；通知另在 Notifications 設定。","E":"錯。TMP 沒有 custom event。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.2-b09","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Only issues with Priority = Highest should be allowed through the 'Expedite' transition in a team-managed project. Which rule fits?","zh":"Team-managed project 中，只有 Priority = Highest 的 issue 能走「Expedite」transition。適合哪個 rule？","zo":["Copy the value of one field to another","Restrict to when a work item is a specific value","Restrict who can move a work item","Assign a work item to someone"],"fig":"","opts":["Copy the value of one field to another","Restrict to when a work item is a specific value","Restrict who can move a work item","Assign a work item to someone"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。複製欄位。","B":"對。依欄位值限制 transition。","C":"錯。依人限制。","D":"錯。指派。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.2-b10","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Rejected bugs must never return to the board in a team-managed project. Which rule configuration helps?","zh":"Team-managed project 中，被拒絕的 bug 永遠不能回到 board 流程。哪個 rule 設定能幫忙？","zo":["把 Rejected 值複製到 label","驗證 Browse 權限","對 Rejected status 使用「Restrict to when a work item has been through a status」並勾「Reverse this rule」","把被拒絕的 bug 指派給沒有人"],"fig":"","opts":["Copy the Rejected value to a label","Validate the Browse permission","'Restrict to when a work item has been through a status' with 'Reverse this rule' for the Rejected status","Assign rejected bugs to no one"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不限制流程。","B":"錯。與流程歷史無關。","C":"對。官方：Reverse 可以檢查「沒有經過某 status」，阻止被 rejected 的 issue 回到流程。","D":"錯。指派不限制流程。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.2-b11","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team-managed project admin deletes the 'In design' status, which currently has 12 issues. What happens?","zh":"Team-managed project 的 admin 刪除目前有 12 張 issue 的「In design」status。會怎樣？","zo":["12 張 issue 被刪除","永久無法刪除","Issue 變成未指派","刪除前要選把這些 issue 移到哪個 status"],"fig":"","opts":["The 12 issues are deleted","Deletion is blocked permanently","The issues become unassigned","They choose another status for those issues before deletion"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不會刪 issue。","B":"錯。可以刪，只是要先處理。","C":"錯。與指派無關。","D":"對。刪除 status 時要選把其中的 issue 移到哪個 status。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-statuses-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"120.4.2-b12","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about team-managed workflows are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 team-managed workflow，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Update 類 rule 包含「Update a work item field」","Rule 由 project admin 針對每個 transition 設定","Rule 要 Jira admin 發布","TMP workflow 支援 Marketplace app 的 validator","所有 issue type 必須共用一個 workflow"],"fig":"","opts":["The Update rules include 'Update a work item field'","Rules are configured per transition by the project admin","Rules require a Jira admin to publish","Team-managed workflows support validators from Marketplace apps","All issue types must share one workflow"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。Update 類有更新欄位。","B":"對。Project admin 對每個 transition 加 rule。","C":"錯。不需要 Jira admin。","D":"錯。不是 TMP 的內建能力。","E":"錯。每個 issue type 可以有自己的 workflow。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.2-b13","sec":"120.4.2","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team-managed project needs only the QA role to move issues to Done, and only after they have been In review most recently. How many rules on the Done transition are needed?","zh":"Team-managed project 中，只有 QA role 能把 issue 移到 Done，而且最近一個 status 必須是 In review。Done transition 需要幾條 rule？","zo":["兩條：Restrict who can move（QA role）與 Restrict to when it has been through In review（most recent）","一條：Assign to QA","一條：Copy the value of Status","不需要，用 board 欄位上限"],"fig":"","opts":["Two: Restrict who can move (QA role) and Restrict to when it has been through In review (most recent)","One: Assign to QA","One: Copy the value of Status","None; use a board column limit"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方範例：兩條 restrict rule 組合。","B":"錯。指派不限制誰能移動。","C":"錯。不是複製欄位。","D":"錯。欄位上限不限制人或流程歷史。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-b14","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. When a Story moves to Done, the rule should comment on each linked issue with the Story's key. Which smart value belongs in the comment?","zh":"請看圖。Story 移到 Done 時，rule 要在每個 linked issue 留言並附上 Story 的 key。留言中應使用哪個 smart value？","zo":["{{issue.key}}","{{now}}","{{issue.parent.key}}","{{triggerIssue.key}}"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 257\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rule：Notify linked issues\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"255.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Space settings → Automation</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Rule：Notify linked issues</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"83\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-violet\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"102\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"102\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">When：Work item transitioned → Done</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"109\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"128\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">If：Issue type = Story</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"135\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-teal\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"154\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">For：Linked issues（blocks）</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"161\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"180\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Then：Comment on work item</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"201\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Comment</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"207\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">Story {{ ? }} is done.</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"255.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["{{issue.key}}","{{now}}","{{issue.parent.key}}","{{triggerIssue.key}}"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。在 branch 中指的是 linked issue 本身。","B":"錯。是時間。","C":"錯。是 parent，不是觸發 issue。","D":"對。在 branch 中 {{issue}} 是目前處理的 linked issue，要用 {{triggerIssue}} 取觸發的 Story。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-branches/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/smart-values-in-jira-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-b15","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Who can create automation rules for a single company-managed project by default? (Choose two.)","zh":"預設情況下，誰能為單一 company-managed project 建立 automation rule？（選兩個）","zo":["Jira admin","只有 Browse Projects 的使用者","Customer","只有 Make bulk changes 的使用者","在該 project 有 Administer Projects 與 Browse Projects 的使用者"],"fig":"","opts":["Jira admins","Any user with Browse Projects only","Customers","Users with Make bulk changes only","Users with Administer Projects and Browse Projects in that project"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Jira admin 可以建立任何 scope 的 rule。","B":"錯。只有 Browse 不夠。","C":"錯。不能。","D":"錯。Bulk change 與 automation 無關。","E":"對。官方：CMP 有 Administer＋Browse Projects 的 project admin 預設可以。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-b16","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin wants to stop project admins from creating their own automation rules. Where is this configured?","zh":"Jira admin 想禁止 project admin 自行建立 automation rule。在哪裡設定？","zo":["Global automation > Global configuration：取消「Allow space administrators to manage space flows」","從所有 scheme 移除 Administer Projects","在每個 project 的 Features 停用 automation","刪除 Automation for Jira 使用者"],"fig":"","opts":["Global automation > Global configuration: uncheck 'Allow space administrators to manage space flows'","Remove Administer Projects from all schemes","Disable automation in each project's Features","Delete the Automation for Jira user"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：在 Global automation 的 Global configuration 關閉。","B":"錯。會讓 project admin 失去所有管理能力。","C":"錯。不是在 Features 頁。","D":"錯。會讓所有 rule 壞掉。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-b17","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A rule should run only when all sub-tasks of the parent are Done. Which condition fits?","zh":"Rule 只在 parent 的所有 sub-task 都是 Done 時執行。適合哪個 condition？","zo":["User condition","Reporter 的 JQL condition","Related issues condition：所有 sub-task 符合 status = Done","Parent summary 的 Issue fields condition"],"fig":"","opts":["User condition","JQL condition on the reporter","Related issues condition: all sub-tasks match status = Done","Issue fields condition on the parent's summary"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。檢查使用者。","B":"錯。與 sub-task 無關。","C":"對。Related issues condition 可檢查 sub-task 是否都符合。","D":"錯。與 sub-task 狀態無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-conditions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-b18","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Rule A transitions an issue, and Rule B is triggered by transitions. Rule B never runs after Rule A. What is the most likely reason?","zh":"Rule A 會轉換 issue，Rule B 以 transition 觸發。Rule A 執行後 Rule B 從不執行。最可能的原因？","zo":["Rule B 的 action 太多","Rule A 用錯 project","Transition 不能觸發 rule","Rule B 沒有開啟「Allow rule trigger」"],"fig":"","opts":["Rule B has too many actions","Rule A uses the wrong project","Transitions can't trigger rules","Rule B doesn't have 'Allow rule trigger' enabled"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。與 action 數量無關。","B":"錯。題目沒有這個線索。","C":"錯。Transition 可以觸發 rule。","D":"對。被其他 rule 的動作觸發，需要在 Rule B 開啟 Allow rule trigger。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-b19","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about automation rule scope are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 automation rule 的 scope，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Scope 為 project type 的 rule 會在該類型所有 project 執行","Project admin 可以把 rule scope 設成 global","Scope 只影響通知","Scope 只能是單一 project","Jira admin 可以建立 scope 為多個或全部 project 的 rule"],"fig":"","opts":["A rule scoped to a project type runs across all projects of that type","Project admins can set a rule's scope to global","Scope affects only notifications","Scope can only be single-project","Jira admins can create rules scoped to multiple projects or all projects"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Project type scope 會在該類型所有 project 執行。","B":"錯。Scope 只能由 Jira admin 在 global 層設定。","C":"錯。Scope 影響 rule 在哪裡可以改動資料。","D":"錯。還有 multi-project、project type、global。","E":"對。Jira admin 可以建任何 scope。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.4.3-b20","sec":"120.4.3","dom":"120.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A rule sets the due date to two business days after an issue is created. Which smart value fits?","zh":"Rule 要把 due date 設為 issue 建立後的兩個工作天。哪個 smart value 適合？","zo":["{{now.plusBusinessDays(2)}}","{{now.plusDays(2).business}}","{{issue.due + 2}}","{{#=}}now+2{{/}}"],"fig":"","opts":["{{now.plusBusinessDays(2)}}","{{now.plusDays(2).business}}","{{issue.due + 2}}","{{#=}}now+2{{/}}"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。plusBusinessDays 只算工作天。","B":"錯。不是有效寫法。","C":"錯。不是有效寫法。","D":"錯。數學運算不能這樣處理日期。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-smart-values-date-and-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.1-b01","sec":"120.5.1","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. An issue in this project is commented on by Leo, who is the assignee. Leo hasn't enabled notifications for his own changes. Who receives the 'Issue Commented' email?","zh":"請看圖。這個 project 的某張 issue 由 assignee Leo 留言。Leo 沒有開啟「通知自己的變更」。誰會收到「Issue Commented」email？","zo":["沒人，因為是 assignee 留言","Reporter 與 watchers，但不含 Leo","只有 Leo","只有 project lead"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Notification scheme：Default\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"268.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings → Issues → Notification schemes</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Notification scheme：Default</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue Commented</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Reporter</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Current assignee</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">All watchers</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue Created</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"222\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"222\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"214\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Project lead</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"214\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"248\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"248\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Reporter</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"268.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Nobody, because the assignee commented","The reporter and the watchers, but not Leo","Only Leo","Only the project lead"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。其他收件人仍會收到。","B":"對。Scheme 寄給 reporter、assignee、watchers；Leo 是觸發者且沒開「通知自己的變更」，所以不寄給他。","C":"錯。自己的變更預設不通知自己（依個人設定）。","D":"錯。圖中 Issue Commented 沒有 project lead。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-notification-schemes/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-your-jira-personal-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.1-b02","sec":"120.5.1","dom":"120.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A workflow's 'Escalate' transition still uses the 'Generic Event' post function, so managers aren't notified separately. What should be changed? (Choose two.)","zh":"Workflow 的「Escalate」transition 仍用 Generic Event 的 post function，所以經理沒有收到專屬通知。應修改什麼？（選兩個）","zo":["把 transition 的 post function 改成觸發 custom「Escalated」event","在 notification scheme 把 managers group 加到「Escalated」event","給 managers Administer Projects","手動把經理加為每張 issue 的 watcher","刪除 Generic Event"],"fig":"","opts":["Change the transition's post function to fire a custom 'Escalated' event","Add the managers group to the 'Escalated' event in the notification scheme","Grant managers Administer Projects","Add managers as watchers manually on every issue","Delete the Generic Event"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。讓 transition 觸發專屬的 custom event。","B":"對。在 scheme 為該 event 設收件人。","C":"錯。權限與通知無關。","D":"錯。不切實際。","E":"錯。系統 event 不應刪除，其他 transition 仍在用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-a-custom-event/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.1-b03","sec":"120.5.1","dom":"120.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which recipient types can be used in a company-managed notification scheme? (Choose two.)","zh":"Company-managed 的 notification scheme 可以使用哪些收件人類型？（選兩個）","zo":["Component lead","Board administrator","Sprint owner","Dashboard owner","User custom field value"],"fig":"","opts":["Component lead","Board administrator","Sprint owner","Dashboard owner","User custom field value"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Component lead 是收件人類型之一。","B":"錯。不是收件人類型。","C":"錯。沒有這個類型。","D":"錯。沒有這個類型。","E":"對。可以通知欄位中的使用者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-notification-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.2-b04","sec":"120.5.2","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. In a team-managed project, a work item is deleted. Who is notified?","zh":"請看圖。在 team-managed project 中刪除了一個 work item。誰會收到通知？","zo":["Scrum master role 的成員","所有 watchers","只有 reporter","沒有人"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 269\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Notifications\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"267.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 H106 V268.25 H10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 -10,-10 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"269\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Space settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Notifications</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Work item commented</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">All watchers</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Reporter</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"118\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Work item deleted</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"177\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-violet\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"196\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Role: Scrum master</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"118\" y=\"217\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Work item assigned</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"247\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"247\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Current assignee</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Details</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Access</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"91\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Notifications</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"267.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Members of the Scrum master role","All watchers","The reporter only","Nobody"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。圖中 Work item deleted 的收件人是 Scrum master role。","B":"錯。All watchers 設在 commented。","C":"錯。Reporter 設在 commented。","D":"錯。有設定收件人。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-notifications-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.2-b05","sec":"120.5.2","dom":"120.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which events can trigger notifications in a team-managed project? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些事件可以在 team-managed project 觸發通知？（選兩個）","zo":["Work item 被移動","在 work item 記錄工時","Sprint 完成","Dashboard 被分享","Version 發布"],"fig":"","opts":["A work item is moved","Work is logged on a work item","A sprint is completed","A dashboard is shared","A version is released"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。Moves a work item 是事件之一。","B":"對。Logs work 是事件之一。","C":"錯。不在 TMP 通知事件清單。","D":"錯。不是 issue 事件。","E":"錯。不在清單中。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-notifications-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.2-b06","sec":"120.5.2","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team-managed project wants notification emails to come from design-team@company.com. What is true?","zh":"某 team-managed project 想讓通知 email 從 design-team@company.com 寄出。何者正確？","zo":["Team-managed project 一律用 jira@ 地址","需要 notification scheme","Project admin 可以設定這個 project 的通知寄件 email","只有 org admin 能統一修改所有 project 的寄件地址"],"fig":"","opts":["Team-managed projects always use jira@ addresses","It requires a notification scheme","The project admin can configure the project's notification email address","Only an org admin can change sender addresses for all projects"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。可以自訂。","B":"錯。TMP 沒有 scheme。","C":"對。TMP 可以設定這個 project 的通知寄件 email。","D":"錯。是 project 層級可設。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-notifications-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.3-b07","sec":"120.5.3","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user receives fewer emails than expected and notices updates arrive bundled into one summary email, sometimes minutes later. Why?","zh":"使用者收到的信比預期少，而且更新常被合併成一封摘要信、有時晚幾分鐘才到。為什麼？","zo":["Jira 會合併相關更新並可能延遲最多 10 分鐘","使用者帳號被暫停","Notification scheme 壞了","使用者缺少 Browse users and groups"],"fig":"","opts":["Jira batches related updates and may delay them up to 10 minutes","The user's account is suspended","The notification scheme is broken","The user lacks Browse users and groups"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：零碎更新會合併成摘要信，最多延遲 10 分鐘；mention、指派等重要通知立即寄。","B":"錯。暫停的帳號收不到任何信。","C":"錯。這是正常行為。","D":"錯。與權限無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-your-jira-personal-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.3-b08","sec":"120.5.3","dom":"120.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about personal notification settings are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於個人通知設定，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["個人設定可以在 notification scheme 增加收件人","個人設定可以覆蓋 issue security","使用者不能控制 mention 的通知","使用者最多可針對 50 個 project 客製通知","關掉「Send me emails for work item activity」不會停止 filter subscription 的 email"],"fig":"","opts":["Personal settings can add recipients to the notification scheme","Personal settings override issue security","Users can't control notifications for mentions","A user can customize notifications per project for up to 50 projects","Turning off 'Send me emails for work item activity' doesn't stop filter subscription emails"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。只能過濾自己的通知。","B":"錯。不能繞過權限。","C":"錯。可以選擇 mention 的通知。","D":"對。官方：最多可以針對 50 個 space 客製。","E":"對。官方：filter subscription 等其他 email 仍會寄。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-your-jira-personal-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.3-b09","sec":"120.5.3","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which default setting determines whether new users get notified about their own changes?","zh":"哪個預設設定決定新使用者是否收到自己變更的通知？","zo":["Project 的 default assignee","User default settings 的「Notify users of their own changes」","Notification scheme 的 Current user 收件人","Browse users and groups 全域權限"],"fig":"","opts":["The project's default assignee","'Notify users of their own changes' in user default settings","The notification scheme's Current user recipient","The global permission Browse users and groups"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。無關。","B":"對。User default settings 有這一項，決定新帳號的預設值。","C":"錯。Current user 是收件人類型，不是預設值。","D":"錯。無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-user-default-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.4-b10","sec":"120.5.4","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. An email with subject 'Printer jammed' arrives from someone without a Jira account. What happens?","zh":"請看圖。一封主旨「Printer jammed」的 email 來自沒有 Jira 帳號的人。會怎樣？","zo":["替寄件人建立新的 Jira 帳號","在 OPS 建立新 issue，reporter 是 svc-mail，寄件人地址記在 description","Email 被忽略","加為最新一張 OPS issue 的留言"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mail handler\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"358.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings → System → Incoming mail</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Mail handler</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Handler</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Create a new issue or add a comment</text><path d=\"M350,106 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Project</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">OPS</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue type</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"205\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Task</text><path d=\"M350,216 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Default reporter</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"260\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">svc-mail</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"298\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M15,305 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"309\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Strip quotes</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"319\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">CC assignee</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"358.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["A new Jira account is created for the sender","A new issue is created in OPS with svc-mail as reporter, and the sender's address is noted in the description","The email is ignored","A comment is added to the latest OPS issue"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。圖中沒有建立使用者的設定。","B":"對。主旨沒有 issue key → 建新 issue；寄件人不是使用者 → 用 default reporter，原寄件人寫在 description 末尾。","C":"錯。有 default reporter 就會處理。","D":"錯。主旨沒有 key 不會留言。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-issues-and-comments-from-email/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.4-b11","sec":"120.5.4","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A monitoring system sends automated emails with 'Precedence: bulk' headers, creating loops with Jira notifications. Which mail handler option helps?","zh":"監控系統寄出帶有「Precedence: bulk」標頭的自動信，與 Jira 通知形成迴圈。哪個 mail handler 選項能幫忙？","zo":["開啟 CC watchers","設定 catch email address","更改 issue type","把 Bulk 設為 forward 或 ignore"],"fig":"","opts":["Enable CC watchers","Set a catch email address","Change the issue type","Set Bulk to forward or ignore"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。會更吵。","B":"錯。只過濾收件別名。","C":"錯。無關。","D":"對。官方建議 bulk 信用 forward（或 ignore）避免 Jira 與自動服務之間的郵件迴圈。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-issues-and-comments-from-email/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.5.4-b12","sec":"120.5.4","dom":"120.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Emails older than a certain age aren't processed by the mail handler. What is the limit?","zh":"超過一定天數的 email 不會被 mail handler 處理。上限是多少？","zo":["24 小時","30 天","沒有限制","7 天"],"fig":"","opts":["24 hours","30 days","There is no limit","7 days"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。不是 24 小時。","B":"錯。不是 30 天。","C":"錯。有限制。","D":"對。官方：寄件日期不能超過 7 天。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-issues-and-comments-from-email/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.1-b01","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL finds issues that moved to 'Blocked' at any time in the last 30 days?","zh":"哪段 JQL 能找出過去 30 天內任何時候被轉到「Blocked」的 issue？","zo":["status IN (Blocked) AFTER -30d","status CHANGED TO Blocked AFTER -30d","status = Blocked AND updated >= -30d","status WAS Blocked"],"fig":"","opts":["status IN (Blocked) AFTER -30d","status CHANGED TO Blocked AFTER -30d","status = Blocked AND updated >= -30d","status WAS Blocked"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。IN 不能接 AFTER。","B":"對。CHANGED TO 搭配 AFTER 限定時間。","C":"錯。只找目前是 Blocked 且最近有更新的。","D":"錯。沒有時間範圍。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.1-b02","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL returns unresolved issues with no assignee in the HR project, newest first?","zh":"哪段 JQL 能找出 HR project 中沒有 assignee、未解決的 issue，並以最新建立的在前？","zo":["project = HR AND assignee IS EMPTY AND resolution = Unresolved ORDER BY created DESC","project = HR AND assignee = none ORDER BY created","project = HR AND assignee != currentUser() ORDER BY created DESC","project = HR AND status != Done AND assignee ~ EMPTY"],"fig":"","opts":["project = HR AND assignee IS EMPTY AND resolution = Unresolved ORDER BY created DESC","project = HR AND assignee = none ORDER BY created","project = HR AND assignee != currentUser() ORDER BY created DESC","project = HR AND status != Done AND assignee ~ EMPTY"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。IS EMPTY 找沒有值，resolution = Unresolved 找未解決，DESC 讓最新在前。","B":"錯。不是正確的空值寫法，排序也是舊的在前。","C":"錯。會包含指派給別人的 issue。","D":"錯。~ 是文字比對；status != Done 也不等於未解決。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.1-b03","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which JQL statements are valid? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些 JQL 敘述是有效的？（選兩個）","zo":["project == OPS","fixVersion IN unreleasedVersions()","sprint IN openSprints()","assignee IN currentUser","created >= startOfWeek("],"fig":"","opts":["project == OPS","fixVersion IN unreleasedVersions()","sprint IN openSprints()","assignee IN currentUser","created >= startOfWeek("],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。JQL 沒有 == 運算子。","B":"對。unreleasedVersions() 回傳未發布的版本。","C":"對。openSprints() 回傳進行中的 sprint。","D":"錯。currentUser 要有括號。","E":"錯。括號沒有關閉。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.1-b04","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. A manager wants WEB issues that are either Highest priority or labeled 'urgent'. The results also include urgent issues from other projects. What should be changed?","zh":"請看圖。經理要找 WEB 裡「priority 為 Highest 或有 urgent label」的 issue，結果卻也出現其他 project 的 urgent issue。應該怎麼改？","zo":["加括號：project = WEB AND (priority = Highest OR labels = urgent)","把 labels = urgent 改成 labels IN (urgent)","加上 ORDER BY priority DESC","改用 basic search 執行"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 185\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Search\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"183.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Filters</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Search</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">JQL</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">project = WEB AND priority = Highest OR labels =</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"129\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">urgent</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">結果：MOBILE、TEAM 的 urgent issue 也出現了</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"183.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Add parentheses: project = WEB AND (priority = Highest OR labels = urgent)","Use labels IN (urgent) instead of labels = urgent","Add ORDER BY priority DESC","Run the query in basic search instead"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。沒有括號時這句等於 (project = WEB AND priority = Highest) OR labels = urgent；加括號才把 OR 限定在 WEB 裡。官方：沒有括號時由左到右計算。","B":"錯。labels IN (urgent) 與 labels = urgent 意思相同，問題在分組。","C":"錯。排序不影響結果集合。","D":"錯。Basic search 不能跨欄位 OR，也不能用括號。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.1-b05","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL finds issues resolved this week by anyone in the 'qa' group?","zh":"哪段 JQL 能找出本週由「qa」group 成員解決的 issue？","zo":["resolved >= startOfWeek() AND assignee IN membersOf(\"qa\")","resolved = thisWeek() AND group = qa","resolution = Done AND assignee = qa","resolved >= -7d AND reporter IN qa"],"fig":"","opts":["resolved >= startOfWeek() AND assignee IN membersOf(\"qa\")","resolved = thisWeek() AND group = qa","resolution = Done AND assignee = qa","resolved >= -7d AND reporter IN qa"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。startOfWeek() 是本週開始；membersOf 取 group 成員。","B":"錯。沒有 thisWeek() 與 group 欄位。","C":"錯。qa 是 group 不是使用者，也沒有時間範圍。","D":"錯。-7d 不等於本週；reporter IN qa 語法錯誤。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.1-b06","sec":"120.6.1","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user needs a filter showing issues linked to OPS-12. Which JQL fits?","zh":"使用者需要一個 filter，顯示與 OPS-12 有連結的 issue。哪段 JQL 適合？","zo":["issue IN linkedIssues(\"OPS-12\")","linked = OPS-12","issueLink ~ \"OPS-12\"","parent = OPS-12"],"fig":"","opts":["issue IN linkedIssues(\"OPS-12\")","linked = OPS-12","issueLink ~ \"OPS-12\"","parent = OPS-12"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。linkedIssues() 回傳與該 issue 連結的 issue。","B":"錯。沒有這個欄位寫法。","C":"錯。不是正確語法。","D":"錯。Parent 是階層關係，不是 link。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.2-b07","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A subscribed filter returns 650 issues. What do recipients receive?","zh":"某被訂閱的 filter 回傳 650 筆 issue。收件人會收到什麼？","zo":["收不到信，因為上限是 500","附上全部結果的 CSV","一封只列出前 200 筆結果的 email","全部 650 筆"],"fig":"","opts":["No email, because the limit is 500","A CSV attachment with all results","An email listing only the first 200 results","All 650 issues"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。仍會寄出。","B":"錯。不是 CSV 附件。","C":"對。官方：訂閱信只寄出 filter 的前 200 筆結果。","D":"錯。有上限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.2-b08","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. The filter owner shares the filter with the 'sales' group as viewers. Leo in sales lacks Browse permission for the FIN project. What does Leo see when he runs the filter?","zh":"請看圖。Filter 擁有者把 filter 分享給「sales」group 當 viewer。Sales 的 Leo 沒有 FIN project 的 Browse 權限。Leo 執行 filter 會看到什麼？","zo":["錯誤訊息、沒有結果","只有 filter 名稱","只有他能瀏覽的 project 的 issue，FIN 的被排除","包含 FIN 的全部結果"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 247\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Filter details：Open deals\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"245.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Filters</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Filter details：Open deals</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">JQL</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">project IN (CRM, FIN) AND status != Closed</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Viewers</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"174\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Group: sales</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Editors</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"225\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"225\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"217\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Owner only</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"217\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"245.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["An error and no results","Only the filter name","Only issues from projects he can browse; FIN issues are excluded","All results including FIN"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不會報錯，只是少了 FIN。","B":"錯。可以執行。","C":"對。分享 filter 不會給看 issue 的權限；每人只看到自己有權限的結果。","D":"錯。不會越權。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.2-b09","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about filter subscriptions are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 filter subscription，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Group 訂閱會寄給每個人相同的結果","訂閱會改變 filter 的分享權限","使用者可以替自己訂閱任何看得到的 filter","選 Advanced 排程時，用 cron 表達式控制頻率","訂閱只能每週一次"],"fig":"","opts":["Group subscriptions send identical results to everyone","Subscribing changes the filter's sharing permissions","A user can subscribe themselves to any filter they can view","With Advanced scheduling, a cron expression controls the frequency","Subscriptions can only be weekly"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。結果依每位收件人計算。","B":"錯。不影響分享設定。","C":"對。官方：可以為自己建立任何頻率的訂閱。","D":"對。Advanced 用 cron 表達式。","E":"錯。可每日、每週、每月或 cron。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.2-b10","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin wants to stop anyone from sharing new filters and dashboards publicly, but existing public shares already exist. What is true?","zh":"Jira admin 想禁止任何人再把 filter 與 dashboard 公開分享，但目前已經有公開分享的項目。何者正確？","zo":["只有 project admin 能控制","在 general configuration 關閉 public sharing 可防止新的公開分享，但不會收回既有的","關閉後會自動收回所有既有公開分享","公開分享無法控制"],"fig":"","opts":["Only project admins can control it","Turning off public sharing in general configuration prevents new public shares but doesn't revoke existing ones","Turning it off revokes all existing public shares automatically","Public sharing can't be controlled"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。是 Jira admin 的全站設定。","B":"對。關閉後只防止新的公開分享，已分享的要另外處理。","C":"錯。不會自動收回。","D":"錯。可以控制。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/prevent-or-remove-public-access/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":1},{"id":"120.6.2-b11","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A support manager wants a dashboard that shows each viewer their own open issues. Which filter should the gadget use?","zh":"Support manager 想要一個 dashboard，讓每位檢視者看到自己的未完成 issue。gadget 應該用哪個 filter？","zo":["assignee = currentUser() AND resolution = Unresolved","assignee = \"support-manager\" AND resolution = Unresolved","reporter = currentUser()","assignee IS EMPTY"],"fig":"","opts":["assignee = currentUser() AND resolution = Unresolved","assignee = \"support-manager\" AND resolution = Unresolved","reporter = currentUser()","assignee IS EMPTY"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。currentUser() 依檢視者計算，每人看到自己的 issue。","B":"錯。固定是主管本人。","C":"錯。那是自己回報的，不是指派給自己的。","D":"錯。那是沒有 assignee 的。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.2-b12","sec":"120.6.2","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can change the owner of another user's saved filter?","zh":"誰能變更其他使用者已存 filter 的擁有者？","zo":["Filter 的任何 viewer","Project lead","任何有 Browse users and groups 的使用者","Jira admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Any viewer of the filter","The project lead","Any user with Browse users and groups","A Jira admin"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Viewer 不能。","B":"錯。不能。","C":"錯。不能。","D":"對。官方：要 Jira admin 才能改 filter 的擁有者。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.3-b13","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. The selected issues come from OPS and HR. Why isn't 'Change Component/s' available in bulk edit?","zh":"請看圖。選取的 issue 來自 OPS 與 HR。為什麼 bulk edit 沒有「Change Component/s」？","zo":["Components 需要 Administer Jira","只有選取的 issue 都屬於同一個有 components 的 project 時，才能 bulk 編輯 components","Components 預設對 bulk edit 隱藏","使用者缺少 Browse users and groups"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 223\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Bulk operation：Edit\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"221.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Search → Bulk change</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Bulk operation：Edit</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">已選 38 個 issue（OPS 20、HR 18）</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Choose fields to edit</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"119\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M15,126 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Change Priority</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"140\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Change Assignee</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"161\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Change Component/s（無法使用）</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"182\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"193\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Send mail for this update</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"221.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Components require Administer Jira","Components can only be bulk-edited when all selected issues belong to one project that has components","Components are hidden for bulk edit by default","The user lacks Browse users and groups"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。不需要。","B":"對。官方條件：選取的 issue 都屬於同一個 project，且該 project 有 components。","C":"錯。不是預設隱藏。","D":"錯。無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.3-b14","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A user wants to bulk-change the Reporter of 50 issues. Which permissions are required? (Choose two.)","zh":"使用者想 bulk 修改 50 張 issue 的 Reporter。需要哪些權限？（選兩個）","zo":["Delete Issues","Manage watchers","Edit Issues","Modify Reporter","Administer Jira"],"fig":"","opts":["Delete Issues","Manage watchers","Edit Issues","Modify Reporter","Administer Jira"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。無關。","B":"錯。無關。","C":"對。官方：需要 edit work item 權限。","D":"對。也需要 modify reporter 權限（以及 Make bulk changes）。","E":"錯。不需要。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.3-b15","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Issues from two projects with different issue security schemes are selected. Why can't the user bulk-change the Security Level?","zh":"選取的 issue 來自兩個使用不同 issue security scheme 的 project。為什麼使用者不能 bulk 修改 Security Level？","zo":["Security Level 永遠不能 bulk 編輯","使用者必須是 project lead","Bulk edit 上限 100 個 issue","所有選取的 project 必須使用相同的 issue security scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Security Level can never be bulk-edited","The user must be a project lead","Bulk edit is limited to 100 issues","All selected projects must use the same issue security scheme"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。符合條件就可以。","B":"錯。無關。","C":"錯。上限是 1,000。","D":"對。官方條件：所有選取的 project 使用相同的 issue security scheme（並要有 Set Issue Security）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.3-b16","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After bulk-moving issues from a company-managed to a team-managed project, a custom field 'Customer ID' appears blank. What is true?","zh":"把 issue 從 company-managed bulk move 到 team-managed project 後，custom field「Customer ID」顯示空白。何者正確？","zo":["值仍然儲存，只是 TMP 的欄位是另一套所以顯示空白","值被永久刪除","Issue 移動失敗","Custom field 一定會帶著可見的值移過去"],"fig":"","opts":["The value is still stored but appears blank because the team-managed project's fields are separate","The value was permanently deleted","The issues failed to move","Custom fields always move with values visible"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：global custom field 的資料保留在 issue 上，但 TMP 的欄位是另一套，所以顯示空白（components、versions 除外，那些會遺失）。","B":"錯。不是永久刪除。","C":"錯。移動成功。","D":"錯。會顯示空白。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/migrate-between-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.3-b17","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which data is lost when issues move from a company-managed Scrum project to a team-managed project? (Choose two.)","zh":"Issue 從 company-managed Scrum project 移到 team-managed project 時，哪些資料會遺失？（選兩個）","zo":["Issue summary","留言","附件","Story points 估計","Sprint 歷史（issue 會進 backlog）"],"fig":"","opts":["Issue summaries","Comments","Attachments","Story points estimates","Sprint history (issues go to the backlog)"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。會保留。","B":"錯。會保留。","C":"錯。會保留。","D":"對。官方：story points 會遺失，要在 TMP 開 Estimation 重新估。","E":"對。官方：sprint 不會搬過去，issue 進到 backlog。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/migrate-between-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.6.3-b18","sec":"120.6.3","dom":"120.6","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Bulk-editing closed issues fails for some fields. What is the most likely reason?","zh":"Bulk 編輯已關閉的 issue 時，有些欄位失敗。最可能的原因？","zo":["使用者缺少 Browse Projects","Workflow 不允許編輯 closed issue","搜尋不到 closed issue","Bulk edit 要求所有 issue 都是開啟中"],"fig":"","opts":["The user lacks Browse Projects","The workflow doesn't allow editing closed issues","Closed issues can't be selected in search","Bulk edit requires all issues to be open"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。沒有 Browse 根本看不到。","B":"對。官方：要編輯 closed issue，workflow 必須允許（例如 jira.issue.editable）。","C":"錯。搜尋得到。","D":"錯。條件是 workflow 允許，不是一定要開啟中。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.1-b01","sec":"120.7.1","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. A Jira admin publishes this announcement banner. Who sees it?","zh":"請看圖。Jira admin 發布了這則 announcement banner。誰看得到？","zo":["所有人，含匿名訪客","只有 Jira admin","沒有關掉它的使用者（含匿名訪客）","只有內部授權使用者"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 314\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Announcement banner\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"312.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings → System</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Announcement banner</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Message</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">週六 22:00–24:00 系統維護</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Background color</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Yellow – Warning</text><path d=\"M350,161 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Allow users to dismiss</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"205\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"214\" r=\"6.5\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">關</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"246\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Target audience</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"259\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Public</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"280\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"280\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Private</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"312.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Everyone, including anonymous visitors","Only Jira admins","Only users who haven't dismissed it, including anonymous visitors","Only internal licensed users"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。那是 Public。","B":"錯。不限 admin。","C":"錯。Private 不含匿名訪客；而且圖中沒有開放關閉。","D":"對。Target audience 為 Private（預設）時只有內部授權使用者看得到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-announcement-banners/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.1-b02","sec":"120.7.1","dom":"120.7","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which settings are part of Jira's user default settings? (Choose two.)","zh":"哪些屬於 Jira 的 user default settings？（選兩個）","zo":["新 filter 與 dashboard 的預設分享（Public 或 Private）","Autowatch own work items","預設 project category","Issue security level","Board 欄位上限"],"fig":"","opts":["Default access for new filters and dashboards (Public or Private)","Autowatch own work items","Default project category","Issue security level","Board column limits"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。Default access 決定新 filter 與 dashboard 預設分享方式。","B":"對。Autowatch own work items 是預設項目之一。","C":"錯。不是使用者預設。","D":"錯。不是使用者預設。","E":"錯。是 board 設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-user-default-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.1-b03","sec":"120.7.1","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Anonymous visitors to a public project shouldn't see the default dashboard anymore. What should the Jira admin change?","zh":"公開 project 的匿名訪客不應再看到 default dashboard。Jira admin 應修改什麼？","zo":["移除所有 gadget","停用 announcement banner","把 default dashboard 的分享從 Public 改成「My organization」","刪除 default dashboard"],"fig":"","opts":["Remove all gadgets","Disable the announcement banner","Share the default dashboard with 'My organization' instead of Public","Delete the default dashboard"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。仍然看得到 dashboard。","B":"錯。無關。","C":"對。官方：default dashboard 可以分享給 My organization 或 Public；選 organization 匿名者就看不到。","D":"錯。Default dashboard 不能刪除。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-default-dashboard/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.1-b04","sec":"120.7.1","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin wants the company logo in the top-left of every Jira page and the site title next to it. Where is this configured?","zh":"Jira admin 想在每頁左上角顯示公司 logo，旁邊顯示站名。在哪裡設定？","zo":["Project settings > Details","User default settings","Personal settings","Settings > System > Look and feel"],"fig":"","opts":["Project settings > Details","User default settings","Personal settings","Settings > System > Look and feel"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。那是單一 project 的 avatar。","B":"錯。不是外觀。","C":"錯。只影響個人。","D":"對。Logo、site title、favicon、導覽顏色都在 Look and feel。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-look-and-feel-of-jira-applications/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.2-b05","sec":"120.7.2","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. An issue has an original estimate of '2d'. What does '2d' represent in hours with these settings?","zh":"請看圖。某 issue 的 original estimate 是「2d」。在這組設定下，「2d」等於幾小時？","zo":["48 小時","10 小時","12 小時","16 小時"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 310\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Time tracking\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"308.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings → Work items → Time tracking</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Time tracking</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working hours per day</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">6</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days per week</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">5</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Time display format</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"205\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Pretty</text><path d=\"M350,216 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Default unit</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"260\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Minute</text><path d=\"M350,271 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"308.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["48 hours","10 hours","12 hours","16 hours"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不是日曆天。","B":"錯。換算錯誤。","C":"對。每天 6 小時，2d＝12 小時。","D":"錯。那是每天 8 小時的換算。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.2-b06","sec":"120.7.2","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Users log '90' as time spent without a unit, and Jira records 1h 30m. Which setting explains this?","zh":"使用者記工時只輸入「90」沒寫單位，Jira 記為 1h 30m。是哪個設定造成的？","zo":["Working hours per day 設為 8","Time display format 設為 Hours","Copying of comments to work description","Default unit 設為 Minute"],"fig":"","opts":["Working hours per day set to 8","Time display format set to Hours","Copying of comments to work description","Default unit set to Minute"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。與沒寫單位的換算無關。","B":"錯。只影響顯示格式。","C":"錯。與單位無關。","D":"對。沒寫單位時使用 Default unit；設成 Minute，90 就是 90 分鐘。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.2-b07","sec":"120.7.2","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira admin creates a link type with name 'Blocks', outward description 'blocks', and inward description 'is blocked by'. What does a user see on the other issue after linking A blocks B?","zh":"Jira admin 建立 link type：名稱「Blocks」、outward description「blocks」、inward description「is blocked by」。使用者設定「A blocks B」後，在 B 上會看到什麼？","zo":["B 顯示「blocks A」","兩邊都顯示「Blocks」","B 沒有顯示","B 顯示「is blocked by A」"],"fig":"","opts":["B shows 'blocks A'","Both show 'Blocks'","B shows nothing","B shows 'is blocked by A'"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。那是 A 這一方看到的。","B":"錯。顯示的是描述，不是名稱。","C":"錯。雙方都看得到連結。","D":"對。被連結的一方顯示 inward description。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-linking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.3-b08","sec":"120.7.3","dom":"120.7","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A Jira admin renames the resolution 'Won't Fix' to 'Won't Do'. What is the impact? (Choose two.)","zh":"Jira admin 把 resolution「Won't Fix」改名為「Won't Do」。影響為何？（選兩個）","zo":["Issue 會失去 resolution","所有使用該 resolution 的 project 都顯示新名稱","既有 issue 保留原值，只是名稱改了","只有新 issue 會用新名稱","引用它的已存 filter 失效"],"fig":"","opts":["Issues lose their resolution","All projects using that resolution show the new name","Existing issues keep their resolution value under the new name","Only new issues get the new name","Saved filters referencing it break"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。不會失去 resolution。","B":"對。Resolution 是全站物件。","C":"對。值不變，只是名稱改了。","D":"錯。既有 issue 也顯示新名稱。","E":"錯。不會讓 filter 失效。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-statuses-priorities-and-resolutions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.3-b09","sec":"120.7.3","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project, the project admin renames the status 'Review' to 'QA review'. Which projects are affected?","zh":"Team-managed project 的 project admin 把 status「Review」改名為「QA review」。哪些 project 受影響？","zo":["所有 team-managed project","要等 Jira admin 核准才受影響","只有該 team-managed project","所有使用「Review」status 的 project"],"fig":"","opts":["All team-managed projects","None until a Jira admin approves","Only that team-managed project","Every project using a 'Review' status"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。各 TMP 獨立。","B":"錯。不需要核准。","C":"對。TMP 的 status 屬於該 project。","D":"錯。CMP 的 status 才是全站共用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-statuses-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.4-b10","sec":"120.7.4","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can import a Jira Cloud backup file to restore the site, according to Atlassian's backup and restore training?","zh":"依 Atlassian 的 backup 與 restore 訓練課程，誰能匯入 Jira Cloud backup 檔來還原站台？","zo":["任何 project admin","任何有 Make bulk changes 的使用者","Organization admin","任何 Jira admin"],"fig":"","opts":["Any project admin","Any user with Make bulk changes","An organization admin","Any Jira admin"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Project admin 不能。","B":"錯。與 bulk change 無關。","C":"對。官方 Learning 課程：org admin 可以建立與匯入 backup；Jira admin 只能建立 backup。","D":"錯。Jira admin 只能建立 backup 檔。"},"note":"","src":["https://community.atlassian.com/learning/lesson/jira-cloud-backup-and-restore"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.4-b11","sec":"120.7.4","dom":"120.7","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A team migrates from Trello. What does the Trello importer create, and who can run it? (Choose two.)","zh":"團隊要從 Trello 搬過來。Trello importer 會建立什麼？誰能執行？（選兩個）","zo":["任何 project admin 都能執行","會覆蓋整個 Jira 站台","每個 Trello board 建一個 team-managed project","必須由 organization admin 執行","所有 board 合成一個 company-managed project"],"fig":"","opts":["It can be run by any project admin","It overwrites the whole Jira site","A team-managed project for each Trello board","It must be run by an organization admin","One company-managed project for all boards"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。需要 org admin。","B":"錯。不會覆蓋整站。","C":"對。官方：匯入時每個 board 建一個 team-managed space。","D":"對。官方：要 org admin 才能從 Trello 匯入。","E":"錯。不是所有 board 合成一個 CMP。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/import-data-from-trello/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.4-b12","sec":"120.7.4","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A CSV file includes a 'Work Item Key' column with existing keys like OPS-12. What happens during a CSV import?","zh":"CSV 檔有「Work Item Key」欄，內容是既有的 key（例如 OPS-12）。CSV 匯入時會怎樣？","zo":["匯入失敗","覆蓋整個站台","更新那些 key 已存在的 issue","一律建立重複的新 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["The import fails","The whole site is overwritten","Existing issues with those keys are updated","New duplicate issues are always created"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不會失敗。","B":"錯。CSV 匯入不會覆蓋整站。","C":"對。官方：某個 key 的 issue 已存在時會被更新。","D":"錯。不會一律重複建立。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/import-data-from-a-csv-file/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.4-b13","sec":"120.7.4","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An admin wants to import only the PAYROLL project from a full Jira Cloud backup into a site that already has other active projects. What is true?","zh":"Admin 想從完整的 Jira Cloud backup 只匯入 PAYROLL project 到一個已有其他運作中 project 的站台。何者正確？","zo":["在 Backup manager 的匯入畫面勾選 PAYROLL","選擇性匯入無法在保留現有資料的同時只匯入特定 project；請改用 CSV 等方式","編輯 backup 檔只保留 PAYROLL","Backup 匯入會自動合併 PAYROLL"],"fig":"","opts":["Select PAYROLL in the Backup manager import screen","Selective import can't import a specific project while keeping existing site data; use another method such as CSV","Edit the backup file to keep only PAYROLL","The backup importer merges PAYROLL automatically"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。沒有這種選項。","B":"對。官方 KB：無法只匯入特定 project 又保留現有站台資料；調整 backup 只能選要不要匯入資料庫、附件、avatar、logo。","C":"錯。不能這樣選擇性匯入 project。","D":"錯。完整 backup 匯入會覆蓋整站。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/atlassian-cloud/kb/partial-or-selective-import-of-a-jira-backup-export-into-jira-cloud/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0},{"id":"120.7.4-b14","sec":"120.7.4","dom":"120.7","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. An admin created a backup including attachments yesterday at 18:00. Today at 09:00 they try again with the shown option. What happens?","zh":"請看圖。Admin 昨天 18:00 建立了含附件的 backup，今天 09:00 又勾選圖中選項想再建一次。結果？","zo":["自動略過附件","上一份 backup 被刪除","要等距離上次含附件的 backup 滿 48 小時","立即執行"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Backup manager\"><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"196.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><path d=\"M0.75,34 V10.75 a10,10 0 0 1 10,-10 H369.25 a10,10 0 0 1 10,10 V34 Z\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings → System</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Backup manager</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Backup for cloud</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">上一次（含附件）：昨天 18:00</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"119\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M15,126 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Include work item attachments, avatars, and logos</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"148\" width=\"188.5\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"106.25\" y=\"165\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Create backup for cloud</text><rect x=\"0.75\" y=\"0.75\" width=\"378.5\" height=\"196.5\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\" style=\"fill:none\"/></svg>","opts":["Attachments are silently skipped","The previous backup is deleted","They must wait until 48 hours have passed since the last backup with attachments","The backup runs immediately"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。不會自動略過。","B":"錯。不會因此刪除舊 backup。","C":"對。官方：包含附件、avatar、logo 時，兩次 backup 至少間隔 48 小時。","D":"錯。含附件有間隔限制。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/export-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1,"inf":0}];